            "intel": {
              "summary": "* [Company][1]\n  \n  In 1963, Alfred Vogel established Bioforce AG (now A.Vogel AG) in Roggwil, Switzerland, to meet\n  the increasing demand for his natural health products. Today, A.Vogel AG is a leading manufacturer\n  of phytotherapeutic and health food products, distributing to over 25 countries worldwide.\n  \n  [Learn more][2]\n  * [Our values][3]\n  * [Facts & figures][4]\n  * [Global][5]\n  * [History][6]\n  * [Mission][7]\n  * [Visit us][8]\n* [Fields of health][9]\n  \n  A.Vogel promotes natural health with remedies for cold and flu, iImmune support, men's and women's\n  health, and mental health. It also supports a healthy lifestyle with products like herbal\n  seasoning salt, combining nutrition and flavor. Committed to science and education, A.Vogel\n  empowers holistic well-being naturally.\n  \n  [Learn more][10]\n  * [Fields of health][11]\n  * [Immune system][12]\n  * [Cold & flu][13]\n  * [Women's Health][14]\n  * [Men's Health][15]\n  * [Sleep & stress][16]\n  * [Muscles & joints][17]\n  * [Food][18]\n* [Media][19]\n  \n  The media section offers resources for journalists and partners, including the latest news, press\n  kits, and publications on natural health. It serves as a central hub for reliable, up-to-date\n  information.\n  \n  [Learn more][20]\n  * [Media][21]\n  * [Latest news][22]\n  * [Media center][23]\n  * [Publications][24]\n* [Responsibility][25]\n  \n  At A.Vogel, we act sustainably to protect people, plants, and the planet. From organic cultivation\n  to resource-efficient production, we prioritize eco-friendly practices, fair partnerships, and\n  global health education to create a healthier, sustainable future.\n  \n  [Learn more][26]\n  * [Code of conduct][27]\n  * [Sustainability report][28]\n* [Career][29]\n  \n  Join A.Vogel and contribute to natural health and sustainability. We offer a dynamic workplace\n  where innovation meets tradition. Explore job openings and grow with us while making a global\n  impact on well-being.\n  \n  [Learn more][30]\n  * [Join us][31]\n  * [Contact us][32]\n\n\n# Trusted for 70 Years - Echinaforce^{® }\n\n[Explore more][33]\n\"Nature was my best loved university.\"\n[Alfred Vogel with a Typewriter in the snow]\n\n### Alfred Vogel's passion for plants and science\n\nMore than 100 years ago, in 1923 Alfred Vogel started our journey with his first health food and\nherbal medicine store in Basel, Switzerland. He moved later to Teufen, Appenzell to start the\nA.Vogel company and, to meet the growing demand for his products, he founded 1963 the Bioforce AG\n(now A.Vogel AG) in Roggwil, Switzerland. Vogel's mission was to offer natural remedies grounded in\nscience, a selection of healthy food products, and reliable health information through books and a\nmonthly magazine, making natural health accessible to an ever-increasing number of people.\n\n### Unveil the secrets of nature\n\nThe basis of the A.Vogel health brand is the credo of our founder, the Swiss pioneer of natural\nhealth Alfred Vogel (1902-1996) who said; \"Nature was my best loved university.\"\n\nFresh, organically grown herbs form the foundation for the effective, scientifically proven herbal\nmedicines.\n\n[Our mission][34]\n\n## Our products\n\nA.Vogel remedies, nutritional products, and health information are available in many countries, and\nwe strive to make them easily accessible.\n\n[Explore more][35]\n\n## Mission Statement\n\nWe offer high-quality herbal remedies, supplements, and health services to support well-being. We\nprioritize sustainability, ethical practices, and the health of both our customers and employees.\n\n[Explore more][36]\n\n## Switzerland\n\nA.Vogel is Switzerland's largest producers of herbal remedies and health food products. We combine\nAlfred Vogel's recipes with reliable health advice, with products available at physicians, in\npharmacies, health food shops, and supermarkets.\n\n[Grüezi][37]\n\n## International\n\nA.Vogel is a globally recognized brand, generating a turnover of 115 million Swiss Francs with its\nproducts available in 30 countries. The company employs a"
            }
          },
          "page_text": "* [Company][1] In 1963, Alfred Vogel established Bioforce AG (now A.Vogel AG) in Roggwil, Switzerland, to meet the increasing demand for his natural health products. Today, A.Vogel AG is a leading manufacturer of phytotherapeutic and health food products, distributing to over 25 countries worldwide. [Learn more][2] * [Our values][3] * [Facts & figures][4] * [Global][5] * [History][6] * [Mission][7] * [Visit us][8] * [Fields of health][9] A.Vogel promotes natural health with remedies for cold and flu, iImmune support, men's and women's health, and mental health. It also supports a healthy lifestyle with products like herbal seasoning salt, combining nutrition and flavor. Committed to science and education, A.Vogel empowers holistic well-being naturally. [Learn more][10] * [Fields of health][11] * [Immune system][12] * [Cold & flu][13] * [Women's Health][14] * [Men's Health][15] * [Sleep & stress][16] * [Muscles & joints][17] * [Food][18] * [Media][19] The media section offers resources for journalists and partners, including the latest news, press kits, and publications on natural health. It serves as a central hub for reliable, up-to-date information. [Learn more][20] * [Media][21] * [Latest news][22] * [Media center][23] * [Publications][24] * [Responsibility][25] At A.Vogel, we act sustainably to protect people, plants, and the planet. From organic cultivation to resource-efficient production, we prioritize eco-friendly practices, fair partnerships, and global health education to create a healthier, sustainable future. [Learn more][26] * [Code of conduct][27] * [Sustainability report][28] * [Career][29] Join A.Vogel and contribute to natural health and sustainability. We offer a dynamic workplace where innovation meets tradition. Explore job openings and grow with us while making a global impact on well-being. [Learn more][30] * [Join us][31] * [Contact us][32] # Trusted for 70 Years - Echinaforce^{® } [Explore more][33] \"Nature was my best loved university.\" [Alfred Vogel with a Typewriter in the snow] ### Alfred Vogel's passion for plants and science More than 100 years ago, in 1923 Alfred Vogel started our journey with his first health food and herbal medicine store in Basel, Switzerland. He moved later to Teufen, Appenzell to start the A.Vogel company and, to meet the growing demand for his products, he founded 1963 the Bioforce AG (now A.Vogel AG) in Roggwil, Switzerland. Vogel's mission was to offer natural remedies grounded in science, a selection of healthy food products, and reliable health information through books and a monthly magazine, making natural health accessible to an ever-increasing number of people. ### Unveil the secrets of nature The basis of the A.Vogel health brand is the credo of our founder, the Swiss pioneer of natural health Alfred Vogel (1902-1996) who said; \"Nature was my best loved university.\" Fresh, organically grown herbs form the foundation for the effective, scientifically proven herbal medicines. [Our mission][34] ## Our products A.Vogel remedies, nutritional products, and health information are available in many countries, and we strive to make them easily accessible. [Explore more][35] ## Mission Statement We offer high-quality herbal remedies, supplements, and health services to support well-being. We prioritize sustainability, ethical practices, and the health of both our customers and employees. [Explore more][36] ## Switzerland A.Vogel is Switzerland's largest producers of herbal remedies and health food products. We combine Alfred Vogel's recipes with reliable health advice, with products available at physicians, in pharmacies, health food shops, and supermarkets. [Grüezi][37] ## International A.Vogel is a globally recognized brand, generating a turnover of 115 million Swiss Francs with its products available in 30 countries. The company employs around 500 people worldwide, including 170 in Switzerland. [Explore more][38] # Experience the world of A.Vogel. We invite you to explore the inspiring stories behind A.Vogel, and immerse yourself in the rich history of our brand. ## Explore Our Fields of Health A.Vogel promotes natural health with science-based remedies, nutritious products, and educational resources, empowering individuals to achieve holistic well-being and live a balanced, healthy lifestyle naturally. ### Immune system ### Cold & flu ### Women's Health ### Men's Health ### Sleep & stress ### Muscle & joints ### Food & nutrition ## A.Vogel: 100 Years of Innovation Over the past 100 years, A.Vogel has evolved from Alfred Vogel's small health food store in Basel into a global leader in fresh plant-based remedies, exporting to over 30 countries. Staying true to its founder's vision, the company emphasizes sustainability, scientific rigor, and the use of freshly harvested plants to ensure maximum efficacy. [Learn more][39] ## New A.Vogel Museum in Teufen In 2024, we opened the A.Vogel Museum in Teufen AR (Switzerland), offering visitors an interactive and sensory experience. Located at the site of Alfred Vogel's historic medicinal plant garden, the museum combines tradition and innovation, featuring historical artifacts, hands-on displays, and over 120 nearby medicinal plants. Visitors can delve into phytotherapy, take home plant profiles, and discover our brand through engaging exhibits. [Explore more][40] [Interior of A.Vogel Museum in Teufen] ## Echinaforce: 70 Years of Trusted Health In 2025, we celebrate the 70th anniversary of Echinaforce, our trusted remedy made from freshly harvested Echinacea. Since its launch in 1955, Echinaforce has become a cornerstone of natural health, helping millions worldwide support their immune systems with the power of plants. Developed using Alfred Vogel’s original formula and a commitment to sustainability, Echinaforce remains as effective and relevant as ever, backed by decades of scientific research. [Explore more][41] *115* million Swiss Francs turnover generated *500* employees worldwide *170* employees in Switzerland ## Key People **Dr. Andy Suter** CEO [Contact][42] **Bernhard Bärtschi ** Head International Markets [Contact][43] * [Company][44] * [Our values][45] * [Facts & figures][46] * [Global][47] * [History][48] * [Mission][49] * [Visit us][50] * [Fields of health][51] * [Fields of health][52] * [Immune system][53] * [Cold & flu][54] * [Women's Health][55] * [Men's Health][56] * [Sleep & stress][57] * [Muscles & joints][58] * [Food][59] * [Media][60] * [Media][61] * [Latest news][62] * [Media center][63] * [Publications][64] * [Responsibility][65] * [Code of conduct][66] * [Sustainability report][67] * [Career][68] * [Join us][69] * [Contact us][70] * © 2026 A.Vogel Company All rights reserved A.Vogel helps – since 1923 Follow us: [Legal information][71] [Privacy policy][72] [A.Vogel helps – since 1923] © 2026 A.Vogel Company All rights reserved [1]: /company/facts-and-figures.php [2]: /company/facts-and-figures.php [3]: /company/values.php [4]: /company/facts-and-figures.php [5]: /company/global.php [6]: /company/history.php [7]: /company/mission.php [8]: /company/visit-us.php [9]: /fields-of-health/ [10]: /fields-of-health/ [11]: /fields-of-health/ [12]: /fields-of-health/immune_system.php [13]: /fields-of-health/cold-and-flu.php [14]: /fields-of-health/womens-health.php [15]: /fields-of-health/mens-health.php [16]: /fields-of-health/sleep-and-stress.php [17]: /fields-of-health/muscle-and-joints.php [18]: /fields-of-health/food-and-nutrition.php [19]: /media/ [20]: /media/ [21]: /media/ [22]: /media/latest-news.php [23]: /media/media-center.php [24]: /media/publications.php [25]: /responsibility/code-of-conduct.php [26]: /responsibility/code-of-conduct.php [27]: /responsibility/code-of-conduct.php [28]: /responsibility/sustainability-report.php [29]: /career/ [30]: /career/ [31]: /career/ [32]: /career/contact.php [33]: /company/echinaforce.php [34]: /company/mission.php [35]: /fields-of-health/ [36]: /company/mission.php [37]: https://www.avogel-company.ch [38]: /company/global.php [39]: /media/news/100years.php [40]: /media/news/museum.php [41]: /media/news/70-years-echinaforce.php [42]: mailto:A.Suter@avogel.ch [43]: mailto:b.baertschi@avogel.ch [44]: /company/facts-and-figures.php [45]: /company/values.php [46]: /company/facts-and-figures.php [47]: /company/global.php [48]: /company/history.php [49]: /company/mission.php [50]: /company/visit-us.php [51]: /fields-of-health/ [52]: /fields-of-health/ [53]: /fields-of-health/immune_system.php [54]: /fields-of-health/cold-and-flu.php [55]: /fields-of-health/womens-health.php [56]: /fields-of-health/mens-health.php [57]: /fields-of-health/sleep-and-stress.php [58]: /fields-of-health/muscle-and-joints.php [59]: /fields-of-health/food-and-nutrition.php [60]: /media/ [61]: /media/ [62]: /media/latest-news.php [63]: /media/media-center.php [64]: /media/publications.php [65]: /responsibility/code-of-conduct.php [66]: /responsibility/code-of-conduct.php [67]: /responsibility/sustainability-report.php [68]: /career/ [69]: /career/ [70]: /career/contact.php [71]: /responsibility/legal-information.php [72]: /responsibility/privacy-policy.php",
