              "summary": "[Employee Login][1]\n[SFA Login][2]\n[ [apexlab] ][3]\n* [Home][4]\n* [About Us][5]\n  * [Company Profile][6]\n  * [CMD’s Desk][7]\n  * [Vision | Goals | Values][8]\n  * [Management][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Research & Development][11]\n* [Manufacturing][12]\n* [Contact][13]\n[Menu][14]\n\n##### About Us\n\n## apex\n\nStarted in 1978, apex is a Pharmaceutical Manufacturing and Marketing company headquarted in\nChennai, India.\n\nThe company products are available in Oral Solids, Oral Liquids and Topical Dosage forms.\n\nEnjoying brand leadership in Nutraceuticals and Dietary Supplements segment in India.\n\nThe company's branded formulations also are exported to more than 25 countries.\n\n### Largest General Diagnostic Tests\n\n### Connecting You with World-Class Support\n\n[Read More][15]\n[labflox]\n47 Years of\nExpertise\n\n##### apex\n\n## CREDENTIALS\n\n[Icon Image ]\n\n\nIn the year 2007 Apex strengthened its IPR with Derma Formulation through R&D\n\n[Icon Image ]\n\n\nInnovative Sofinox was Launched in Jan' 2011\n\n[Icon Image ]\n\n\nSofinox was awarded global patents for the formulation of Sodium Fusidate in a cream matrix of\nBIOCHITODERM (Chitosan Biopolymer)\n\n****\n\nSuccessful Rate\n\n****\n\nTests performed\n\n##### Distribution\n\n## STRENGTH\n\nSuper Distributors\n0\n\n## 22\n\n###### Super Stocklist\n\nStockists\n0\n\n## 2200\n\n###### Stocklist\n\nChemists\n0 +\n\n## 6000\n\n###### Chemists\n\nDoctors\n0 +\n\n## 150000\n\n###### Doctors\n\nDoctors\n0 +\n\n## 150000\n\n###### Doctors\n\nChemists\n0 +\n\n## 6000\n\n###### Chemists\n\nStocklist\n0\n\n## 2200\n\n###### Stocklist\n\nSuper Stocklist\n0\n\n## 22\n\n###### Super Stocklist\n\n\n## Vision | Goals | Values\n\n[Icon Image ]\n\n### Vision\n\nTo be one of the leading players in the Global Pharmaceutical industry and a household name in\nhealthcare through significant contribution to the society with quality products at affordable\nprices.\n\n[Icon Image ]\n\n### Goals\n\nSustaining brand leadership and achieving brand equity in its product segments across the globe.\n\n[Icon Image ]\n\n### Values\n\nTo contribute to the society by nurturing a vibrant business organization with a human face, known\nfor its quality of products, customer focus, people-oriented management and doing business with\nconscience.\n\n\n## The Zinc Story\n\nHistory Zinc in Healthcare The Zinc People\n\nDuring the first half of the 20th century, researchers discovered that zinc is essential for the\nnormal growth and survival of plants and animals. Clear evidence of human zinc deficiency began to\nemerge during the 1960s, when Dr Ananda Prasad first reported cases of dwarfism and delayed sexual\nmaturity among Middle Eastern adolescents. Since then, many researchers working in different areas\nof the world have found that zinc supplementation increases growth among stunted children and\nreduces the prevalence of common childhood infections, such as diarrhea and pneumonia.\n\nZinc is essential for human health. It is vital for many biological functions such as disease\nresistance, wound healing, digestion, reproduction, physical growth and diabetes control. The “World\nHealth Organization’s World Health Report 2002” estimated that one-third (33%) of the world’s\npopulation is at risk of inadequate zinc intakes.\n\napex pioneered the introduction of zinc-based formulations into the Indian market. The company’s\nflagship brand Zincovit is the brand leader in its segment in India and has established our identity\nas ‘The Zinc People’ in the Indian and the international markets.\n\n# Our Products\n\n### Anti - Acne Preparations\n\n[View Products][16]\n\n### Anti - Diarrheal\n\n[View Products][17]\n\n### Anti- Ageing\n\n[View Products][18]\n\n### Anti- asthmatic and COPD management\n\n[View Products][19]\n\n### Anti Dandruff\n\n[View Products][20]\n\n### Anti-Diabetics Oral\n\n[View Products][21]\n\n### Anti-Emetics\n\n[View Products][22]\n[Anti-Infective_Parenteral]\n\n### Anti-Infective_Parenteral\n\n[View Products][23]\n[View all][24]\n\n##### About Us\n\n## apex\n\nStarted in 1978, apex is a pharmaceutical manufacturing and marketing company headquarted in\nChennai, india.\n\nThe company product"
