          "page_text": "[Employee Login][1] [SFA Login][2] [ [apexlab] ][3] * [Home][4] * [About Us][5] * [Company Profile][6] * [CMD’s Desk][7] * [Vision | Goals | Values][8] * [Management][9] * [Products][10] * [Research & Development][11] * [Manufacturing][12] * [Contact][13] [Menu][14] ##### About Us ## apex Started in 1978, apex is a Pharmaceutical Manufacturing and Marketing company headquarted in Chennai, India. The company products are available in Oral Solids, Oral Liquids and Topical Dosage forms. Enjoying brand leadership in Nutraceuticals and Dietary Supplements segment in India. The company's branded formulations also are exported to more than 25 countries. ### Largest General Diagnostic Tests ### Connecting You with World-Class Support [Read More][15] [labflox] 47 Years of Expertise ##### apex ## CREDENTIALS [Icon Image ] In the year 2007 Apex strengthened its IPR with Derma Formulation through R&D [Icon Image ] Innovative Sofinox was Launched in Jan' 2011 [Icon Image ] Sofinox was awarded global patents for the formulation of Sodium Fusidate in a cream matrix of BIOCHITODERM (Chitosan Biopolymer) **** Successful Rate **** Tests performed ##### Distribution ## STRENGTH Super Distributors 0 ## 22 ###### Super Stocklist Stockists 0 ## 2200 ###### Stocklist Chemists 0 + ## 6000 ###### Chemists Doctors 0 + ## 150000 ###### Doctors Doctors 0 + ## 150000 ###### Doctors Chemists 0 + ## 6000 ###### Chemists Stocklist 0 ## 2200 ###### Stocklist Super Stocklist 0 ## 22 ###### Super Stocklist ## Vision | Goals | Values [Icon Image ] ### Vision To be one of the leading players in the Global Pharmaceutical industry and a household name in healthcare through significant contribution to the society with quality products at affordable prices. [Icon Image ] ### Goals Sustaining brand leadership and achieving brand equity in its product segments across the globe. [Icon Image ] ### Values To contribute to the society by nurturing a vibrant business organization with a human face, known for its quality of products, customer focus, people-oriented management and doing business with conscience. ## The Zinc Story History Zinc in Healthcare The Zinc People During the first half of the 20th century, researchers discovered that zinc is essential for the normal growth and survival of plants and animals. Clear evidence of human zinc deficiency began to emerge during the 1960s, when Dr Ananda Prasad first reported cases of dwarfism and delayed sexual maturity among Middle Eastern adolescents. Since then, many researchers working in different areas of the world have found that zinc supplementation increases growth among stunted children and reduces the prevalence of common childhood infections, such as diarrhea and pneumonia. Zinc is essential for human health. It is vital for many biological functions such as disease resistance, wound healing, digestion, reproduction, physical growth and diabetes control. The “World Health Organization’s World Health Report 2002” estimated that one-third (33%) of the world’s population is at risk of inadequate zinc intakes. apex pioneered the introduction of zinc-based formulations into the Indian market. The company’s flagship brand Zincovit is the brand leader in its segment in India and has established our identity as ‘The Zinc People’ in the Indian and the international markets. # Our Products ### Anti - Acne Preparations [View Products][16] ### Anti - Diarrheal [View Products][17] ### Anti- Ageing [View Products][18] ### Anti- asthmatic and COPD management [View Products][19] ### Anti Dandruff [View Products][20] ### Anti-Diabetics Oral [View Products][21] ### Anti-Emetics [View Products][22] [Anti-Infective_Parenteral] ### Anti-Infective_Parenteral [View Products][23] [View all][24] ##### About Us ## apex Started in 1978, apex is a pharmaceutical manufacturing and marketing company headquarted in Chennai, india. The company products are available in Oral Solids, Oral Liquids and Topical dosage forms. E