[51] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Cozopt SUD, which is the preparation of 100% preservative-free Dorzolamide 2% & Timolol 0.5% eye drops][52] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Eloza SB 65 mg capsule, which is a Super Bioavailable form Itraconazole BP.][53] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Utifin SR 100 mg Capsule, which is the preparation of Nitrofurantoin 100 mg][54] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Arotrix-C Lotion, which is the preparation of Permethrin 5% & Crotamiton 10%.][55] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Acyvir 10 g Cream, which is the preparation of Aciclovir. It is used to treat cold sores around the lips, caused by herpes virus.][56] [Aristopharma Ltd. is pleased to introduce Asmalin Plus, a Salbutamol + Budesonide HFA inhaler and the first US FDA-approved combination rescue medication for Asthma attacks.][57] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Resmetirom as first time in Bangladesh in the brand name of Livheal 80 mg & 100 mg Tablet. Resmetirom is the first and only FDA-approved oral therapy for NASH/MASH.][58] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Cozyten softgel capsule which is the preparation of Ubidecarenone (Co-enzyme Q10) 100 mg & 200 mg softgel capsule.][59] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Bevaris, preparation of Bevacizumab INN 100 mg & 400 mg concentrated solution for IV infusion.][60] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Ferijet which ensures faster recovery from anemia in adults.][61] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Joinflex-M Tablet which is the preparation of Native type II collagen, Glucosamine sulfate, Boswellia serrata and Boron.][62] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Acufer Capsule, which corrects Iron Deficiency in adults.][63] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Disitol Capsule, which helps to have a PCOS-free life][64] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Sodipic 10 mg Tablet & Sodipic 5 mg/5ml oral solution, which is a preparation of Sodium Picosulfate, a stimulant laxative][65] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Rituris 100 & 500 mg concentrated solution for IV infusion, which is a preparation of Rituximab][66] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Fosibon-DK tablet which is the preparation of 500 mg Calcium (derived from coral fossil), 1000 IU Vitamin D3 & 75 mcg Vitamin k2][67] [Aristopharma Ltd. proudly introduces “Lizox 600 IV Infusion” which is the preparation of Linezolid 600 mg IV Infusion.][68] [Aristopharma Ltd. Has launched Ivycof syrup which is the preparation of Ivy leaf (Hedera helix) and Thyme (Thymus vulgaris) dry extract.][69] [Aristopharma Ltd. Has launched Ginsenia Capsule which is the preparation of Ginkgo biloba and Panax ginseng extract.][70] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Luiz Cream which is the preparation of Luliconazole in 10 gm and 20 gm SKUs.][71] [Aristopharma Ltd. Has launched Pepelif syrup which is the preparation of Carica papaya leaf extract.][72] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Emep MUPS 20 & 40 mg Tablet. Emep MUPS is manufactured with advanced buffered technology & acid-resistant technology.][73] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Taflan SUD, which is the preparation of 100% preservative-free Tafluprost INN 0.015 mg.][74] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Itopa 50 mg Tablet, which is the preparation of ltopride Hydrochloride INN.][75] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Zavicef 2.5 g Injection, which is the preparation of Ceftazidime USP & Avibactam INN.][76] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Wikijet 2.5 mg/0.5 ml & 5 mg/0.5 ml Pre-filled Syringe Injection, which is the preparation of Tirzepatide INN.][77] [Aristopharma Ltd. proudly introduced “Otes\" the preparation of Oteseconazole INN 150 mg Capsule unveiling a new era in fungal disease management][78] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Goodbac-L Syrup, which is the first probiotic syrup in Bangladesh that ensures a healthy life.][79] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Systear SUD, Preservative-Free Ocular lubricant in SUD for the 1st time in Bangladesh manufactured with USA Technology by Blow-Fill Seal Technology.][80] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Drylief SUD, PRESERVATIVE-FREE Ocular lubricant in SUD for the 1st time in Bangladesh manufactured with USA Technology by Blow-Fill Seal Technology, which is the preparation of Carboxymethylcellulose Sodium 1%).][81] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Daily Fresh SUD, PRESERVATIVE-FREE Ocular lubricant in SUD for the 1st time in Bangladesh manufactured with USA Technology by Blow-Fill Seal Technology, which is the preparation of Sodium Hyaluronate 0.2%.][82] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Sabicard 50 mg, 100 mg & 200 mg tablets, which is the preparation of Sacubitril & Valsartan][83] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Dexalev O/Sol, which is the preparation of Dexamethasone Sodium Phosphate USP & Levofloxacin Hemihydrate USP.][84] [Aristopharma has launched Adronic 4 Injection, a preparation of Zoledronic Acid BP.][85] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched \"Lizox\" the preparations of Linezolid 400 & 600 mg tablets.][86] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Renvista 20, 50 & 100 mg Tablet, which is the preparation of Roxadustat INN.][87] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Aristopin O/Sol, which is the preparation of Atropine Sulfate USP.][88] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Betaxol Eye Drops, which is the preparation of Betaxolol Hydrochloride BP.][89] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Tocogel 200 IU & 400 IU Softgel Capsules which is the preparation of d-Alpha tocopherol.][90] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Mirovan 2.5, 5 & 10 mg tablets, which is the preparation of Mirogabalin Besylate.][91] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Ivacard 5 & 7.5 mg Tablets, which is the preparation of Ivabradine INN.][92] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Cutin 1, 2.5 & 5 mg softgel capsules, which is the preparation of Biotin or Vitamin B7.][93] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Fibosyl-S Powder, which is the preparation of Psyllium husk & Senna extract.][94] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Wikitin 12.5 & 25 mg tablets, preparations of Omarigliptin INN][95] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Empaglif-M, a combination consisting of Empagliflozin INN & Metformin Hydrochloride BP as tablets][96] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Triflo, a FDA approved ICS+LABA+LAMA combination consisting of Fluticasone Furoate, Vilanterol & Umeclidinium as Dry Powder Inhalation Capsule.][97] [Aristopharma Ltd. has launched Vonofix 10 & 20 mg Tablet, which is the preparation of Vonoprazan Fumarate INN.][98] [Aristopharma launches Palbociclib INN 125 mg capsule which is the preparation of Palbociclib.][99] [Aristopharma introduces Audicare Ear Drops. It is a combination of Ofloxacin (antibacterial), Clotrimazole (antifungal), Beclometasone (anti-inflammatory) and Lidocaine (local anesthetic).][100] [Aristopharma launches Arodoxin 10 & 50 Injections which are the preparations of Doxorubicin Hydrochloride USP][101] ## Who we are Aristopharma Ltd. is one of the top 10 pharmaceutical companies in Bangladesh. The company started its journey in 1986 with the honest promise to provide quality medicines at affordable prices to the countrymen. Arisopharma now owns two plants- one at Shampur, Dhaka & another at Gachha, Gazipur. The Shampur plant is located at Shampur-kadamtali I/A, 10 km South-East from central Dhaka. Although it is the 1^{st} plant of Aristopharma, with continuous expansion & upgradation, it is now equipped with highly sophisticated and advanced facilities. The facility is planned and designed to meet the local as well as international demand both qualitatively and quantitatively. [READ MORE][102] ## E-catalog [Ancor] For more information please click here [Duoblock] For more information please click here [Insulet] For more information please click here [Metacard MR] For more information please click here [Nitrocard] For more information please click here [Renvista] For more information please click here [Ruvastin] For more information please click here [Temcard & Temcard A] For more information please click here [Temcard & Temcard A 2] For more information please click here [Wikijet] For mo