abel and follow the directions for use. Consult with a Healthcare Professional to find the right products for you. ### Are you a Healthcare Professional? ##### Join thousands of practitioners who trust BioCeuticals for premium, evidence-based natural ##### health solutions. ##### **Discover the BioCeuticals difference today.** [Find out more & create an account [Chevron Icon Horizontal] ][127] Browse Products by ## Condition BioCeuticals offers a wide range of products tailored to various health conditions. [ [BioCeuticals Immune Support] Immune Support ][128][ [BioCeuticals Stress Mild Anxiety] Stress & Mild Anxiety ][129][ [BioCeuticals Muscle Support] Muscle Support ][130][ [BioCeuticals Heart Health] Heart Health ][131][ [Blackmores digestive health.jpg] Digestive Health ][132][ [BioCeuticals Womens Health] Women’s Health ][133][ [BioCeuticals Antioxidant Support] Antioxidant Support ][134] Browse by ## Dietary Requirements Explore our BioCeuticals range, tailored to meet your dietary needs. [ [halal_certified_transparent.svg] Halal Certified ][135] [ [no_added_dairy_transparent.svg] No Added Dairy ][136] [ [no_added_shellfish_transparent.svg] No Added Shellfish ][137] [ [no_added_soya_bean_products_transparent.svg] No Added Soya Bean ][138] [ [no_added_yeast_transparent.svg] No Added Yeast ][139] [ [pregnancy_friendly_transparent.svg] Pregnancy Friendly ][140] [ [vegan_friendly_transparent.svg] Vegan Friendly ][141] [ [no-added-gluten_rev.png] No Added Gluten ][142] [ [fx Medicine by BioCeuticals] ][143] [ ## A progressive voice for natural health education ][144] Exclusively for Healthcare Professionals At fx Medicine by BioCeuticals, our passion is to support healthcare professionals like you with the latest, evidence-based, natural medicine education brought to you by our team of industry leaders. [Learn More][145] [Magnesium Gly HP.jpg] ## Magnesium Glycinate: a gentle powerhouse for rest, mood & recovery Magnesium glycinate combines magnesium with the amino acid glycine for superior absorption and gentle digestion. Learn how this highly bioavailable form supports over 300 bodily processes, including healthy sleep, stress management, and nervous system function. [View Article][146] [ [BioCeuticals Muscle Support.jpg] ][147] BioCeuticals [ #### Looking for a supplement with Magnesium Glycinate? ][148] These products in the Ultra Muscleze® range feature UltraMag®*, a proprietary blend containing magnesium glycinate which is highly bioavailable and gentle on the stomach. [View products with magnesium glycinate][149] ## Latest in Health Hub The latest articles in BioCeuticals health hub feature up-to-date research and expert insights on emerging health trends, offering valuable information on topics such as immune support, gut health, and stress management. [View All Articles][150] [ Articles ][151] [ #### Supporting thyroid health with vitamins ][152] * 14 Nov 2025 * by [Rebekah Russell][153] Supporting Thyroid Health with Vitamins and Minerals. How to take care of the body’s extraordinary powerbank - the thyroid gland. [Learn More][154] [ Articles ][155] [ #### Omega-3 fatty acids: supporting heart, brain and joint health ][156] * 02 Jun 2025 * by [BioCeuticals][157] Learn how omega-3 fatty acids, often called healthy fats, play an important role in many body parts, particularly for the heart, brain, and joint health support. [Learn More][158] [ Articles ][159] [ #### Mind-gut connection: stress, mental health and digestive wellness ][160] * 05 May 2025 * by [BioCeuticals][161] Connection Between Mental Health & Gut Health - BioCeuticals [Learn More][162] ## We set out to guide the industry with progressive expertise [Science innovation] Innovation [Learn More][163] [quality safety] Quality & Safety [Learn More][164] [Sustainability] Sustainability [Learn More][165] [Community] Community [Learn More][166] [ [Find a Practitioner] ][167] [ ## Find your local Practitioner today ][168] Find your local Practitioner helps you connect with qualified Healthcare Professionals in your area who specialise in complementary medicine, ensuring you receive expert guidance tailored to your health needs. [Find a Practitioner [Chevron Icon Horizontal] ][169] ## Explore our wide range of products by brand [ [Homepage BioCeuticals.jpg] ][170] [ [Homepage BioCeuticals Clinicals] ][171] [ [Homepage Blackmores Professional.jpg] ][172] [BCorp.png] ## Proudly a Certified B Corp We’re proud to be part of the global B Corp community, a network of businesses committed to high standards of social and environmental performance, accountability and transparency. For Blackmores, B Corp certification is not just a marker of achievement. It reflects how we operate every day: caring for the planet, supporting the people behind our products and delivering health solutions you can trust. It also reinforces nearly a century of staying true to our purpose of connecting people to the healing power of nature and continuing to improve as the world around us evolves. [ [B-Corp-Logo-White-RGB.png] ][173] [[footerLogo.svg]][174] LET'S STAY IN TOUCH [[Facebook]][175][[Instagram]][176][][177] Back To Top About BioCeuticals * [About Us][178] * [Innovation][179] * [Quality][180] * [Sustainability][181] * [Community][182] * [fx Medicine][183] * [Practitioner Support][184] About BioCeuticals * [About Us][185] * [Innovation][186] * [Quality][187] * [Sustainability][188] * [Community][189] * [fx Medicine][190] * [Practitioner Support][191] Resources * [Healthcare Professional Education][192] * [Product Training][193] * [Patient Health Hub][194] Resources * [Healthcare Professional Education][195] * [Product Training][196] * [Patient Health Hub][197] Customer Care * [Report a Suspected Adverse Experience][198] * [Contact Us][199] * [FAQs][200] Customer Care * [Report a Suspected Adverse Experience][201] * [Contact Us][202] * [FAQs][203] BioCeuticals products are exclusively available after consultation with a Healthcare Professional in Pharmacy, Health Food Store or in a Clinic. Find a Practitioner near you to access BioCeuticals products. [Find a Practitioner [Chevron Icon Horizontal] ][204] Back To Top [[footerLogo.svg]][205] [Policies][206] [Privacy Policy][207] © 2026 FIT- BioCeuticals Ltd. All Rights Reserved. © 2026 FIT- BioCeuticals Ltd. All Rights Reserved. [1]: / [2]: / [3]: /products [4]: /products/by-availability/bestsellers [5]: /products/bioceuticals [6]: /products/bioceuticals-clinical [7]: /products/blackmores-professional [8]: /products [9]: /products/adrenoplex [10]: /products/armaforce-daily-protect [11]: /products/armaforce-for-juniors [12]: /products/armaforce [13]: /products/b12-spray [14]: /products/cognition-performance [15]: /products/iron-sustain [16]: /products/restoracalm-night [17]: /products/sb-floractiv [18]: /products/ultra-muscleze [19]: /products/ultra-muscleze-night-l-theanine [20]: /products/ultra-muscleze-pain-relief [21]: /products/ultrabiotic-60 [22]: /products/ultrabiotic-ibs [23]: /products/ultrabiotic-immune-support-for-juniors [24]: /products/ultraclean-dha-omega [25]: /products/zinc-sustain [26]: /products/bioceuticals [27]: /products/activated-bs-plus-ubiquinol [28]: /products/adrenops [29]: /products/anxiocalm [30]: /products/c-bioactive [31]: /products/fe-bioactive [32]: /products/hepatoclear [33]: /products/histammune-clear [34]: /products/im-biolytic [35]: /products/im-repair [36]: /products/immunactiv-restore [37]: /products/immuneforce [38]: /products/menosupport [39]: /products/methyl-bioactive [40]: /products/pyrizinc-bioactive [41]: /products/bioceuticals-clinical [42]: /products/bio-chromium-plus [43",
