              "summary": "×\nGet in Touch Get in Touch X\n\n#### Get in Touch\n\nSelect department Franchisee Bionova Franchisee BodyBalance Animal Healthcare Contract Manufacturing\nExport Department Others\nPrefered mode to contact Email Phone Any\nSend Message\n\n* [Home][1]\n* [About Us][2]\n* [Products][3]\n* [Contract Manufacturing][4]\n* [Research & Technology][5]\n* [Contact Us][6]\n* [Gallery][7]\n* [Articles][8]\n\n[\n][9]\n\n### Anelgesics\n\n[\n][10]\n\n### Clinical Nutrition\n\n[\n][11]\n\n### Gastro\n\n[\n][12]\n\n### Anti Cold & Cough\n\n[\n][13]\n\n### Cardiac &\n### Anti Diabetic\n\n[\n][14]\n\n### Injections\n\n[\n][15]\n\n### Dental\n\n[...]\n[...]\n[...]\nPrevious Next\n\nRetail Partners\n\n### 36000+ Pharmacies\n\nGlobal Presence\n\n### 17 + Countries\n\nProduct Portfolio\n\n### 500 Products\n\nIntellectual property\n\n### 3 Patents & counting\n\n[Pain Relieving Spray]\n\n## Speciality Divisions\n\n[\n][16]\n\n### Animal Healthcare\n\n[\n][17]\n\n### BodyBalance\n\n[\n][18]\n\n### Health Supplements\n\n[\n][19]\n\n### Branded Ingredients\n\n## All Our Formulations & Ingredients Backed By Clinical Evidences\n\n[smaple image]\n[smaple image]\n[smaple image]\n[smaple image]\n[smaple image]\n[smaple image]\n[smaple image]\n[smaple image]\n[smaple image]\n[smaple image]\n[smaple image]\n[smaple image]\n[smaple image]\n[smaple image]\n[smaple image]\n\n## We are happy to associate as your partner in Contract Manufacturing\n\n##### Tablets\n\n##### Capsules\n\n##### Powder\n\n##### Liquid\n\n###### WELCOME TO BIONOVA\n\n## Core aspirations\n\nAt Bionova Research Labs Pvt Ltd (formerly known as Pragati Biocare Pvt. Ltd.), we aspire to\ntransform the future of healthcare by making breakthrough treatments accessible, safe and affordable\nfor all. Our vision is rooted in compassion and driven by science, to address even the most complex\nand underserved medical needs.\n\nWe are committed to pioneering innovation at the intersection of medicine, wellnesss & beauty,\nrelentlessly pushing the boundaries of research and development.\n\nGuided by integrity, purpose and a deep responsibility to humanity, we aim to become a global force\nin reshaping lives through science-backed solutions.\n\n## Central goals\n\nTo make a positive impact on the lives of patients and their families, and to contribute to a\nhealthier and more equitable world.\n\n## Strategic outlook\n\nTo revolutionize healthcare by developing innovative and effective treatments that improve the\nquality of life for patients worldwide.\n\n[Read More][20]\n\n###### Product Portfolio\n\n## Passed Through Rigorous Quality Checks Before\n## Distributed To Stores\n\n#### Urip 900 Tabs\n\nCranberry Extract-300mg, D-Mannose-600 m & Probiotics 1.5 Billion\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Forppi Inj\n\nPantoprazole 40mg\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Hairstim XT Tabs\n\nBiotin 10000 mcg, Vitamins, Minerals & Amino acids\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Hairstim-F Lotion\n\nMinoxidil 5% , Finasteride 0.1%\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Alotol Lotion\n\nAloe vera, Vitamin E, Propylene Glycol & Lecithin\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Droxygel Suspension\n\nDried Aluminium Hydroxide Gel- 250mg, Activated..\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Fenpill P Tabs\n\nAceclofenac-100mg, Paracetamol-325mg\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Fenpill Trip Tabs\n\nAceclofenac-100mg, Paracetamol-325mg\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Daplyna-10 Tabs\n\nDapagliflozin 10 mg\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Nurofix-NT Tabs\n\nPregabalin 75mg, Nortriptyline 10mg & Methylcobalamin 1500mcg\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Daplyna-10 Tabs\n\nDapagliflozin 10 mg\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Discort-6 Susp\n\nDeﬂazacort-6mg\nEnquire Now\n\n## News & Events\n\n### Webinar on\n### L-carnosine\n\nAutism | Learning Disorder\nADHD | Epilepsy\nEnquire Now\n\n### Online Diet\n### Consultation\n\nCustomized Diet Plan\nNutrition & Lifestyle advices\nEnquire Now\n\n### Webinar on\n### L-carnosine\n\nAutism | Learning Disorder\nADHD | Epilepsy\nEnquire Now\n\n### Online Diet\n### Consultation\n\nCustomized Diet Plan\nNutrition & Lifestyle advices\nEnquire Now\n\n## Featured Brands\n\nWe strive hard to make a positive impact on the lives of patients and their families, and to\ncontribute to a healthier and more equitable world.\n\n#### Navigation\n* [Home][21]\n* [About Us][22]\n* [Leadership][23]\n* [Community"
            }
