          "page_text": "× Get in Touch Get in Touch X #### Get in Touch Select department Franchisee Bionova Franchisee BodyBalance Animal Healthcare Contract Manufacturing Export Department Others Prefered mode to contact Email Phone Any Send Message * [Home][1] * [About Us][2] * [Products][3] * [Contract Manufacturing][4] * [Research & Technology][5] * [Contact Us][6] * [Gallery][7] * [Articles][8] [ ][9] ### Anelgesics [ ][10] ### Clinical Nutrition [ ][11] ### Gastro [ ][12] ### Anti Cold & Cough [ ][13] ### Cardiac & ### Anti Diabetic [ ][14] ### Injections [ ][15] ### Dental [...] [...] [...] Previous Next Retail Partners ### 36000+ Pharmacies Global Presence ### 17 + Countries Product Portfolio ### 500 Products Intellectual property ### 3 Patents & counting [Pain Relieving Spray] ## Speciality Divisions [ ][16] ### Animal Healthcare [ ][17] ### BodyBalance [ ][18] ### Health Supplements [ ][19] ### Branded Ingredients ## All Our Formulations & Ingredients Backed By Clinical Evidences [smaple image] [smaple image] [smaple image] [smaple image] [smaple image] [smaple image] [smaple image] [smaple image] [smaple image] [smaple image] [smaple image] [smaple image] [smaple image] [smaple image] [smaple image] ## We are happy to associate as your partner in Contract Manufacturing ##### Tablets ##### Capsules ##### Powder ##### Liquid ###### WELCOME TO BIONOVA ## Core aspirations At Bionova Research Labs Pvt Ltd (formerly known as Pragati Biocare Pvt. Ltd.), we aspire to transform the future of healthcare by making breakthrough treatments accessible, safe and affordable for all. Our vision is rooted in compassion and driven by science, to address even the most complex and underserved medical needs. We are committed to pioneering innovation at the intersection of medicine, wellnesss & beauty, relentlessly pushing the boundaries of research and development. Guided by integrity, purpose and a deep responsibility to humanity, we aim to become a global force in reshaping