              "summary": "An ISO 9001:2008 & GMP certified company  |  biopharls@gmail.com  | +91-9216599595\n* **Email address** [biopharls@gmail.com][1]\n* **Registered Office** [HB NO.234,Pabhat,Zirakpur SAS Nagar(Mohali)][2]\n* [Home (current)][3]\n* [Who We Are][4]\n  * [About Us][5]\n  * [Company Profile][6]\n* [ Products ][7]\n  * [Section Wise][8]\n    * [Tablet][9]\n    * [Capsules][10]\n    * [Syrup][11]\n    * [Injection][12]\n    * [EYE DROPS][13]\n    * [DRY SYRUP][14]\n    * [OINTMENTS & SPRAY][15]\n    * [LOTION/ SHAMPOO/WASH][16]\n    * [SUSPENSION][17]\n  * [Speciality Wise][18]\n    * [Ortho][19]\n    * [General][20]\n    * [Gynae][21]\n    * [Derma][22]\n    * [Gastro][23]\n    * [ Ayurvedic][24]\n  * [New Launch][25]\n  * [Vonoref - 20 Tablet New][26]\n* Gallery\n  * [Certificates][27]\n  * [Plant Images][28]\n* [Accreditation][29]\n* [Facility][30]\n  * [PCD Pharma Franchise][31]\n  * [Third Party Pharma Manufacturing][32]\n  * [ Allopathic Medicine Manufacturing ][33]\n  * [ Soft Gelatin Capsules Manufacturer ][34]\n  * [ Syrup Manufacturer ][35]\n  * [ Nasal Spray Manufacturer ][36]\n  * [ Ointment Manufacturer ][37]\n* [Contact Us][38]\n* Our Division\n  * [Cagrus Division ][39]\n  * [Rechelist Division ][40]\n*  \n*  \n*  \n[slide1]\n[slide1]\n[slide1]\n[cover]\n[biophar]\n[about-us]\n\n# **Welcome to Biophar Lifesciences Pvt. Ltd**\n\nBiophar is a Chandigarh-based pharmaceutical company committed to creating opportunities through\ndifferentiation and innovation. With a portfolio of 2500+ DCGI-approved products, we offer a diverse\nrange of pharmaceutical solutions to meet the evolving needs of the healthcare industry.\n\nIn today’s highly competitive pharmaceutical market, where many businesses rely on the same\nformulations and molecules, Biophar takes a different approach. We focus on identifying and\nintroducing new, unique, innovative and differentiated molecules that help our partners strengthen\ntheir portfolios, stand apart from the competition and unlock new opportunities for growth.\n\nAt Biophar, our goal is simple—to help you stand out in a crowded market, create new opportunities,\nand gain a competitive advantage.\n\nDON’T FOLLOW THE MARKET. DIFFERENTIATE YOUR PORTFOLIO.\n\n## **Our Pharma Manufacturing Range**\n\nQuality drug solutions, produced under ablest guidance of skilled pharmacists are offered at Biophar\nLifesciences. We have our own team of R&D team and quality controllers to ensure that you’re\nprovided with best-customized medicines covering antibiotics, antiviral, cosmeceuticals,\nanti-infective, antiviral, cough-cold medicines, ophthalmic range etc.\n* [[syrup]][41]\n  \n  #### [Syrup & Suspensions][42]\n* [[ayurvedic]][43]\n  \n  #### [Tablets & Capsule Food][44]\n* [[energy-drink]][45]\n  \n  #### [Sachet][46]\n* [[injection]][47]\n  \n  #### [Paediatrics Range][48]\n* [[oinment]][49]\n  \n  #### [Ointments][50]\n\n## **New Products Launch**\n\n### **Awards and Recognition**\n\n[[accrediation]][51]\n[[accrediation]][52]\n[[accrediation]][53]\n[[accrediation]][54]\n[[accrediation]][55]\n[[accrediation]][56]\n[[accrediation]][57]\n[[accrediation]][58]\n[[accrediation]][59]\n[[accrediation]][60]\n[[accrediation]][61]\n\n### **We offer Wide Range of Products**\n\nBiophar Lifesciences is dedicated to bringing advanced and sophisticated medication selected from a\nwide range of dosage formulations to therapeutics segments. We deal in over GMP-ISO approved 1250+\nproducts list with optimal solutions to customer requirements.\n1.  \n2.  \n\n[BILGUARD-M]\n[CIFAXT]\n[BEGMERA]\n[DYDROLIST]\n[KEPTACT]\n[LEVICETUM]\n[NITROFOR]\n[EBAPHAR]\n[ESTALIST]\n[FYPENEM]\n[HEPLIST]\n[USILO]\n[ZEDSTOP]\n[PHYLOROY]\n[ORTHOMAC]\n[NITROFOR]\n[ORTHOMAC]\n[PHYLOROY]\n[URSOFT]\n[URSOFT-300]\n\n### **PCD Pharma Franchise Services**\n\nEsteemed PCD Pharma Franchise provider in India, Biophar Lifesciences offers vast production\ncapacity, the latest machines & equipment, world-class healthcare experts, quality sourcing,\nlogistics across the globe, and the benefit of an excise-free zone. We have collaborated with top\nplayers in the pharmaceuticals sector, achieving 10"
