          "page_text": "An ISO 9001:2008 & GMP certified company | biopharls@gmail.com | +91-9216599595 * **Email address** [biopharls@gmail.com][1] * **Registered Office** [HB NO.234,Pabhat,Zirakpur SAS Nagar(Mohali)][2] * [Home (current)][3] * [Who We Are][4] * [About Us][5] * [Company Profile][6] * [ Products ][7] * [Section Wise][8] * [Tablet][9] * [Capsules][10] * [Syrup][11] * [Injection][12] * [EYE DROPS][13] * [DRY SYRUP][14] * [OINTMENTS & SPRAY][15] * [LOTION/ SHAMPOO/WASH][16] * [SUSPENSION][17] * [Speciality Wise][18] * [Ortho][19] * [General][20] * [Gynae][21] * [Derma][22] * [Gastro][23] * [ Ayurvedic][24] * [New Launch][25] * [Vonoref - 20 Tablet New][26] * Gallery * [Certificates][27] * [Plant Images][28] * [Accreditation][29] * [Facility][30] * [PCD Pharma Franchise][31] * [Third Party Pharma Manufacturing][32] * [ Allopathic Medicine Manufacturing ][33] * [ Soft Gelatin Capsules Manufacturer ][34] * [ Syrup Manufacturer ][35] * [ Nasal Spray Manufacturer ][36] * [ Ointment Manufacturer ][37] * [Contact Us][38] * Our Division * [Cagrus Division ][39] * [Rechelist Division ][40] * * * [slide1] [slide1] [slide1] [cover] [biophar] [about-us] # **Welcome to Biophar Lifesciences Pvt. Ltd** Biophar is a Chandigarh-based pharmaceutical company committed to creating opportunities through differentiation and innovation. With a portfolio of 2500+ DCGI-approved products, we offer a diverse range of pharmaceutical solutions to meet the evolving needs of the healthcare industry. In today’s highly competitive pharmaceutical market, where many businesses rely on the same formulations and molecules, Biophar takes a different approach. We focus on identifying and introducing new, unique, innovative and differentiated molecules that help our partners strengthen their portfolios, stand apart from the competition and unlock new opportunities for growth. At Biophar, our goal is simple—to help you stand out in a crowded market, create new opportunities, and gain a competitive advantage. DON’T FOLLOW THE MARKET. DIFFERENTIATE YOUR PORTFOLIO. ## **Our Pharma Manufacturing Range** Quality drug solutions, produced under ablest guidance of skilled pharmacists are offered at Biophar Lifesciences. We have our own team of R&D team and quality controllers to ensure that you’re provided with best-customized medicines covering antibiotics, antiviral, cosmeceuticals, anti-infective, antiviral, cough-cold medicines, ophthalmic range etc. * [[syrup]][41] #### [Syrup & Suspensions][42] * [[ayurvedic]][43] #### [Tablets & Capsule Food][44] * [[energy-drink]][45] #### [Sachet][46] * [[injection]][47] #### [Paediatrics Range][48] * [[oinment]][49] #### [Ointments][50] ## **New Products Launch** ### **Awards and Recognition** [[accrediation]][51] [[accrediation]][52] [[accrediation]][53] [[accrediation]][54] [[accrediation]][55] [[accrediation]][56] [[accrediation]][57] [[accrediation]][58] [[accrediation]][59] [[accrediation]][60] [[accrediation]][61] ### **We offer Wide Range of Products** Biophar Lifesciences is dedicated to bringing advanced and sophisticated medication selected from a wide range of dosage formulations to therapeutics segments. We deal in over GMP-ISO approved 1250+ products list with optimal solutions to customer requirements. 1. 2. [BILGUARD-M] [CIFAXT] [BEGMERA] [DYDROLIST] [KEPTACT] [LEVICETUM] [NITROFOR] [EBAPHAR] [ESTALIST] [FYPENEM] [HEPLIST] [USILO] [ZEDSTOP] [PHYLOROY] [ORTHOMAC] [NITROFOR] [ORTHOMAC] [PHYLOROY] [URSOFT] [URSOFT-300] ### **PCD Pharma Franchise Services** Esteemed PCD Pharma Franchise provider in India, Biophar Lifesciences offers vast production capacity, the latest machines & equipment, world-class healthcare experts, quality sourcing, logistics across the globe, and the benefit of an excise-free zone. We have collaborated with top players in the pharmaceuticals sector, achieving 100% customer satisfaction. We deal in over 1250+ latest molecules, with an expanding product list to meet our ever-growing client demand. Customized packaging solutions are provided with attention to attractiveness and informative value. The complete manufacturing and trading process is conducted under strict observation to ensure the best results. Our Schedule M units serve bulk production at economic rates to Pharma companies seeking professional, qualitative, and quantitative benefits. Biophar Lifesciences is dedicated to bringing a product portfolio that meets current quality-centric needs via a patient-centric approach. Hygienic and well-ventilated spaces are assigned and dedicated as per GMP standards to R&D, production, and preservation requirements for individual medications, including allopathic, herbal-ayurvedic, dosage forms, and therapeutic medicines. The units are frequently sanitized, and the latest technology is upgraded to ensure a cost-effective and improved pharmacopoeia of related drug combinations. ### **Need a Pharma Manufacturing in India ?** Call Now 9216599595 and Get Top Quality Healthcare Products at Best Prices [Call Now][62] #### Plant Gallery [[p1]][63] [[p32]][64] [[p3]][65] [[p4]][66] [[p34]][67] [[p36]][68] [[p8]][69] [[p12]][70] [[p13]][71] [[p44]][72] [[p16]][73] [[p17]][74] ### **Our Mission, Vision & Why Us** * [target] **Our Mission** Achieve global recognition as superior quality pharmaceutical products for manufacturing, supply and trading. * [vision] **Our Vision** Revolutionize Pharma industry by simplifying business model by bringing authentic and effective medications. * [choose] **Why Choose Us ?** Trusted Manufacturing Pharma Company with Latest Technology and Techniques With Beneficial Transparent Dealings. ### **Customer Testimonial** BIOPHAR LIFESCIENCES is rapidly growing pharmaceutical formulations manufacturing, marketing, and export oriented company. Manufacturing and marketing of quality pharmaceutical formulations affordable to the Indian masses and having global quality is our motto #### quick link * [Home][75] * [About Us][76] * [Co