r Buffered Magnesium Glycinate 400 mg ][110] $26.50 - $49.80 $26.50 $26.50 [ Choose Options ][111] ## The Carlson Omega-3 Difference To ensure maximum freshness, Carlson omega-3s are closely managed from sea to store. We source the highest quality deep, cold-water fish using traditional, sustainable methods. And freshness, potency, and purity are guaranteed. 3rd-Party Awards & Certifications [ Shop Now about this content ][112] ## Family-Owned and Female-Led Since 1965, Carlson has been a leader in the vitamin and supplement industry and has won numerous awards for freshness, potency, purity, and flavor. Carlson was founded by Pharmacist Susan Carlson and is still family-owned and women-led today by her two daughters. We take pride in providing families with the highest quality vitamins, minerals, omega-3s, kids’ products and other nutritional supplements. Award-winning quality since 1965 Watch Video ## Video player Press Escape or use the close button to exit. ## Our Commitment to Sustainability At Carlson, we take the health of our planet as seriously as the health of our customers. The full Carlson product line is recyclable and 100% plastic neutral. For every product purchased, we remove the same amount of plastic waste from our waterways, giving the purchase a net-zero plastic footprint. Play YouTube video ## Video player Press Escape or use the close button to exit. ### The Daily Dose Blog Get the latest info on health, wellness, and supplements from our registered dietitian nutritionists. [ [The Focus Formula: Omega-3s, Multivitamins, Sleep, and Movement for Better Learning] ][113] [ Omegas + Supplements ][114] / Aug 19th 2026 [The Focus Formula: Omega-3s, Multivitamins, Sleep, and Movement for Better Learning][115] What Science Says About Focus at Every Age) From preschoolers learning letters to adults mastering new skills, attention is the gateway to learning. Decades of cognitive science show that focus improves when the brain has the right fuel (nutrients), maintenance (sleep), and activation (movement). No single pill or hack replaces [Read More][116] [ [Getting Back in the Groove for the Entire Family] ][117] [ Health + Wellness ][118] / Aug 19th 2026 [Getting Back in the Groove for the Entire Family][119] Summer often brings a lack of schedules, later bedtimes, extra treats, spontaneous events, and a welcome break from specific timelines, but when school starts again, the shift can feel abrupt for the entire household. One of the biggest challenges after summer is rebuilding structure. Instead of focusing only on school [Read More][120] [ [A Healthy Glow Without the Burn] ][121] [ Health + Wellness ][122] / Jul 01th 2026 [A Healthy Glow Without the Burn][123] Summer is here, don’t be afraid of the sun! You can love the sun and protect your skin at the same time. A sun-smart routine blends good sunscreen habits, smart timing and clothing choices, and supportive nutrition—especially when kids are involved. Why Sun Protection Matters: UV Rays, Skin Aging, and [Read More][124] ## Healthy Recipes Try some of our healthy recipes, packed with omega-3s and other beneficial nutrients. [ ### Smoothies ][125] [ ### Starters & Snacks ][126] [ ### Side Dishes ][127] [ ### Entrees ][128] [ ### Desserts ][129] ## Memberships [Membership logo] [Membership logo] [Membership logo] [Membership logo] [Membership logo] ## Site footer [ [Carlson Logo White] ][130] Wellness tips, updates, and offers from Carlson Labs ### Email Address Categories * ### Categories * [ Omega-3 Fish Oils more about Omega-3 Fish Oils ][131] * [ Omega-3 Plant Based more about Omega-3 Plant Based ][132] * [ Vitamins A-K more about Vitamins A-K ][133] * [ Children & Teens more about Children & Teens ][134] * [ Gummies more about Gummies ][135] * [ Minerals more about Minerals ][136] * [ Multiples more about Multiples ][137] * [ Digestive Aids more about Digestive Aids ][138] * [ Nutrient Formulas more about Nutrient Formulas ][139] * [ Special Formulas more ab