              "summary": "* [Home][1]\n* [Products][2]\n  * [Maxirich Daily Multivitamin][3]\n  * [Maxirich Gold Strip - Pack of 10s][4]\n  * [Maxirich Gold Bottle - Monthly Pack][5]\n  * [Maxirich Multivitamin Syrup][6]\n  * [Maxirich Liver Care][7]\n  * [Maxirich Iron Tonic ][8]\n* [Blogs][9]\n* [Reviews][10]\n* [FAQs][11]\n* [Contact Us][12]\n* [Home][13]\n* [Products][14]\n  * [Maxirich Daily Multivitamin][15]\n  * [Maxirich Gold Strip - Pack of 10s][16]\n  * [Maxirich Gold Bottle - Monthly Pack][17]\n  * [Maxirich Multivitamin Syrup][18]\n  * [Maxirich Liver Care][19]\n  * [Maxirich Iron Tonic ][20]\n* [Blogs][21]\n* [Reviews][22]\n* [FAQs][23]\n* [Contact Us][24]\n[\n[max energy max immunity] [max energy max immunity]\n][25] [\n[Energy Ki Kami Ab Nahi Rahegi] [Energy Ki Kami Ab Nahi Rahegi]\n][26] [\n[Energy Ki Kami Ab Nahi Rahegi] [Energy Ki Kami Ab Nahi Rahegi]\n][27]\n\n#### Why take Maxirich\n\nWe all try to take care of our health, but our daily routine and eating habits don’t always give us\nthe complete nutrition our body needs. Maxirich helps bridge these gaps by providing essential\nnutrients in a convenient and reliable way. Each product is thoughtfully designed to support overall\nwellbeing and help you stay energised, active, and healthy every day. Explore the range and choose\nwhat fits your lifestyle.\n\nGluten-free\n\n24/7 Energy\n\nVegetarian\n\n#### PRODUCT RANGE\n\nWe aim to be a part of consumer’s daily life by giving them best value for money through well\nresearched and ever evolving excellent products. Maxirich comes with over 15 years of trust that our\nconsumers have placed on us.\n\n[ [Maxirich Multivitamin and Minerals Softgels] ][28]\n\n#### [Maxirich Daily Multivitamin][29]\n#### \n#### Now in Easy To Swallow Capsules\n\n##### [\n##### \n##### #### Why do I need Maxirich Daily Multivitamin\n##### \n##### ][30]\n* - Blend of more than 20 essential vitamins and minerals to supplement your daily diet\n* - Provides multiple benefits: It boosts energy, builds immunity and aids mental performance\n* - Power of 3 anitoxidants: Vitamin A, E & C\n* - Keeps you active & energized with B-Vitamin support\n* - Helps meet your nutrient requirements along with regular diet\n* - Now in Easy To Swallow Capsules\n\n##### [\n##### \n##### #### Recommended Dosage\n##### \n##### ][31]\n* - 1 softgel daily, preferably after breakfast\n* - Suitable for both men and women\n\nPRODUCT DETAILS INGREDIENTS WE USE\n[ [Maxirich Gold Strip - Pack of 10s] ][32]\n\n#### [Maxirich Gold Strip - Pack of 10s][33]\n\n##### [\n##### \n##### #### Why Do I Need Maxirich Gold Strip - Pack of 10s?\n##### \n##### ][34]\n* - A mixture of Vitamins, Minerals and High Purity Grade Ginseng extract to boost your energy\n  levels\n* - Top benefits for you: Boosts immunity, improves memory and helps utilize energy\n* - High Purity Grade Ginseng extract enhances your immunity, cognitive well-being and helps manage\n  fatigue\n* - Energy release: Helps you fully utilize stored energy in the body\n* - • Contains Ginseng extract with Vitamin B complex, A, C, D3 & E, as well as Minerals like Zinc\n  and Iron help in energy releasing metabolism and relieve stress\n\n##### [\n##### \n##### #### Recommended Dosage\n##### \n##### ][35]\n\nTake one soft gel every day\n\nContinue using it as long you feel like your diet is falling short of providing you with essential\nnutrients\n\nPRODUCT DETAILS INGREDIENTS WE USE\n[ [Maxirich Gold Bottle - Monthly Pack] ][36]\n\n#### [Maxirich Gold Bottle - Monthly Pack][37]\n\n##### [\n##### \n##### #### Why Do I Need Maxirich Gold Bottle - Monthly Pack?\n##### \n##### ][38]\n* - Made with High Purity Grade Ginseng Extract* : Maxirich Gold is made up of High Purity Grade\n  Ginseng Extract*, vitamin B complex, vitamins C and minerals like zinc and iron, which together\n  act as a catalyst in reducing stress levels and building energy. It helps in promoting internal\n  well-being and building a strong immune system. Besides, it supports in relieving stress,\n  bolstering memory and concentration.\n* - Boosts Immunity : Maxirich Gold Multivitamin Softgels are power-"
            }
