          "page_text": "* [Home][1] * [Products][2] * [Maxirich Daily Multivitamin][3] * [Maxirich Gold Strip - Pack of 10s][4] * [Maxirich Gold Bottle - Monthly Pack][5] * [Maxirich Multivitamin Syrup][6] * [Maxirich Liver Care][7] * [Maxirich Iron Tonic ][8] * [Blogs][9] * [Reviews][10] * [FAQs][11] * [Contact Us][12] * [Home][13] * [Products][14] * [Maxirich Daily Multivitamin][15] * [Maxirich Gold Strip - Pack of 10s][16] * [Maxirich Gold Bottle - Monthly Pack][17] * [Maxirich Multivitamin Syrup][18] * [Maxirich Liver Care][19] * [Maxirich Iron Tonic ][20] * [Blogs][21] * [Reviews][22] * [FAQs][23] * [Contact Us][24] [ [max energy max immunity] [max energy max immunity] ][25] [ [Energy Ki Kami Ab Nahi Rahegi] [Energy Ki Kami Ab Nahi Rahegi] ][26] [ [Energy Ki Kami Ab Nahi Rahegi] [Energy Ki Kami Ab Nahi Rahegi] ][27] #### Why take Maxirich We all try to take care of our health, but our daily routine and eating habits don’t always give us the complete nutrition our body needs. Maxirich helps bridge these gaps by providing essential nutrients in a convenient and reliable way. Each product is thoughtfully designed to support overall wellbeing and help you stay energised, active, and healthy every day. Explore the range and choose what fits your lifestyle. Gluten-free 24/7 Energy Vegetarian #### PRODUCT RANGE We aim to be a part of consumer’s daily life by giving them best value for money through well researched and ever evolving excellent products. Maxirich comes with over 15 years of trust that our consumers have placed on us. [ [Maxirich Multivitamin and Minerals Softgels] ][28] #### [Maxirich Daily Multivitamin][29] #### #### Now in Easy To Swallow Capsules ##### [ ##### ##### #### Why do I need Maxirich Daily Multivitamin ##### ##### ][30] * - Blend of more than 20 essential vitamins and minerals to supplement your daily diet * - Provides multiple benefits: It boosts energy, builds immunity and aids mental performance * - Power of 3 anitoxidants: Vitamin A, E & C * - Keeps you active & energized with B-Vitamin support * - Helps meet your nutrient requirements along with regular diet * - Now in Easy To Swallow Capsules ##### [ ##### ##### #### Recommended Dosage ##### ##### ][31] * - 1 softgel daily, preferably after breakfast * - Suitable for both men and women PRODUCT DETAILS INGREDIENTS WE USE [ [Maxirich Gold Strip - Pack of 10s] ][32] #### [Maxirich Gold Strip - Pack of 10s][33] ##### [ ##### ##### #### Why Do I Need Maxirich Gold Strip - Pack of 10s? ##### ##### ][34] * - A mixture of Vitamins, Minerals and High Purity Grade Ginseng extract to boost your energy levels * - Top benefits for you: Boosts immunity, improves memory and helps utilize energy * - High Purity Grade Ginseng extract enhances your immunity, cognitive well-being and helps manage fatigue * - Energy release: Helps you fully utilize stored energy in the body * - • Contains Ginseng extract with Vitamin B complex, A, C, D3 & E, as well as Minerals like Zinc and Iron help in energy releasing metabolism and relieve stress ##### [ ##### ##### #### Recommended Dosage ##### ##### ][35] Take one soft gel every day Continue using it as long you feel like your diet is falling short of providing you with essential nutrients PRODUCT DETAILS INGREDIENTS WE USE [ [Maxirich Gold Bottle - Monthly Pack] ][36] #### [Maxirich Gold Bottle - Monthly Pack][37] ##### [ ##### ##### #### Why Do I Need Maxirich Gold Bottle - Monthly Pack? ##### ##### ][38] * - Made with High Purity Grade Ginseng Extract* : Maxirich Gold is made up of High Purity Grade Ginseng Extract*, vitamin B complex, vitamins C and minerals like zinc and iron, which together act as a catalyst in reducing stress levels and building energy. It helps in promoting internal well-being and building a strong immune system. Besides, it supports in relieving stress, bolstering memory and concentration. * - Boosts Immunity : Maxirich Gold Multivitamin Softgels are power-packed with High Purity Grade Ginseng Extract*, which is a well-known medicinal herb that has immunity boosting properties that help in maintaining health and wellness, and fighting off viruses and diseases. * - Helps Utilize Energy : Lack of energy tends to be an outcome of overwork and fatigue. With Maxirich Gold Multivitamin, you can overcome fatigue and stress by ensuring proper utilization of energy with the help of ingredients like Ginseng Extract*, vitamin B complex, vitamins C and minerals like zinc and iron. * - Improves Performance : Infused with the goodness of High Purity Grade Ginseng Extract*, vitamin B complex, vitamins A, C, D3 & E, and minerals like zinc and iron, they can help relieve stress, energize and boost performance as well as cognitive well-being. * - *Ginseng extract standardize upto 2% Ginsenoside content ##### [ ##### ##### #### Recommended Dosage ##### ##### ][39] Take one soft gel every day Continue using it as long you feel like your diet is falling short of providing you with essential nutrients PRODUCT DETAILS INGREDIENTS WE USE [ [Maxirich Multivitamin Syrup] ][40] #### [Maxirich Multivitamin Syrup][41] ##### [ ##### ##### #### Why Do I Need Maxirich Multivitamin Syrup? ##### ##### ][42] * - Packed with the power of 9 vitamins and 4 minerals * - Boosts your immunity: It contains the goodness of vital nutrients which help strengthen the body’s defence mechanism. * - Boosts your energy levels: Helps reduce fatigue by providing essential nutrients your body needs every day. * - Improves memory: Minerals like iodine , zinc, and vitamins B1, B6, B12, A, D, and copper help maintain normal cognitive abilities. * - Antioxidant benefit: Lycopene and lysine act as antioxidants that help protect the body’s cells from damage and stress. ##### [ ##### ##### #### Recommended Dosage ##### ##### ][43] One teaspoonful (5ml) daily Not to exceed the recommended daily usage PRODUCT DETAILS INGREDIENTS WE USE [ [Maxirich Liver Care] ][44] #### [Maxirich Liver Care][45] ##### [ ##### ##### #### Why Do I Need Maxirich Liver Care? ##### ##### ][46] * - Promotes liver health by flushing out toxins & prevents oxidative stress due to liver disorders * - Aids in digestion: It improves your metabolism, which in turns helps in the utilization of nutrients effectively * - Helps to stimulate your appetite, allowing one to take in a more nutritious diet * - Infused with the goodness of traditional herbs that are known for protecting liver and provide other health benefits * - Combats liver disorders and keeps its functioning in check ##### [ ##### ##### #### Recommended Dosage ##### ##### ][47] For Children: 1 teaspoonful (5ml) two or three times daily For Adults: 2 teaspoonfuls (10ml) two or three times daily or as directed by the physician PRODUCT DETAILS INGREDIENTS WE USE [ [MAXIRICH IRON TONIC] ][48] #### [MAXIRICH IRON TONIC][49] ##### [ ##### ##### #### Why Maxirich Iron Tonic? ##### ##### ][50] * Maxirich Iron Tonic is useful in Anemia, Helps in Improving haemoglobin level, Reducing paleness, breathlessness, headache due to Anemia. It also helps in reducing tiredness & fatigue caused due to Anemia. * Iron is an essential mineral that is required for synthesis of haemoglobin. Haemoglobin is present in RBCs (Red Blood Cells) Deficiency of iron can lead to tiredness, lethargy, and breathlessness. * Folic acid deficiency can lead to improper production of RBC resulting into Anemia. Folic acid deficiency is commonly seen in persons in periods of rapid growth and in pregnancy and lactation and those whose diets are poor in folic acid.y * Vitamin B12 is important for the proper production of RBCs in the body. Deficiency of Vitamin B12 can lead to lower haemoglobin levels leading to Anemia. * Zinc is a catalyst for many enzymes that are needed for red blood cell production. Hence, zinc deficiency may be associated with Anemia. * Suitable for both men and women * Available in 225ml and 450ml ##### [ ##### ##### #### Recommended Dosage ##### ##### ][51] For Adults: Take 2 teaspoons three times daily. For Children: 1 teaspoonful 3 times a day For Infants: 1 teaspoonful a day OR As directed by physician PRODUCT DETAILS INGREDIENTS WE USE #### CHECKOUT OUR #### CUSTOMERS' REVIEWS ##### Dhruv This is one of the brands you can trust. So buy pack it you get in good deal. ##### Nitin Aggarwal Bought for my parents as due to old age they complain of lethargy and bone and joint problems.on taking these capsules they both feel energised now and showed improvement. ##### Vishal Multivitamin are good for health and after taking 1 tablet daily for a week i noticed good changes in overall health, many vitamins which are missed in daily intake of food, can be fulfilled by this multivitamin. ##### Vanshika Maxirich multivitamin cap. are total package of vitamins in a tiny little thing. It makes me feel so fresh and energetic throughout the day. It’s a must add item in your lifestyle. ##### Akhil Babu This multivitamin capsules from cipla meet my daily nutritional needs. Have all vitamin contains likr A,E n C. Nice packaging as well from team. ##### Rahul Sachdeo Its very good, the capsules are very useful to built immunity, packing was too good and I am fully satisfied with the product!!! ##### Ravi Really good. I have been taking it since one month now and I feel good. it has no side effects. good multivitamin capsule #### WATCH OUR Videos [ [Maxirich Tablet and Tulsi Drop] ][52] [ [Maxirich Tablet and Tulsi Drop] ][53] #### DISCOVER HEALTH To lead a healthy life requires a healthy body as the engine and the right nutrition and exercise as the fuel that ensures the machinery works seamlessly. It is extremely important that we ensure that our bodies stay fit, energetic and active and have a strong immunity. We present to you our curates set of articles and blogs that will help you lead a healthier and worry free life VIEW MORE ##### 07 Sep, 2020 #### 8 Lifestyle Changes To Strengthen Your Immune System Giving your immune system the best shot at pr