          "page_text": "[ Skip to content ][1] Free shipping for NZ orders over $50 Free shipping for NZ orders over $50 Free shipping for NZ orders over $50 Free shipping for NZ orders over $50 Free shipping for NZ orders over $50 Free shipping for NZ orders over $50 Free shipping for NZ orders over $50 Free shipping for NZ orders over $50 Free shipping for NZ orders over $50 Free shipping for NZ orders over $50 Free shipping for NZ orders over $50 Free shipping for NZ orders over $50 # [[Clinicians - Science you can feel]][2] * Our Products ##### Shop by category ##### [Shop all products][3] ##### [Bundle & Save][4] * [ Everyday Health ][5] * [ Focus & Performance ][6] * [ Immune & Allergens ][7] * [ Digestive Health ][8] * [ Women's Health ][9] * [ Stress, Sleep & Mood ][10] * [ Appearance ][11] * [ Joint & Bone Health ][12] * [ Kids Health ][13] * [ Specific Health Support ][14] ##### Not sure what you need? Book a chat with our in-house Naturopath. [Learn more][15] * [ Journal ][16] * About Us * [ Who we are ][17] * [ Clean Label ][18] * [ Ask our Naturopath ][19] * [ Contact us ][20] * [ FAQs ][21] * [ Packaging Update ][22] * [ Bundle & Save ][23] [ Take the quiz ][24] [ Log in ][25] * [Home][26] * Our Products Our Products * [Shop all products ][27] * [Bundle & Save ][28] * ##### Browse by range * [ Everyday Health ][29] * [ Focus & Performance ][30] * [ Immune & Allergens ][31] * [ Digestive Health ][32] * [ Women's Health ][33] * [ Stress, Sleep & Mood ][34] * [ Appearance ][35] * [ Joint & Bone Health ][36] * [ Kids Health ][37] * [ Specific Health Support ][38] * ###### Not sure what you need? Book a chat with one of in-house Naturopaths. [Learn more ][39] * [ Journal ][40] * About Us About Us * [ Who we are ][41] * [ Clean Label ][42] * [ Ask our Naturopath ][43] * [ Contact us ][44] * [ FAQs ][45] * [ Packaging Update ][46] * [ Bundle & Save ][47] * [ Facebook ][48] * [ Instagram ][49] ## Item added to your cart Check out Continue shopping ### Keep your body in balance with products formulated specifically for women's wellbeing [ Shop Now ][50] # NEW Cholesterol Care Unique combination of cholesterol and heart health supporting ingredients. [ Shop Now ][51] ## Shop our range led by research, backed by science. ##### Developed by our team of experts right here in Aotearoa, New Zealand. [ Everyday Health ][52] [ Immune & Allergens ][53] [ Focus & Performance ][54] [ Digestive Health ][55] [ Women's Health ][56] [ Stress, Sleep & Mood ][57] [ Appearance ][58] [ Joint & Bone Health ][59] [ Kids Health ][60] [ Specific Health Support ][61] ### Featured products [ View all products ][62] * [Cholesterol Care] ##### [ Cholesterol Care ][63] New ##### [ Cholesterol Care ][64] Everyday Health Scientifically researched formula to support cholesterol management and cardiovascular care. Regular price Rs. 3,800.00 Regular price New Rs. 3,800.00 Unit price / per [ Add ][65] * [Gut Soothe & Biome Balance] ##### [ Gut Soothe & Biome Balance ][66] New ##### [ Gut Soothe & Biome Balance ][67] Digestive Health Science-based gut powder to support regularity, bloating, digestion, gut health and comfort. Regular price Rs. 2,800.00 Regular price New Rs. 2,800.00 Unit price / per [ Add ][68] * [Vit C 3000mg + Elderberry, Vit D & Zinc] ##### [ Vit C 3000mg + Elderberry, Vit D & Zinc ][69] ##### [ Vit C 3000mg + Elderberry, Vit D & Zinc ][70] Immune & Allergens High dose Vitamin C with Elderberry, Vitamin D and Zinc for everyday immune support Regular price Rs. 2,500.00 Regular price Sale Rs. 2,500.00 Unit price / per [ Add ][71] * [Ivy Leaf Bronchial Syrup] ##### [ Ivy Leaf Bronchial Syrup ][72] New ##### [ Ivy Leaf Bronchial Syrup ][73] Immune & Allergens Clinicians Ivy Leaf Bronchial Syrup is suitable for all the family to soothe the throat and clear the airways. Regular price Rs. 900.00 Regular price New Rs. 900.00 Unit price / per [ Add ][74] * [B12 Active Chews] ##### [ B12 Active Chews ][75] ##### [ B12 Active Chews ][76] Stress, Sleep & Mood Supports energy, the nervous system and mood. Regular price Rs. 1,000.00 Regular price Sale Rs. 1,000.00 Unit price / per [ Add ][77] * [Down Below Bundle] ##### [ Down Below Bundle ][78] Save ##### [ Down Below Bundle ][79] Women's Health These two products work synergistically to support bacterial balance in the urinary tract and bladder. They also support against the recurrence of imbalances. Regular price Rs. 2,400.00 Regular price R̶s̶.̶ ̶3̶,̶3̶0̶0̶.̶0̶0̶ Save Rs. 2,400.00 Unit price / per [ Add ][80] * [PeriMeno Balance] ##### [ PeriMeno Balance ][81] ##### [ PeriMeno Balance ][82] Women's Health Supporting a smooth perimenopause transition for cycle regularity, mood & hormone balance. Regular price Rs. 2,900.00 Regular price Sale Rs. 2,900.00 Unit price / per [ Add ][83] * [Bloating Support] ##### [ Bloating Support ][84] ##### [ Bloating Support ][85] Digestive Health Formulated with Ginger, Dandelion and LactoSpore® probiotics to support bloating, gas, healthy digestion and fluid retention. Regular price Rs. 2,200.00 Regular price Sale Rs. 2,200.00 Unit price / per [ Add ][86] ## Not sure which product is right for you? Answer some questions about yourself and we will recommend products to suit your individual health needs. [Take the quiz][87] ## We think the human body is pretty incredible So we're dedicated to helping you get the most out of it. We bring together nutrition, naturopathy and science, to deliver high-quality, research-backed, natural health solutions. [ Find out more ][88] * # Ask our Naturopath Not sure what you need? Talk with our experienced New Zealand-based Naturopath. From there, advice can be given on natural health solutions and products that are right for your specific concerns. [Book an appointment][89] * ##### Jane Cronin Naturopath (Dip. Naturopathy, Dip. Herbal Medicine) * #### Happy gut, happy you Support your gut daily with our science-based blend of prebiotics, probiotics, herbs and minerals to help balance digestion, ease bloating and keep things moving all in a delicious lemon drink. [View product ][90] * #### Cholesterol support, backed by science Meet Bergavit®, a researched Bergamot citrus extract shown to support cholesterol balance in as early as 2 months. Paired with Chromium and B vitamins for heart, circulatory and blood sugar support. Clean label, vegan friendly. [View product ][91] ### From our journal [ View all articles ][92] * [A Happy Gut, A Happy Life] Lifestyle ### [ A Happy Gut, A Happy Life ][93] Digestive health is one of those things we rarely think about until something goes wrong. Then, suddenly, every meal becomes a source of anxiety. We start second guessing what we... Jane Cronin • Apr 29 Read more * [Are you Peri or Meno?] Lifestyle ### [ Are you Peri or Meno? ][94] Demystifying the transition between peri-menopause and menopause There is lots of talk about menopause and perimenopause, but symptoms and strategies are blurred between the two. Find out more about your... Jane Cronin, Naturopath • Mar 20 Read more * [Strong Bones for Life: Why exercise is your best ally] ### [ Strong Bones for Life: Why exercise is your best ally ][95] When we think about the body and health, we often focus on the vital organs - the heart, brain or blood vessels, but your bones are quietly doing the heavy... Casey Irving - SOMA Physio • Jul 29 Read more * [Vitamin D - The Sunshine Vitamin] ### [ Vitamin D - The Sunshine Vitamin ][96] Did you know Vitamin D is made in the body from exposure to sunlight? Find out how it is beneficial for our body, what other vitamins it likes to work... Jane Cronin • May 28 Read more [ View all articles ][97] ## Get a dose of good stuff in your social feed @clinicians [ Follow us ][98] ### Keep up to date with all things Clinicians Get 15% off your first order! ### Support * [ Contact Us ][99] * [ Find a Stockist ][100] * [ FAQs ][101] * [ Orders, Shipping & Returns ][102] * [ Subscribe & Save ][103] ### Advice * [ Ask our Naturopath ][