              "summary": "[Skip To Main Content][1]\n \n[[Designs for Health][#1 Practitioner Supplement Brand]][2]\n* [Get Started][3]Get Started menu\n* [Shop][4]Shop menu\n* [Our Story][5]Our Story menu\n* [Learn More][6]Learn More menu\nSearch[Search Icon]\n[Logo]\nYour browser does not support the video tag.\n\n# **Where science**\n# meets wellness\n\n[\n01\nNew Products\n][7][\n02\nBest Sellers\n][8][\n03\nCardiovascular\n][9][\n04\nGut Health\n][10][\n05\nDaily Basics\n][11]\n\n## Designs for Health is recognized as the #1 practitioner supplement brand recommended by\n## functional medicine professionals††\n\nFamily-owned since 1989, we’ve spent over three decades pioneering functional wellness—offering\nresearch-backed products and expert-driven care that puts people first.\n\n[Read our Story][12]\n\n## Designs for Health is recognized as the #1 practitioner supplement brand recommended by\n## functional medicine professionals††\n\nWe lead with science, earn trust through results, and never compromise on quality. Every ingredient\nis tested for purity, potency, and identity—and screened for contaminants—at external ISO-certified\nlabs. That’s our promise.\n\n[Our Story][13]\n\n## Designs for Health is recognized as the #1 practitioner supplement brand recommended by\n## functional medicine professionals††\n\nWe protect the integrity of our products by preventing counterfeits and unauthorized sales—so you\nalways get trusted quality, straight from the source.\n\n[Our quality assurance][14]\n\n## Designs for Health is recognized as the #1 practitioner supplement brand recommended by\n## functional medicine professionals††\n\nWe lead with Science First™ innovation—developing high-quality, effective formulas rooted in\nclinical research and practitioner insight.\n\n[Shop best sellers][15]\n\n## Designs for Health is recognized as the #1 practitioner supplement brand recommended by\n## functional medicine professionals††\n\nFamily-owned since 1989, we’ve spent over three decades pioneering functional wellness—offering\nresearch-backed products and expert-driven care that puts people first.\n\n[Read our Story][16]\n\n## Designs for Health is recognized as the #1 practitioner supplement brand recommended by\n## functional medicine professionals††\n\nWe lead with science, earn trust through results, and never compromise on quality. Every ingredient\nis tested for purity, potency, and identity—and screened for contaminants—at external ISO-certified\nlabs. That’s our promise.\n\n[Our Story][17]\n\n### Smarter solutions for busy practitioners\n\nStreamline your practice with a free Virtual Dispensary, Spotlight™ testing, eScripting, and\nrewards—plus expert guidance from a dedicated Functional Medicine Consultant. Smarter tools, trusted\nsupport, and more time to focus on patient care.\n\n[Explore benefits][18]\n\nThe Award-Winning Probiotic Is Here\n\n2026 Award Winner        2026 Award Winner        2026 Award Winner        2026 Award Winner\n\nGastrointestinal Health · 2026 NutraIngredients USA Award Winner\n\n## Anaerostipes Probiotic — 2026 Microbiome Product of the Year\n\nMeet the 2026 NutraIngredients USA Product of the Year for Microbiome Modulation. Anaerostipes\nProbiotic features a next-generation strain, Anaerostipes caccae, a butyrate-producing strain to\nsupport microbiome balance, and gut barrier integrity.*\n\n[Shop Now][19]\n2026 Award Winner        2026 Award Winner        2026 Award Winner        2026 Award Winner\n[Anaerostipes Probiotic box with product information][Anaerostipes Probiotic box with product\ninformation]\nGet Started\n\n### Ready to get started?\n\nDiscover a smarter way to supplement—with expert guidance, custom plans, functional testing, and\nexclusive savings.\n\n[See how it works][20]\n\n#### Create a DFH account today.\n\nWhether you’re here to shop high-quality supplements, connect with a practitioner for personalized\nsupport, or access professional tools as a student or licensed practitioner—creating a DFH account\nopens the door to tailored benefits designed just for you.\n\nCreate an accountLogin\n[[Designs for Health]][21]\n\n##"
