          "page_text": "[Skip To Main Content][1] [[Designs for Health][#1 Practitioner Supplement Brand]][2] * [Get Started][3]Get Started menu * [Shop][4]Shop menu * [Our Story][5]Our Story menu * [Learn More][6]Learn More menu Search[Search Icon] [Logo] Your browser does not support the video tag. # **Where science** # meets wellness [ 01 New Products ][7][ 02 Best Sellers ][8][ 03 Cardiovascular ][9][ 04 Gut Health ][10][ 05 Daily Basics ][11] ## Designs for Health is recognized as the #1 practitioner supplement brand recommended by ## functional medicine professionals†† Family-owned since 1989, we’ve spent over three decades pioneering functional wellness—offering research-backed products and expert-driven care that puts people first. [Read our Story][12] ## Designs for Health is recognized as the #1 practitioner supplement brand recommended by ## functional medicine professionals†† We lead with science, earn trust through results, and never compromise on quality. Every ingredient is tested for purity, potency, and identity—and screened for contaminants—at external ISO-certified labs. That’s our promise. [Our Story][13] ## Designs for Health is recognized as the #1 practitioner supplement brand recommended by ## functional medicine professionals†† We protect the integrity of our products by preventing counterfeits and unauthorized sales—so you always get trusted quality, straight from the source. [Our quality assurance][14] ## Designs for Health is recognized as the #1 practitioner supplement brand recommended by ## functional medicine professionals†† We lead with Science First™ innovation—developing high-quality, effective formulas rooted in clinical research and practitioner insight. [Shop best sellers][15] ## Designs for Health is recognized as the #1 practitioner supplement brand recommended by ## functional medicine professionals†† Family-owned since 1989, we’ve spent over three decades pioneering functional wellness—offering research-backed products and e