ned abundance) vs. single-strain Akkermansia products (~3%). Percentages reflect typical abundance in healthy adult microbiomes per published research. Individual colonization varies. [1]: #mainContent [2]: / [3]: /get-started-practitioner [4]: /products/ [5]: /our-story [6]: /research-and-education [7]: /products?category=New%20Products [8]: /products?category=Best%20Sellers [9]: /products?category=Cardiovascular [10]: /products?category=Gut%20Health [11]: /products?category=Daily%20Basics [12]: /our-story [13]: /our-story [14]: /manufacturing [15]: /products/?category=Best%20Sellers [16]: /our-story [17]: /our-story [18]: /get-started-practitioner [19]: /products/anaerostipes-probiotic [20]: /get-started-consumer [21]: / [22]: mailto:support@designsforhealth.com [23]: tel:+18606236314 [24]: /in-the-news [25]: /events [26]: https://designsforhealthcareers.ttcportals.com [27]: /public-faqs [28]: https://www.designsforhealth.com/ingredient-library/ [29]: /certificate-of-analysis [30]: /satisfactionguarantee [31]: /returns [32]: https://issuu.com/designsforhealth-us/docs/designs_for_health_catalog_2026_-_standard?fr=sYWYw NDg5Nzg2MzU [33]: https://issuu.com/designsforhealth-us/docs/designs_for_health_catalog_2026_-_california?fr=sNT k3Zjg5Nzg2MzU [34]: /accessibility [35]: /privacy-notice [36]: /terms-of-use [37]: /terms-of-sale-wholesale-accounts [38]: /proposition-65-warning [39]: /privacy-notice-for-california-residents [40]: /terms-of-sale-retail [41]: /rewards-terms-and-conditions [42]: /ca-supply-chains-act [43]: /dmca-policy",
