tball][39] For the former football star, success was built on more than natural talent. Discover what the FC Bayern legend has to share. Learn more [A smiling man sits in a stadium seat, holding a soccer ball. To his left, there are logos for FC Bayern München and Doppelherz, with the text \"Official Regional Partner\" underneath. The background features empty red seats.] Doppelherz aktiv ## [Pure-3][40] High potency Omega-3 * Optimal combination of omega-3 fatty acids from fish with three B-vitamins * One capsule contains 280 mg EPA and 160 mg DHA, plus 3 mg Vitamin B6 and 3 µg Vitamin B12 * Healthy for the heart and the cardiovascular system To the product ## [The German Pharmacy Brand available internationally.][41] Doppelherz stands for quality and experience for over 100 years. Our high-quality products make a valuable contribution to support the health and well-being of the entire family. We are excited to be able to offer our products in a variety of international markets. More about Doppelherz [Party-Grafik für die Marke Doppelherz] ## Our product categories Energy & performance Cardiovascular Cold Eye health Immune system & cell protection Kidney, bladder & prostate Men’s health Minerals & vitamins Mother & child Muscles, bones & movement Nerves & calming Omega-3 fatty acids Skin, hair, nails Stomach & digestion Women’s health [All categories][42] [Sportlicher Mann jogggt am Strand] Muscles, bones & movement Our musculoskeletal system is challenged every day. Discover our products for muscles, bones & movement. [To the category][43] [Doppelherz aktiv Calciovin front view] Doppelherz aktiv [ ### Calciovin ][44] Type: Food supplement Size:30 tablets [胶原蛋白11000 正面图] Online exclusive Doppelherz system [ ### Collagen 11.000 ][45] Type: Food supplement Size:30 ampoules [Doppelherz aktiv Joints ULTRA front view] Doppelherz aktiv [ ### Joints ULTRA ][46] Type: Food supplement Size:30 capsules [Doppelherz aktiv Kal D3 front view] Doppelherz aktiv [ ### Kal D3 ][47] Type: Food supplement Size:30 tablets [Doppelherz aktiv Magnesium + Calcium + D3 front view] Doppelherz aktiv [ ### Magnesium + Calcium + D3 ][48] Type: Food supplement Size:30 tablets [Doppelherz aktiv Magnesium + Potassium 400 front view] Doppelherz aktiv [ ### Magnesium + Potassium 400 ][49] Type: Food supplement Size:40 tablets [Doppelherz system Relax and Sleep front view] Doppelherz system [ ### Relax and Sleep ][50] Type: Food supplement Size:30 tablets There's more to see! Discover all Doppelherz Products for muscles, bones and movement [See all products][51] ## Explore Doppelherz ## [Pure-3][52] To the product [Doppelherz aktiv Pure-3 front view] ## Discover the healthy and delicious products for animals from Doppelherz. [Hund mit zwei Katzen] For cats and dogs ## [Immuntive Cranberry][53] To the product [Doppelherz aktiv Immuntive Cranberry front view] Doppelherz aktiv ## [Vital Pregna][54] To the product [Doppelherz aktiv Vital Pregna front view] [Friends at the beach] The brand Doppelherz # Doppelherz health products for the entire family ## For over 100 years, Doppelherz has been known as brand of quality products that support health ## and well-being – for a lifetime. We use only certified, high-quality ingredients in our medicines, medical devices and food supplements. Today, Doppelherz stands for keeping your entire family healthy. Our product portfolio has grown enormously since the development of the Doppelherz Tonic over 100 years ago. Whether to support your immune system, to combat fatigue and exhaustion, to maintain healthy skin and hair or to strengthen your cardiovascular system: Doppelherz products support a healthy, active lifestyle at any age. Core products at Doppelherz are its popular food supplements, which contain optimum levels of nutrients such as vitamins, minerals, trace elements and certain fatty acids. After all, our demand for nutrients increases during pregnancy and nursing, and during periods of stress or physical exertion, which put a strain on the body. High-quality Doppelherz food supplements enhance our diet when we’re under more pressure or are unable to eat properly. We offer products in the right form for every customer’s unique needs and tastes: tablets and capsules you can easily swallow, micropellets, granulated drink mixes, liquid sticks, liquid products, nasal sprays and eye drops. In 2021, Doppelherz received the prestigious BEST BRANDS TopTen Award in the Health & Well-Being category. In addition to success on the market, this award also takes into account the popularity of a brand among its customers. Today, Doppelherz is the No. 1 brand in the general healthcare market in Germany* and the No. 1 brand in Europe in the Vitamins, Minerals and Tonics category** – clear proof of the strong trust consumers place in our brand. *Doppelherz is the No. 1 brand in the General Health Markets database in the German food retail and drugstore market from May 2024 to April 2025, Source: NielsenIQ Market Track, (AGM), sales value in Germany (Copyright © 2025, NielsenIQ (Germany) GmbH) **Source: IQVIA Global OTC Insights, category Vitamins & Tonics in Europe, ranking based on International Brand, in volume and value sales (LCE/PUB) for the period MAT Q1/2025, reflecting estimates of real-world activity. Copyright IQVIA. All rights reserved. * #### Service * [Contact][55] * [Downloadcenter][56] * [Change location][57] * #### Information * [Imprint][58] * [Privacy Policy][59] * [Accessibility][60] * [Image sources][61] * [Sitemap][62] * #### About us * [Queisser Pharma][63] * [Doppelherz Germany][64] * #### Our brands * [Protefix][65] * [Stozzon][66] A brand of FOLLOW US * [Instagram][67] * [Facebook][68] © 2026 Doppelherz. All rights reserved. [1]: #main-content [2]: /products [3]: /products [4]: /products/energy-performance [5]: /products/cardiovascular [6]: /products/cold [7]: /products/diabetics [8]: /products/eye-health [9]: /products/immune-system-cell-protection [10]: /products/kidney-bladder-prostate [11]: /products/mens-health [12]: /products/minerals-vitamins [13]: /products/mother-child [14]: /products/muscles-bones-movement [15]: /products/nerves-calming [16]: /products/omega-3-fatty-acids [17]: /products/skin-hair-nails [18]: /products/stomach-digestion [19]: /products/womens-health [20]: /products/doppelherz-aktiv [21]: /products/doppelherz-system [22]: /health-guide [23]: /health-guide [24]: /health-guide/brainjogging [25]: /health-guide [26]: /brand [27]: /brand/doppelherz-brand-history [28]: /brand/quality [29]: /brand/sustainability [30]: /brand [31]: /topics [32]: /themes/brainhealth [33]: /fc-bayern-partnership [34]: /fc-bayern-partnership [35]: /doppelherz-fc-bayern-partnership/the-legend [36]: /products [37]: /brand [38]: /products/relax-and-sleep [39]: /doppelherz-fc-bayern-partnership/the-legend [40]: /products/pure-3 [41]: /brand [42]: /products [43]: /products/muscles-bones-movement [44]: /products/calciovin [45]: /products/doppelherz-system-collagen-11000 [46]: /products/doppelherz-aktiv-joints-ultra [47]: /products/kal-d3 [48]: /products/doppelherz-aktiv-magnesium-calcium-d3 [49]: /products/doppelherz-aktiv-magnesium-potassium-400 [50]: /products/relax-and-sleep [51]: /products/muscles-bones-movement [52]: /products/pure-3 [53]: /products/immuntive-cranberry [54]: /products/vital-pregna [55]: /contact [56]: https://www.doppelherz.com/downloads [57]: https://www.doppelherz.com/choose-country-region [58]: /imprint [59]: /privacy-policy [60]: /accessibility [61]: /image-sources [62]: /sitemap [63]: https://www.queisser.com/ [64]: https://www.doppelherz.de/ [65]: https://www.protefix.com/ [66]: https://www.stozzon.com/ [67]: https://www.instagram.com/doppelherz_de/ [68]: https://www.facebook.com/Doppelherz",
