              "summary": "The store will not work correctly when cookies are disabled.\n\n**JavaScript seems to be disabled in your browser.** For the best experience on our site, be sure to\nturn on Javascript in your browser.\n\n[ Skip to Content][1]\n* [Sign In][2]\n* [Create Account][3]\n[My Cart ][4]\n\n[ Open a practitioner account today!][5]\n\nToggle Nav\n* [ Products ][6]\n  * [Shop by][7]\n    * [Surplus Offers][8]\n    * [Bestsellers][9]\n    * [Unique Formulations][10]\n    * [Products A-Z][11]\n    * [Discontinued Products][12]\n    * [All Products][13]\n  * [Health Functions][14]\n    * * [Bone & Joint][15]\n      * [Cognitive & Mood][16]\n      * [Detox][17]\n      * [Digestive][18]\n      * [Foundation][19]\n      * [Heart & Metabolic][20]\n      * [Hormone][21]\n      * [Immune][22]\n      * [Klean Athlete^{®}][23]\n    * * [Sleep & Relaxation][24]\n      * [Vision][25]\n      * [Vitamins/Minerals/Amino Acids][26]\n* [ Education ][27]\n  * * [Brochures and Supporting Materials][28]\n    * [Product Information Sheets][29]\n    * [Clinical Protocols][30]\n* [ Quality ][31]\n  * * [Our Commitment to Quality][32]\n* [ About][33]\n  * [About Douglas][34]\n    * [About Us][35]\n    * [Scientific Advisory Board][36]\n    * [Social Responsibility][37]\n    * [Global Offices & Partners][38]\n    * [Sustainability][39]\n    * [Colleague Referral Program][40]\n    * [Friends & Family Program][41]\n  * [Customer Service][42]\n    * [Customer Service][43]\n    * [FAQ][44]\n    * [Contact Us][45]\n**Select Store**\nMore Brands\n**Search**\nSearch\nSearch\n[Account][46]\n\nDISCOVER THE POTENTIAL FOR HEALTHY LIVING\n\nSearch\n\n## HEALTH FUNCTIONS\n\nDouglas Laboratories^{®} products are formulated with the understanding that every patient is\ndifferent and each healthcare professional leverages their own philosophy and clinical experience\nwhen addressing patient care.\n\n## HEALTH FUNCTIONS\n\nDouglas Laboratories^{®} products are formulated with the understanding that every patient is\ndifferent and each healthcare professional leverages their own philosophy and clinical experience\nwhen addressing patient care.\n* [ ][47]\n  \n  ## Bone & Joint\n* [ ][48]\n  \n  ## Cognitive & Mood\n* [ ][49]\n  \n  ## Detox\n* [ ][50]\n  \n  ## Digestive\n* [ ][51]\n  \n  ## Foundation\n* [ ][52]\n  \n  ## Heart & Metabolic\n* [ ][53]\n  \n  ## Hormone\n\n[ All health functions ][54]\n\n## FEATURED PRODUCT\n\nBerberine Balance supplies berberine combined with alpha lipoic acid and grape seed extract for\nhealthy blood sugar and cardiovascular support.^{‡}\n\n[ ][55]\n\n## FEATURED PRODUCT\n\nBerberine Balance supplies berberine combined with alpha lipoic acid and grape seed extract for\nhealthy blood sugar and cardiovascular support.^{‡}\n\n## FEATURED PRODUCT\n\nMulti-Probiotic^{®} 40 Billion contains 16 beneficial strains of Lactobacillus, Lactococus,\nBifidobacterium and Streptococcus cultures, including the clinically researched Bifidobacterium\nlactis HN019 that supports gastrointestinal and immune function.^{‡}\n\n[ ][56]\n\n## FEATURED PRODUCT\n\nMulti-Probiotic^{®} 40 Billion contains 16 beneficial strains of Lactobacillus, Lactococus,\nBifidobacterium and Streptococcus cultures, including the clinically researched *Bifidobacterium\nlactis* HN019 that supports gastrointestinal and immune function.^{‡}\n\n## FEATURED PRODUCT\n\nUltra Preventive^{®} X signature multivitamin/mineral with fruits and vegetables for daily\nwellness^{‡}\n\n[ ][57]\n\n## FEATURED PRODUCT\n\nUltra Preventive^{®} X signature multivitamin/mineral with fruits and vegetables for daily\nwellness^{‡}\n\n[ SHOP OUR BESTSELLERS][58]\n\n## ABOUT US\n\nFor over 65 years, Douglas Laboratories^{®} has been dedicated to meeting the needs of healthcare\nprofessionals. As a globally recognized leader in innovative, science-based nutritional supplements,\nwe strive to support healthcare professionals as they help their patients discover the potential for\nhealthy living, today and in the future.^{‡}\n\n[ Learn More ][59]\n\n## SUSTAINABILITY\n\nWe work hard to make a difference in global health outreach and sustainability for the planet. Our\ng"
