          "page_text": "The store will not work correctly when cookies are disabled. **JavaScript seems to be disabled in your browser.** For the best experience on our site, be sure to turn on Javascript in your browser. [ Skip to Content][1] * [Sign In][2] * [Create Account][3] [My Cart ][4] [ Open a practitioner account today!][5] Toggle Nav * [ Products ][6] * [Shop by][7] * [Surplus Offers][8] * [Bestsellers][9] * [Unique Formulations][10] * [Products A-Z][11] * [Discontinued Products][12] * [All Products][13] * [Health Functions][14] * * [Bone & Joint][15] * [Cognitive & Mood][16] * [Detox][17] * [Digestive][18] * [Foundation][19] * [Heart & Metabolic][20] * [Hormone][21] * [Immune][22] * [Klean Athlete^{®}][23] * * [Sleep & Relaxation][24] * [Vision][25] * [Vitamins/Minerals/Amino Acids][26] * [ Education ][27] * * [Brochures and Supporting Materials][28] * [Product Information Sheets][29] * [Clinical Protocols][30] * [ Quality ][31] * * [Our Commitment to Quality][32] * [ About][33] * [About Douglas][34] * [About Us][35] * [Scientific Advisory Board][36] * [Social Responsibility][37] * [Global Offices & Partners][38] * [Sustainability][39] * [Colleague Referral Program][40] * [Friends & Family Program][41] * [Customer Service][42] * [Customer Service][43] * [FAQ][44] * [Contact Us][45] **Select Store** More Brands **Search** Search Search [Account][46] DISCOVER THE POTENTIAL FOR HEALTHY LIVING Search ## HEALTH FUNCTIONS Douglas Laboratories^{®} products are formulated with the understanding that every patient is different and each healthcare professional leverages their own philosophy and clinical experience when addressing patient care. ## HEALTH FUNCTIONS Douglas Laboratories^{®} products are formulated with the understanding that every patient is different and each healthcare professional leverages their own philosophy and clinical experience when addressing patient care. * [ ][47] ## Bone & Joint * [ ][48] ## Cognitive & Mood * [ ][49] ## Detox * [ ][50]