              "summary": "[ Skip to content ][1]\n[[G&G logo]][2]\nGeneric selectors\nExact matches only\nSearch in title\nSearch in content\nPost Type Selectors\nseedprod\n* [What We Do][3]\n* [White Label Products][4]\n  * [Vitamins][5]\n  * [Minerals][6]\n  * [Botanicals][7]\n  * [Digestion and Live Bacteria][8]\n  * [Specialist Blends][9]\n  * [Antioxidants][10]\n  * [Collagen][11]\n  * [Omega & Oils][12]\n  * [Active Nutrition][13]\n  * [Sexual Health][14]\n  * [Vegan Specialities][15]\n* [About][16]\n* [Contact Us][17]\n\n## Vitamin Manufacture\n\nSussex based supplement manufacture for nearly 60 years\n\n[Get Your Supplement Made With G&G ][18]\n\nGeneric selectors\nExact matches only\nSearch in title\nSearch in content\nPost Type Selectors\nseedprod\n[[G&G logo]][19]\nNavigation Menu\n[Get Your Supplement Made][20]\nNavigation Menu\n* [What We Do][21]\n* [White Label Products][22]\n* [About][23]\n* [Contact Us][24]\n* [Brochure Request][25]\n* [Get a Quote][26]\n\n# A Family Run Supplement Manufacturer\n\nG&G is the most experienced vitamin and supplement manufacturer in the UK. We prioritise health and\nwell-being by using the purest ingredients, avoiding fillers and excipients.\n\nNo matter the size of your business, G&G can produce high-quality supplements to help grow your\nbrand.\n\nG&G made products for numerous brands can be found on store shelves everywhere from high street to\nHarrods.\n\n[White Label][27]\n[Private Label][28]\n[[heart]][29]\n\n## [No Excipients Used][30]\n\nOur manufacturing processes avoid magnesium stearate and additives as standard.\n\n[[bell]][31]\n\n## [60 Years of Trusted Experience][32]\n\nWith 60 years in the supplement industry, we deliver quality and expertise you can rely on.\n\n[[comment]][33]\n\n## [Low MOQs][34]\n\nYour brand matters to us, no matter the size. Our team is here to guide you through the launch of\nyour product.\n\n[[certificate]][35]\n\n## [MHRA GMP, FSSC 22000, HFMA Member and More][36]\n\nOur extensive certification is testament to the high quality manufacture we supply.\n\n[[user]][37]\n\n## [A Legacy of Family Ownership][38]\n\nAs a family-owned and operated business, we ensure consistent quality and personal care.\n\n[[envira]][39]\n\n## [Tailored Supplements to Meet Your Needs][40]\n\nAll our supplements are non-GMO and we offer organic and vegan customized options to your\nrequirements.\n\n## Contact G&G to get your supplements made:\n\n[Get a Quote][41]\n[Request a Brochure][42]\n\n## Reviews\n\n Posted on Google [Google] \n [Wayne Klein profile picture] \n Wayne Klein \n \n[Google star 1][Google star 2][Google star 3][Google star 4][Google star 5]Trustindex verifies that \nthe original source of the review is Google. \nFantastic friendly professional team of people, very welcoming and helpful! Best, Wayne Klein.\n Posted on Google [Google] \n [Dashin Health profile picture] \n Dashin Health \n \n[Google star 1][Google star 2][Google star 3][Google star 4][Google star 5]Trustindex verifies that \nthe original source of the review is Google. \nA great service and fantastic communication, David was very patient and always quick to help.\n Posted on Google [Google] \n [Nidhin profile picture] \n Nidhin \n \n[Google star 1][Google star 2][Google star 3][Google star 4][Google star 5]Trustindex verifies that \nthe original source of the review is Google. \n\"Excellent service from start to finish. Jonathan Vickery was outstanding throughout the entire proc\ness — incredibly professional, patient and knowledgeable. He guided us through every step of setting\n up our first supplement product with G&G, from formulation and specification to packaging and order\n confirmation. Nothing was too much trouble and he always responded quickly and clearly. We are a ne\nw brand and Jonathan made the whole experience smooth and confidence-inspiring. Highly recommend G&G\n and would not hesitate to work with them again. Thank you Jonathan and the whole G&G team!\"\n Posted on Google [Google] \n [Ronald Leask profile picture] \n Ronald Leask \n \n[Google star 1][Google star 2][Google star 3][Google star 4][Google star 5]Trustindex verifi"
