          "page_text": "[ Skip to content ][1] [[G&G logo]][2] Generic selectors Exact matches only Search in title Search in content Post Type Selectors seedprod * [What We Do][3] * [White Label Products][4] * [Vitamins][5] * [Minerals][6] * [Botanicals][7] * [Digestion and Live Bacteria][8] * [Specialist Blends][9] * [Antioxidants][10] * [Collagen][11] * [Omega & Oils][12] * [Active Nutrition][13] * [Sexual Health][14] * [Vegan Specialities][15] * [About][16] * [Contact Us][17] ## Vitamin Manufacture Sussex based supplement manufacture for nearly 60 years [Get Your Supplement Made With G&G ][18] Generic selectors Exact matches only Search in title Search in content Post Type Selectors seedprod [[G&G logo]][19] Navigation Menu [Get Your Supplement Made][20] Navigation Menu * [What We Do][21] * [White Label Products][22] * [About][23] * [Contact Us][24] * [Brochure Request][25] * [Get a Quote][26] # A Family Run Supplement Manufacturer G&G is the most experienced vitamin and supplement manufacturer in the UK. We prioritise health and well-being by using the purest ingredients, avoiding fillers and excipients. No matter the size of your business, G&G can produce high-quality supplements to help grow your brand. G&G made products for numerous brands can be found on store shelves everywhere from high street to Harrods. [White Label][27] [Private Label][28] [[heart]][29] ## [No Excipients Used][30] Our manufacturing processes avoid magnesium stearate and additives as standard. [[bell]][31] ## [60 Years of Trusted Experience][32] With 60 years in the supplement industry, we deliver quality and expertise you can rely on. [[comment]][33] ## [Low MOQs][34] Your brand matters to us, no matter the size. Our team is here to guide you through the launch of your product. [[certificate]][35] ## [MHRA GMP, FSSC 22000, HFMA Member and More][36] Our extensive certification is testament to the high quality manufacture we supply. [[user]][37] ## [A Legacy of Family Ownership][38] As a family-owned and operated business, we ensure consistent quality and personal care. [[envira]][39] ## [Tailored Supplements to Meet Your Needs][40] All our supplements are non-GMO and we offer organic and vegan customized options to your requirements. ## Contact G&G to get your supplements made: [Get a Quote][41] [Request a Brochure][42] ## Reviews Posted on Google [Google] [Wayne Klein profile picture] Wayne Klein [Google star 1][Google star 2][Google star 3][Google star 4][Google star 5]Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google. Fantastic friendly professional team of people, very welcoming and helpful! Best, Wayne Klein. Posted on Google [Google] [Dashin Health profile picture] Dashin Health [Google star 1][Google star 2][Google star 3][Google star 4][Google star 5]Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google. A great service and fantastic communication, David was very patient and always quick to help. Posted on Google [Google] [Nidhin profile picture] Nidhin [Google star 1][Google star 2][Google star 3][Google star 4][Google star 5]Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google. \"Excellent service from start to finish. Jonathan Vickery was outstanding throughout the entire proc ess — incredibly professional, patient and knowledgeable. He guided us through every step of setting up our first supplement product with G&G, from formulation and specification to packaging and order confirmation. Nothing was too much trouble and he always responded quickly and clearly. We are a ne w brand and Jonathan made the whole experience smooth and confidence-inspiring. Highly recommend G&G and would not hesitate to work with them again. Thank you Jonathan and the whole G&G team!\" Posted on Google [Google] [Ronald Leask profile picture] Ronald Leask [Google star 1][Google star 2][Google star 3][Google star 4][Google star 5]Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google. Robbie at G&G has been outstanding from start to finish. As a first time brand founder launching a n ew product, the level of support, communication and professionalism has been exceptional. Every ques tion answered quickly and thoroughly. Really excited to be working with G&G and would highly recomme nd them to anyone looking for a quality UK supplement manufacturer. Posted on Google [Google] [Ayub Az profile picture] Ayub Az [Google star 1][Google star 2][Google star 3][Google star 4][Google star 5]Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google. I have been working with G&G for my supplement brand for over a year. They are reliable, have great support, customer service & most importantly use high quality ingredients. Professional in all aspec ts, highly recommended. Posted on Google [Google] [Thomas Patrick profile picture] Thomas Patrick [Google star 1][Google star 2][Google star 3][Google star 4][Google star 5]Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google. I have had an excellent experience with G&G. They keep their word and don't forget about me which is much appreciated. I look forward top having them create my natural supplements for many years to co me. Posted on Google [Google] [Keith Rose profile picture] Keith Rose [Google star 1][Google star 2][Google star 3][Google star 4][Google star 5]Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google. No problems experience, staff are always helpful and promoting new ideas. Posted on Google [Google] [Dr. Vitamins profile picture] Dr. Vitamins [Google star 1][Google star 2][Google star 3][Google star 4][Google star 5]Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google. We’ve had a great experience working with G&G Supplement Manufacture for our magnesium complex. The team is professional, responsive, and easy to work with. The product quality is excellent, and we ap preciate their high standards and attention to detail. A reliable and trustworthy manufacturing part ner – highly recommended. THX/ SWEDEN Posted on Google [Google] [Kurt Hollingsworth profile picture] Kurt Hollingsworth [Google star 1][Google star 2][Google star 3][Google star 4][Google star 5]Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google. Very reliable with clear and responsive communication. They made our first order process smooth from start to finish. ## White Label Categories [Vitamins white label manufacture] [VITAMINS][43] [Minerals white label manufacture] [MINERALS][44] [Botanicals white label manufacture] [BOTANICALS][45] [Digestion & live bacteria white label manufacture] [DIGESTION & LIVE BACTERIA][46] [Specialist blends white label manufacture] [SPECIALIST BLENDS][47] [Antioxidants white label manufacture] [ANTIOXIDANTS][48] [Collagen white label manufacture] [COLLAGEN][49] [Omega & Oils white label manufacture] [OMEGA & OILS][50] [Active nutrition white label manufacture] [ACTIVE NUTRITION][51] [Sexual health white label manufacture] [SEXUAL HEALTH][52] [Vegan specialities white label manufacture] [VEGAN SPECIALITES][53] ## True To Our Roots Founded by David and Sheila Gaiman in 1965, G&G is one of the oldest supplement companies in the world. To this day we are owned and operated by the same family. [G&G Vitamins was founded in 1965.] [Learn Our Full History][54] This short video explains what goes into premium quality supplement manufacture. [View on YouTube][55]. ## Our Supplement Manufacture Certifications Our quality as a supplement manufacturer is exceptional, but don’t just take our word for it. We work with a range of partners who certify our manufacturing practices and cleanroom through regular inspections. * HFMA members * [FSSC22000 Cleanroom][56] * Soil Association * [Vegetarian Society][57] * [GMP Certified][58] * Kosher supplements * The Halal Trust [Find out how we produce such high quality supplements.][59] [hfma membership][Mid Sussex District Council Logo] [FSSC 22000 logo][GMP Certified] [Soil As