[Person holding a black Optimum Nutrition shaker bottle with a hand partly covering their face.] # Optimum Nutrition unveils ‘The Optimum Advantage’ [ Full story ][116] [Person holding a black Optimum Nutrition shaker bottle with a hand partly covering their face.] # Optimum Nutrition unveils ‘The Optimum Advantage’ [ Full story ][117] Left / Right ## Welcome to Glanbia We are a better nutrition company, home to leading brands and high-quality ingredients that reach millions of consumers worldwide. We are insight-led and R&D driven to deliver innovative products that make a real difference in people’s lives. ## Our expertise We lead the way in nutrition, creating bespoke solutions and serving growing consumer megatrends. By combining science, market insights and application expertise, we are a trusted partner to companies around the world. [woman jump box gym] ## Performance Nutrition Our leading brands span sports nutrition and lifestyle products. [ Learn More ][118] [6 colourful bottled juices] ## Health & Nutrition We are a global solutions partner, helping customers to create better nutrition products for healthier lives. [ Learn more ][119] [woman eating yogurt] ## Dairy Nutrition Our high performance protein, cheese and bioactive ingredient solutions help customers develop quality products and drive growth in protein-led applications. [ Learn more ][120] ## Transforming & performing We’ve evolved from our dairy roots to become a leader in better nutrition and a trusted innovation partner for the global food industry. Our appetite for success continues, fuelled by strong growth, strategic investment and science led innovation. Adjusted Earnings per Share 134.93 $c Revenue $ 3.9 bn EBITDA $ 499.1 m Cash Conversion 91 % [ Investors ][121] ## [Glanbia stories][122] Latest Glanbia Stories [Wendy Smith Glanbia] Financial [ Wendy Chang Smith appointed CFO Designate ][123] [Read story][124] [people doing the very pink run] Community [ Glanbia community helps raise €900,000 for Breast Cancer Ireland ][125] [Read story][126] [scoop of whey] Dairy Nutrition [ Bioactives: Where dairy expertise meets nutrition innovation ][127] [Read story][128] Financial news News room text only 06 Aug 2026 [ 2026 Half Year Results ][129] 29 Apr 2026 [ Q1 2026 Interim Management Statement ][130] 25 Feb 2026 [ Full Year 2025 Results ][131] Regulatory news [ ALL REGULATORY NEWS ][132] LSE:GLB [Share price centre][133] Upcoming event Q3 2026 Interim Management Statement 04 Nov 2026 [SEE EVENTS][134] report ## Our 2025 Annual Report [ Download ][135] [childrens hands holding growing plants, soil, green leaves] ## Sustainability From carbon to food production and waste, we’re driving sustainability objectives across Glanbia. [ Sustainable action ][136] ## Work with us Ours is a journey you’ll want to share. If you have a passion for nutrition and a global mindset, come and join our team of 5,800 employees all over the world. [ Discover career opportunities ][137] [two people looking at laptop screen] Close popup Left Right [Glanbia plc] Delivering better nutrition for every step of life's journey. #### Results & Reports * [Sustainability Report 2024][138] * [Annual Report][139] * [FY25 Presentation][140] * [FY25 Results][141] #### Quick Links * [Procurement][142] * [Careers][143] * [Locations][144] * [Media][145] * [Contact][146] * [Shareholder Advisory][147] * [Site Services][148] #### Keep in touch Stay up to date, register for our alerts service [Sign up to alerts][149] Copyright © Glanbia PLC 2026. All rights reserved. #### Footer * [Terms of Use][150] * [Privacy notice][151] * [Cookie policy][152] * [Cookie settings][153] * [Accessibility][154] * [Modern Slavery Act][155] * [Site Map][156] [1]: #main-content [2]: /media/press-releases [3]: /media/press-releases [4]: /media/media-library/videos [5]: /media/media-library/images [6]: /media/media-factsheets [7]: /media/media-contacts [8]: /careers/who-we-are [9]: /contact [10]: https://www.optimumnutri