[ LSE ][132] [ NYSE ][133] [Health professionals][134] EN Back Choose Your Language [English][135] [Spanish][136] [Portuguese][137] xml_lse xml_nyse # For health **with humanity** ## Hello. ## We are **Haleon.** Haleon is a consumer company that is solely focused on better everyday health. Our people, our brands, our research, our investment and our innovation are aimed at improving the everyday health of consumers, throughout all stages of their lives. [ Get to know us ][138] [Haleon - hp images - half-year] On 30 July, we published our 2026 Half Year Results [ 2026 Half Year Results ][139] [Haleon - hp images - our-brands] We work to put better everyday health in more hands through our superior brands, including Sensodyne, Advil and Centrum. [ Our brands ][140] [Black-and-white banner featuring a person holding a product against a clean, minimalist background, representing Haleon’s strategy and vision.] Through our Win as One strategy, we aim to reach one billion more consumers by 2030 and deliver industry-leading shareholder returns. [ Our strategy ][141] [Black-and-white image of two people using everyday health products, highlighting positive health outcomes and real-life impact.] Haleon advances better everyday health with humanity through its Health Inclusivity and Sustainability strategy. [ Our impact ][142] Loop animations ### 170 Markets we operate in ### 6 Global categories ### 1.4bn Consumers reached ### £11bn Revenue FY2025 ## Investors For the most up to date information on financial performance, shareholder services and more information, please visit our investor centre. [ Investor centre ][143] ## Events Upcoming * 29 Oct 2026 ### Q3 2026 Trading Statement [Add to calendar 29-10-2026 18:23 Europe/London Q3 2026 Trading Statement Europe/London 2022 Full Year Results false ][144] [ All events ][145] ## Documents March 2025 [ ### Explore our Annual Report ][146] ## Regulatory news * [ Total Voting Rights and Capital ][147] * [ Cash Tender Offer - Pricing, Expiration and Result ][148] 19 August 2026 * [ Transactions in Own Shares & Buyback Update ][149] 19 August 2026 * [ Transactions in own shares ][150] 17 August 2026 [ View all news ][151] [ Sign up for news ][152] ## [News][153] [ View all stories ][154] Go back to top of page [ [Logo for Haleon] ][155] This link opens in new tab * [ Instagram ][156] * [ Youtube ][157] * [ Linkedin ][158] * [ TikTok ][159] * [ Facebook ][160] (c) 2022-${year} Haleon Group of Companies. Trade marks are owned by or licensed to the Haleon Group of Companies. All rights reserved. Haleon plc. Registered in England and Wales No. 13691224. Registered office: Building 5, First Floor, The Heights, Weybridge, Surrey, KT13 0NY ### Useful links * [Report a side effect][161] * [Health Professionals][162] * [Innovation Portal][163] * [Supplier Portal][164] * [Accessibility][165] * [Sitemap][166] ### Resources * [Material Safety Data Sheets][167] * [Modern Slavery Statement ][168] * [California Transparency in Supply Chains Act][169] * [Code of conduct][170] * [Terms of use][171] * [Trademark and Brand Guidelines][172] * [Privacy Notice][173] [ Your Privacy Choices ][174] * [Washington Consumer Health Data Notice][175] * US Transparency in Coverage * [United Healthcare][176] ### STAY INFORMED Sign up to stay up-to-date with all things Haleon [Register to receive alerts][177] Please ensure Javascript is enabled for purposes of [website accessibility][178] [1]: /investors/share-price-tools [2]: /investors/share-price-tools [3]: / [4]: /es [5]: /pt [6]: / [7]: /contact [8]: /who-we-are [9]: /our-brands [10]: /our-impact [11]: /investors [12]: /careers [13]: /news [14]: /who-we-are [15]: /who-we-are/strategy [16]: /who-we-are/where-we-operate [17]: /who-we-are/leadership [18]: /who-we-are/Governance [19]: /who-we-are/Governance/board-and-board-committees [20]: /who-we-are/Governance/codes-policies-and-standards [21]: /who-we-are/Governance/material-safety-data-sheets [22]: /who-we-are/Governance/