              "summary": "Open navigation menu Menu\n[ Heights [store logo] ][1]\n[ Login to your account ][2] Open cart drawer 0 [ SHOP ALL ][3]\nOpen navigation menu Menu\n[ Heights [store logo] ][4]\n[ Login to your account ][5] Open cart drawer 0 [ SHOP ALL ][6]\n\n[BUILD YOUR ROUTINE & SAVE UP TO 20%][7]\n\n# Everything you need, nothing you don't\n\n4.8/5 based on 14,000+ reviews\n\n## Everything you need, nothing you don't\n\nFeel your best with science-backed supplements for your brain,\nbody and gut.\n\n[ SHOP ALL ][8] [ BUNDLE & SAVE ][9]\n* Voted overall #1 product for sleep, magnesium, multivitamin & electrolyte drink\n* Winner of Condé Nast's Traveller Beauty Awards 2026: the best in wellness\n* I was less inclined to doomscroll and felt more productive.\n* Thanks to its smart packaging, the formula stays in tip-top shape for longer.\n* The best super supplements\n  to take!\n\n## Why most supplements don't work\n\nCheap ingredients, untested formulas and unnecessary fillers deliver disappointing results.\n\nOur supplements contain high-impact ingredients, for results you can feel.\n\n**We're different**\n\n2,100+ scientific\n\nstudies\n\nDelayed-release capsule technology\n\nClinically proven\nin controlled trials\n\nTrusted by 150,000+ customers\n\n## Fuelling the BWT Alpine F1 team \n\nAs the **official performance supplement supplier to the BWT Alpine Formula 1 Team**, every Heights\nformula is batch-tested and Informed Sport certified.\n\nScience-led ingredients. Clinically backed results. Whether you’re racing for pole position or the\n7:41am train.\n\n[ SHOP ALL ][10]\n\n## Great teams trust Heights\n\n## Find your formulation\n\nWe’re committed to scientific rigour, investing in independent research and evidence-based\ndevelopment, so you can trust every capsule.\n* Multivitamin\n* Probiotic\n* Magnesium\n* NAD⁺\n* Your daily foundation 20 essential nutrients to fuel your body and mind. Most people start here.\n  [ Shop Vitals⁺ ][11]\n* Your all-rounder 7 high-impact probiotic strains for your gut, plus zinc for daily resilience.\n  [ Shop Biotic⁺ ][12]\n* Your sleep upgrade With magnesium glycinate, the most bioavailable form of magnesium.\n  [ Shop Magnesium⁺ ][13]\n* Your longevity staple Support healthy cellular ageing with a NAD⁺ precursor and CoQ10.\n  [ Shop Thrive⁺ ][14]\nMultivitamin Probiotic Herbal\nSCIENCE YOU CAN FEEL\n\n## First RCT-backed multivitamin in UK adults\n\n%\n\n### increase in vitamin B9 levels\n\n*Vitals⁺ results from a 12-week, double-blind, randomised, placebo-controlled clinical trial.\n\n[ SHOP VITALS⁺ ][15]\n\n*Vitals⁺ results from a 12-week, double-blind, randomised, placebo-controlled clinical trial.\n\nREAL-LIFE IMPACT\n\n## Keep everything running smoothly\n\n%\n\n### said they felt lighter\n\n*Results from an 8-week study of 33 healthy participants.\n\n[ SHOP BIOTIC⁺ ][16]\n\n*Results from an 8-week study of 33 healthy participants.\n\nDESIGNED TO WORK FAST\n\n## Your off switch, bottled\n\n%\n\n### felt impact in 1 hour\n\n*Results from a 14-day study of 88 healthy Heights Lab members.\n\n[ SHOP CALMER⁺ ][17]\n\n*Results from a 14-day study of 88 healthy Heights Lab members.\n\n## Why Heights comes out on top\n\nClean, vegan formulas\n\nNo fillers, toxins, or unnecessary preservatives.\n\nBioavailable ingredients\n\nFormulated in impactful doses for maximum results.\n\nOptimal absorption\n\nDelayed-release capsule delivers nutrients where they’re needed.\n\nScience-led\n\nProven results in third-party testing (in vivo and in vitro).\n\n[ SHOP NOW ][18]\n\n## Why Heights comes out on top\n* Clean, vegan formulas\n  \n  No fillers, toxins, or unnecessary preservatives.\n* Bioavailable ingredients\n  \n  Formulated in impactful doses for maximum results.\n* Optimal absorption\n  \n  Delayed-release capsule delivers nutrients where they’re needed.\n* Science-led\n  \n  Proven results in third-party testing (in vivo and in vitro).\n\n## Feel the difference, proven by science\n\nVitals⁺\nB-vitamin levels up +114%\n\nOur double-blind, placebo, randomised controlled trial showed Vitals⁺ significantly increased levels\nof vitamins B6, B9 (folate) and B12.\n"
