          "page_text": "Open navigation menu Menu [ Heights [store logo] ][1] [ Login to your account ][2] Open cart drawer 0 [ SHOP ALL ][3] Open navigation menu Menu [ Heights [store logo] ][4] [ Login to your account ][5] Open cart drawer 0 [ SHOP ALL ][6] [BUILD YOUR ROUTINE & SAVE UP TO 20%][7] # Everything you need, nothing you don't 4.8/5 based on 14,000+ reviews ## Everything you need, nothing you don't Feel your best with science-backed supplements for your brain, body and gut. [ SHOP ALL ][8] [ BUNDLE & SAVE ][9] * Voted overall #1 product for sleep, magnesium, multivitamin & electrolyte drink * Winner of Condé Nast's Traveller Beauty Awards 2026: the best in wellness * I was less inclined to doomscroll and felt more productive. * Thanks to its smart packaging, the formula stays in tip-top shape for longer. * The best super supplements to take! ## Why most supplements don't work Cheap ingredients, untested formulas and unnecessary fillers deliver disappointing results. Our supplements contain high-impact ingredients, for results you can feel. **We're different** 2,100+ scientific studies Delayed-release capsule technology Clinically proven in controlled trials Trusted by 150,000+ customers ## Fuelling the BWT Alpine F1 team As the **official performance supplement supplier to the BWT Alpine Formula 1 Team**, every Heights formula is batch-tested and Informed Sport certified. Science-led ingredients. Clinically backed results. Whether you’re racing for pole position or the 7:41am train. [ SHOP ALL ][10] ## Great teams trust Heights ## Find your formulation We’re committed to scientific rigour, investing in independent research and evidence-based development, so you can trust every capsule. * Multivitamin * Probiotic * Magnesium * NAD⁺ * Your daily foundation 20 essential nutrients to fuel your body and mind. Most people start here. [ Shop Vitals⁺ ][11] * Your all-rounder 7 high-impact probiotic strains for your gut, plus zinc for daily resilience. [ Shop Biotic⁺ ][12] * Your sleep upgrade With magnesium glycinate, the most bioavailable form of magnesium. [ Shop Magnesium⁺ ][13] * Your longevity staple Support healthy cellular ageing with a NAD⁺ precursor and CoQ10. [ Shop Thrive⁺ ][14] Multivitamin Probiotic Herbal SCIENCE YOU CAN FEEL ## First RCT-backed multivitamin in UK adults % ### increase in vitamin B9 levels *Vitals⁺ results from a 12-week, double-blind, randomised, placebo-controlled clinical trial. [ SHOP VITALS⁺ ][15] *Vitals⁺ results from a 12-week, double-blind, randomised, placebo-controlled clinical trial. REAL-LIFE IMPACT ## Keep everything running smoothly % ### said they felt lighter *Results from an 8-week study of 33 healthy participants. [ SHOP BIOTIC⁺ ][16] *Results from an 8-week study of 33 healthy participants. DESIGNED TO WORK FAST ## Your off switch, bottled % ### felt impact in 1 hour *Results from a 14-day study of 88 healthy Heights Lab members. [ SHOP CALMER⁺ ][17] *Results from a 14-day study of 88 healthy Heights Lab members. ## Why Heights comes out on top Clean, vegan formulas No fillers, toxins, or unnecessary preservatives. Bioavailable ingredients Formulated in impactful doses for maximum results. Optimal absorption Delayed-release capsule delivers nutrients where they’re needed. Science-led Proven results in third-party testing (in vivo and in vitro). [ SHOP NOW ][18] ## Why Heights comes out on top * Clean, vegan formulas No fillers, toxins, or unnecessary preservatives. * Bioavailable ingredients Formulated in impactful doses for maximum results. * Optimal absorption Delayed-release capsule delivers nutrients where they’re needed. * Science-led Proven results in third-party testing (in vivo and in vitro). ## Feel the difference, proven by science Vitals⁺ B-vitamin levels up +114% Our double-blind, placebo, randomised controlled trial showed Vitals⁺ significantly increased levels of vitamins B6, B9 (folate) and B12. 1 hour extra sleep In a 12-week third-party study, Vitals⁺ improved sleep by an average of 1 extra hour per night, supporting deeper rest. 55% improvement in cognitive function On average, Vitals⁺ improved working memory by 55%, helping participants feel sharper. Biotic⁺ Over 50x more live bacteria delivered Under SHIME® testing, replicating the upper digestive tract Biotic⁺’s delayed-release capsules delivered over 50x more live bacteria than standard probiotics. Increase in microbial diversity In a placebo-controlled study, after 8 weeks 100% of people maintained or increased their microbial diversity – a key marker of a stronger microbiome. 73% of people felt lighter In our placebo-controlled trial, after 8 weeks 73% of participants reported an improvement in daily mood. Calmer⁺ 83% felt more calm & relaxed In a 2 week trial with 88 of our Heights’ Community Lab members, 83% felt noticeably more calm, relaxed and clear-headed. 76% felt effects within 1 hour In the same 2 week trial, 73% reported feeling the effects within the first 1 hour. 84% saw improved sleep quality In the same 2 week trial, 84% said their sleep quality improved due to feeling more relaxed before bed. ## Made by doctors and dietitians Our scientific advisory board’s research has been cited in over 59,000 peer-reviewed publications. So you can trust our supplements deliver results. Dr. Tara Swart **MD**, **PhD** Science Advisor | MIT Sloan Read bio Sophie Medlin **RD **Head of Nutritional Research | City Dietitians Read bio Dr. Harry Jarrett **PhD, MRSB** Director of Science & Research | Heights Read bio Oliver Patrick **Physiologist** Chief Wellbeing Officer | Heights Read bio Professor Mary Ward **PhD, RD, BSc** Professor of Nutrition and Dietetics | Ulster University Read bio Professor Andy Jones **BSc, PhD, DSC** Professor of Applied Physiology | University of Exeter Read bio Dr. Agata Sobczynska-Malefora **PhD, MSc, FRSC, CChem, CSci** Consultant Clinical Scientist & Honorary Senior Clinical Lecturer / Synnovis, St Thomas' Hospital Read bio Professor Shumone Ray **MBBS (Hons), MPH, MD, DNHE, RNutr** Professor of Global Nutrition & NNEdPro Chief Scientist Read bio Professor Anne-Marie Minihane **PhD, BSc** Professor of Nutrigenetics| UEA Medical School Read bio * Dr. Tara Swart **MD**, **PhD** Science Advisor | MIT Sloan Read bio * Sophie Medlin **RD **Head of Nutritional Research | City Dietitians Read bio * Dr. Harry Jarrett **PhD, MRSB** Director of Science & Research | Heights Read bio * Oliver Patrick **Physiologist** Chief Wellbeing Officer | Heights Read bio * Professor Mary Ward **PhD, RD, BSc** Professor of Nutrition and Dietetics | Ulster University Read bio * Professor Andy Jones **BSc, PhD, DSC** Professor of Applied Physiology | University of Exeter Read bio * Dr. Agata Sobczynska-Malefora **PhD, MSc, FRSC, CChem, CSci** Consultant Clinical Scientist & Honorary Senior Clinical Lecturer / Synnovis, St Thomas' Hospital Read bio * Professor Shumone Ray **MBBS (Hons), MPH, MD, DNHE, RNutr** Professor of Global Nutrition & NNEdPro Chief Scientist Read bio * Professor Anne-Marie Minihane **PhD, BSc** Professor of Nutrigenetics| UEA Medical School Read bio * **GLUTEN** * **GMOs** * **DAIRY** * **ANIMAL BY-PRODUCTS** * **FILLERS** * **ALLERGENS** * **CONTAMINANTS** * **SUGAR** * **ADDITIVES** * **TOXINS** * **HEAVY METALS** ## What our customers have to say Stephen Fry Actor, Comedian, Author I hope I'm smart enough to know that excessive claims are silly, but I can certainly say with all truth that taking Heights has coincided with me feeling uncommonly fresh, perky, and lively in the mind. I'm a huge fan of it! Carol Vorderman Broadcaster, Author, Media personality I’m 64 and I feel bloody fantastic. I used to wake up at 3 or 4AM, every night. Now I sleep like a baby. Spencer Matthews Entrepreneur & British TV personality I feel like I've found a very simple solution that keeps me energised and balanced, and ready to tackle whatever the day brings. I know I'm giving my body everything it needs so I can perform at my best, day-in-day-out. Vogue Williams Investor, Podcaster As a busy mum, I’m always keeping my eyes peeled for good-value ways to look after myself and my family. If you want the complete package, the bundle from Heights—Vitals⁺ and Biotic⁺—is so easy, and helps me be my best self. Ben Shephard TV Presenter, Journalist 8 interviews back-to-back, 6 voices in my ear, all on live TV. I've no room for error. These are my go-to for staying sharp. Matt Willis Singer, Musician I used to take 20 supplements a day. No lie. And now I take 3. I instantly felt more cognitive, like my brain worked better, and I felt like I was focused throughout the day. I woke up not feeling tired. I woke up ready to go. The only thing I was doing differently was Heights. Jake Humphrey TV presenter & podcaster People don't understand that having a healthy gut can help give you a healthy body. It improves the function of your mind, to your work, to your relationships. It's so important. And I finally found the perfect answer—Biotic⁺ by Heights. Renée Elliott Founder of Planet Organic One thing I know is high quality supplements, as I've been selecting only the best for our stores from the start. Heights is so good I've bought 5 subscriptions - my family are all fans and you should be too. Dr. Ali Abdaal Doctor, YouTuber, Podcaster By taking 2 every morning, you get all of the essential nutrients you need without having to deal with drinking sludge. [ See our reviews ][19] [ See our reviews ][20] Stephen Fry Actor, Comedian, Author I hope I'm smart enough to know that excessive claims are silly, but I can certainly say with all truth that taking Heights has coincided with me feeling uncommonly fresh, perky, and lively in the mind. I'm a huge fan of it! Carol Vorderman Broadcaster, Author, Media personality I’m 64 and I feel bloody fantastic. I used to wake up at 3 or 4AM, every night. Now I sleep like a baby. Spencer Matthews Entrepreneur & British TV personality I feel like I've found