M, living by clean standards is what we do. But we don’t just say it, we certify it with backup from independent third-parties. [Clean Label Project Certified][Prevented Ocean Plastic][Non-GMO Project Certified] ## The GLP-1 Fiber Flight Double Your Flavors, Double Your GLP-1 [ Shop Now ][89] ## Stack & Sculpt Save $10 when you try something new. [ ][90] ## The HUM Subscription: Wellness on Your Terms * Save 30% on every order - simply bundle and subscribe. * Earn loyalty points * FREE samples with every order * Switch or pause at any time–you’re always in control [Get Started][91] ## 1 Prevents 2 We care about your wellness and the wellness of our planet. Every time you buy a HUM bottle made from Prevented Ocean Plastic™, you prevent the equivalent of 2 plastic water bottles from entering our oceans. [Learn More][92] Offer valid until 9/23/2026 at 11:59pm PST. Offer will automatically apply when subscription is processed. Valid for $10 off new products added to cart and the subtotal exceeds the previous order's subtotal and meet the minimum order requirement of $49. Offer valid on http://humnutrition.com only. Offer valid on active subscriptions only. Offer will apply on qualifying subscription orders with a ship date scheduled between 8/25/2026 and 9/23/2026. Offer may not be used in combination with any other promotion code and are for one-time use. Offer may be used in combination with subscription discount and Buy three Saving discount. Offer may not be used in combination with third-party loyalty, reward, or cash-back programs. Offers cannot be applied to previously placed, or pending orders. Offers apply to authorized purchases only. Only authorized orders will be processed and shipped. We reserve the right to cancel any order due to unauthorized, altered, or ineligible use of the offer and to modify or cancel this promotion due to system error or unforeseen problems. Other restrictions may apply. ## Footer ### Shop ### Shop * [ Debloat & Digestive Health ][9