          "page_text": "Your cart (0 Item) [icon-X] Close cart [stars] **557** reviews Your cart is empty Explore our Best-Selling Products. See What People Are Saying “I have been taking these for around 2 years on a daily basis. On the odd times when I haven’t taken them in between ordering more, there is a noticeable difference in my energy levels. You get what you pay for and these tablets are worth every penny.” [Five Star] Tara “I started taking Inessa Advanced Multivitamin back in November 2019. A year and a half earlier I was diagnosed with a chronic illness and nothing really helped to get me better. Through a friend I got introduced to the lovely founder of Inessa.. [Five Star] Julia P. “I have been taking the Advanced daily for at least 6 months and find it to be the ideal Multivitamin supplement to be taking. I also am really pleased with the quality and the service from the order process communication and delivery and am please...” [Five Star] Rodger C. “Finally, a probiotic that works.Less bloating, better digestion, and more energy — all from one capsule. I’m genuinely impressed.” [Five Star] Sophie M. [Feature Image] Loading [Skip to content][1] [ DON'T KNOW WHERE TO START? CLICK HERE TO TAKE OUR QUIZ ][2] [ [Logo] ][3] * [ Home ][4] * Shop [icon-chevron] Expand submenu * [icon-chevron-left] Collapse submenu [ Shop ][5] * [ Products ][6] * [ Subscribe & Save ][7] [ [Inessa Advanced Multivitamin] Advanced Multivitamin Comprehensive support for daily health ][8] [ [Inessa Pregnancy Multinutrient] Pregnancy Multinutrient Formulated for maternal and fetal health ][9] [ [Inessa Advanced Omega 3 Fish Oil] Advanced Omega 3 Fish Oil High potency omega-3 EPA & DHA ][10] [ [Inessa Magnesium] Magnesium Supports muscle function & relaxation ][11] [ [Inessa Advanced Daily Biotic] Advanced Daily Biotic Biotic formula for gut health ][12] [ [Inessa Advanced Biotic Complex] Advanced Biotic Complex Comprehensive microbiome support ][13] [ Shop All Products ][14] * [ Speak to a nutritionist ][15] * About [icon-chevron] Expand submenu * [icon-chevron-left] Collapse submenu [ About ][16] * [ Press ][17] * [ Giving Back ][18] * [ FAQs ][19] * [ Wellness Hub ][20] * [ Contact ][21] * [Log in ][22] * [ Search ][23] # Inessa [ ][24] * Shop * [ Products ][25] * [ Subscribe & Save ][26] * [ Speak to a nutritionist ][27] * About * [ Press ][28] * [ Giving Back ][29] * [ FAQs ][30] * [ Wellness Hub ][31] * [ Contact ][32] [ [account] Log in ][33][ [icon-search] Search ][34] [icon-hamburger] [icon-X] Menu [ [icon-cart]Cart 0 ][35] [icon-hamburger] [icon-X] Menu # Inessa [ ][36] [ [icon-cart]Cart 0 ][37] Search Search [icon-X] Close (esc) # Really effective supplements, made with real integrity We make clinical grade supplements based on real-patient experience and price them honestly. [ Shop products ][38] 4.9 based on 6444+ customers [ ][39] ### Don’t Know ### Where To Start? [ Click here to take our quiz ][40] ### Not sure what you need? Get expert help Book a free 15-minute call with our qualified nutritionist — get personalized recommendations based on your health goals [ Click here to book your free call ][41] Real Results, Real People “I have been taking these for around 2 years on a daily basis. On the odd times when I haven’t taken them in between ordering more, there is a noticeable difference in my energy levels. You get what you pay for and these tablets are worth every penny.” [Star Image] Tara “I started taking Inessa Advanced Multivitamin back in November 2019. A year and a half earlier I was diagnosed with a chronic illness and nothing really helped to get me better. Through a friend I got introduced to the lovely founder of Inessa.... [Star Image] Julia P. “I have been taking the Advanced daily for at least 6 months and find it to be the ideal Multivitamin supplement to be taking. I also am really pleased with the quality and the service from the order process communication and delivery and am please.... [Star Image] Rodger C. ##### As seen in ## Serious about your health? ## We are. As a clinical practice, we could see what our customers needed and where the supplement industry was falling short. So we went the extra mile to create our own. We now make exceptional quality supplements at fair prices, supported by evidence-based, impartial nutrition advice, for a 360 degree approach to your optimal health and wellbeing. Professional strength Allergy friendly Made in the UK Convenient Our philosophy ## We like to keep things real Real insight Treating people in our clinic gave us a real understanding of their needs. We saw patients struggle to take multiple supplements and used our expertise to make something better. Real life Taking multiple tablets is pricey and fiddly. At Inessa, we live in the real world. Our supplements cost less than other clinical brands and minimise the need to take separate products. Real ingredients No unnecessary fillers, colourings or additives. Third-party tested and Vegan Society approved. All our nutrients are clinical-grade, have real benefits and we never compromise on quality. [Inessa founder Aliza Marogy] Real integrity We don’t believe in taking shortcuts. Being independently owned means we’re not under pressure to create bigger margins, so we never cut corners on ingredients or dosing. [Real innovation] Real innovation Our collections are constantly evolving as new research emerges. Bespoke production techniques allow us to create powerful combinations of nutrients in their most absorbable forms. [Real results] Real results You want to feel your best, not just better. You want to feel great now, as well as in the future. So we go the extra mile to combine premium ingredients in relevant doses, for your optimum wellness. [Aliza founder of Inessa] ## Our story “At 18 I developed an autoimmune condition and used diet and supplements to find my way back to health. This led me to train as a nutritional therapist, but I found my clients would struggle to take multiple tablets each day. Certain there must be a better way, I pulled together the best developers and researchers to streamline supplements and create the most effective formulas. Today we make the kind of products I wish were available when I was in clinical practice.” Aliza Marogy Nutritional Therapist & ND Founder of Inessa [ Inessa Instagram ][42] [ Learn more about Inessa ][43] ## What makes Inessa different? Optimal doses Our doses are based on current science and they pack a powerful punch. But while they’re strong enough to be effective, we never use ingredients in unnecessarily high amounts and our doses are always within strict European safety standards. Honesty We’ll never tell you that our supplements are a substitute for a healthy lifestyle. While we take the hard road to make them as effective as possible, they’re designed to support your health as part of an overall wellness regime that incorporates exercise and a nutrient-packed diet. Evidence-based From the ingredients you’ll find in our products to the content you’ll read in our Wellness Hub, and the free nutrition calls our team offer, everything we do at Inessa is evidence-based and backed by meticulous research. Clinician-made, clinician-recommended All formulations are based on science and on real-patient experience in-clinic. They’re also recommended by experts in the field. Bioavailability What good is a nutrient if your body can’t absorb it? Every ingredient comes in its most absorbable form, even if it costs us more to produce. Purity We don’t use any unnecessary additives or chemicals such as titanium dioxide, flavourings or colourings. Our Omega 3 oils offer exceptional purity at levels that surpass industry standards. Vegan Society approved With the exception of our fish oil, all supplements are Vegan Society tested and approved, or going through the registration process. Independent We have no investors pushing us to cut corners on our manufacturing so we make more profit. It means we can truly put your health first, without ever having to compromise on quality. Third-party tested Our supplements are tested by independent labs for strength and purity, and some are certified by Informed Sport to ensure that athletes can use them without concern. Science Everything we do is backed by the latest science. If the research changes, so do our formulations. Price We keep our clinical grade supplements affordable. We make sure we price them less than our competitors, so that more people can benefit their health. How Inessa works ## Your optimal health starts here Decide on your goals For example: – Energy – Gut – Immunity – Joints – Calm and balance – Pregnancy – General health Can't decide? [Take our 60-second online consultation.][44] Choose your formula Forget multiple-pill supplement regimes. Our products combine ingredients to keep things streamlined - and cheaper! Your wellbeing, your way. Order & start your daily health habit We deliver straight to your door so making a daily commitment to your future health couldn’t be simpler. Get 10% off with an easy-to-start, easy-to-stop subscription that you can postpone whenever you want. [Learn more][45] [Shop now][46] ## Seriously good products, for people who are serious about their health. [icon-chevron-left] [icon-chevron] Best Seller [ ][47] [Inessa Advanced Multivitamin][48] 1600 reviews 25 nutrients in meaningful doses. 100mg of CoQ10. One devoted global following. No other once-daily multivitamin and mineral product on the market comes close to this one... [Recommended in Men's Fitness] [Informed Sport] [Vegan Society Registered] [RECOMMENDED IN SHEERLUXE] [RECOMMENDED IN GLAMOUR] [2024 Hip & Healthy Multivitamin Mental Health] [Women's Fitness] [Recommended in Vogue] [TOP PICK BBC GOOD FOOD] [ > Learn more ][49] Best Seller [ [Inessa Advanced Omega 3 Fish Oil] ][50] [Inessa Advanced Omega 3 Fish Oil][51] 909 reviews High strength. Ultra pure. Made from small, wild, sustainable fish. Get game-changing levels of EPA and DHA in just one, non-fishy, soft gel. [Recommended in Vogue] [Recommended in Men's Fitness] [Editor's Choice 2021 - Wellbeing] [Omega 3 hip & healthy award 2023] [RECOMMENDED IN SHEERLUXE] [RECOMMENDED IN GET THE GLOSS] [Recommended in Independent] [GQ Badge] [The Halal Trust] [Women's Fitness Australia] [Recommended in Daily Mail] [BBC GOOD FOOD] [Recommended in The Standard] [ > Learn more ][52] [ [Inessa Advanced Daily Biotic] ][53] [Inessa Advanced Daily Biotic][54] 702 reviews Healthy gut = vibrant you. Show your tummy some love with a daily dose of Lactobacillus Rhamnosus GG, the best clinically documented strain of good bacteria in the world. [Recommended in Evening Standard] [Recommended in Closer] [Vegan Society Registered] [RECOMMENDED IN SHEERLUXE] [RECOMMENDED IN GLAMOUR] [ > Learn more ][55] [ [Inessa Advanced Biotic Complex] ][56] [Inessa Advanced Biotic Complex][57] 947 reviews Multi-award winning, and with good reason. A completely unique once-daily complex combining 7 strains of powerful biotics, including 5 billion saccharomyces boulardii organisms. [Recommended in The Sunday Times] [Recommended in Independent] [As seen on Sheerluxe] [Recommended in Closer] [Recommended in Forbes] [Best Supplement for gut health 2021] [Best Probiotic Supplement 2021] [Vegan Society Registered] [recommended in expert reviews] [abc get the gloss award 2023] [Recommended in The Standard] [ > Learn more ][58] [ ][59] [Inessa BioSoothe - New, improved smell][60] 298 reviews Multi-award winning BioSoothe contains a potent combination of 9 calming ingredients with vitamin D for normal inflammatory response, all wrapped up in a delayed-release capsule. [Recommended in Vogue] [Best Anti Inflammatory 2021] [Digestion Recommended 2022] [Vegan Society Registered] [RECOMMENDED IN GET THE GLOSS] [Recommended in Men's",
