][ESG\nRatings][74][ESG Governance][75]\n[Careers][76]\n[Contact][77]\n[+91 22 6640 2323][78][info@lupin.com][79]\n[About Us][80][Our\nBusiness][81][Investors][82][Media][83][Community][84][Sustainability][85][Careers][86][Contact][87]\n[Overview][88][The Lupin Story][89][Our Purpose][90][Our Values][91][Our Leadership][92][Compliance,\nEthics and Governance][93][Global Presence][94][Our Manufacturing Approach][95][Quality in\nAction][96][Our Science][97][Awards and Recognitions][98]\n[+91 22 6640 2323][99][info@lupin.com][100]\nAdvancing\nCare for All\n\nLupin’s journey is a testament to the potential of human imagination, compassion, and the unwavering\npursuit of a better tomorrow.\n\n[Know More][101]\n\n> \"Some journeys are measured in kilometers. Others are measured in lives changed.\"\n\nThis is the story of one man and his unique journey\nThis is the Lupin Story\n[Know More][102]\nIntegrated Report 2025–2026\n[Know More][103]\nWith S&P Global ESG Score of 91, we are\nWorld No.1\n\n> in sustainability in the pharmaceutical industry\n\n[Know More][104]\n\n## The Lupin Story\n\nDriven by Science,\nInspired by Patients\n\nFounded by Dr. Desh Bandhu Gupta in 1968,\nLupin aimed to improve access to essential\nmedicines. Today we stand tall as a globally\ntrusted pharmaceutical company guided by\nscience, quality, and a patient-first mindset.\n\n[\nKnow More\n][105]\n\n## Our Purpose\n\nWe Catalyze\nTreatments\nThat Transform\nHope Into\nHealing\n\nOurs is a purpose-driven\njourney of over 5 decades,\nwhere we aim to improve\nlives, build sustainability\nand deliver long-term\nsolutions to all.\n\nRelief from disease\n\nDelivering meaningful\ntreatments for today and\ntomorrow\n\nInnovation to unlock access at scale\n\nMaking complex, cutting-edge\nhealthcare solutions accessible\nto all\n\n[Know More][106]\nSolutions for underserved communities\n\nServing markets and patients\noverlooked by others\n\n## Overview\n\nGlobal Impact\nHuman Touch\n0+\n\nGlobal Facilities\n\n[Know More][107]\n0+\n\nCountries\n\n[Know More][108]\n0+\n\nEmployees\n\n[Know More][109]\n0+\n\nProducts\n\n[Know More][110]\n\n## Our Business\n\nLupin operates a highly d"
