          "page_text": "[[Lupin Logo][Lupin Logo]][1] [About Us][2] [Our Business][3] [Investors][4] [Media][5] [Community][6] [Sustainability][7] [Careers][8] [Contact][9] [Globe] [Menu]Menu [Globe] [[India flag icon]India][10][[USA flag icon]USA][11][[Great Britain flag icon]UK][12][[South Africa flag icon]South Africa][13][[Australia flag icon]Australia][14][[Philippines flag icon]Philippines][15][[Germany flag icon]Germany][16][[Netherlands flag icon]Netherlands][17][[Mexico flag icon]Mexico][18][[Brazil flag icon]Brazil][19][[Canada flag icon]Canada][20][[Switzerland flag icon]Switzerland][21] Close About Us [Overview][22][The Lupin Story][23][Our Purpose][24][Our Values][25][Our Leadership][26][Compliance, Ethics and Governance][27][Global Presence][28][Our Manufacturing Approach][29][Quality in Action][30][Our Science][31][Awards and Recognitions][32] Our Business [Overview][33][Global Generics][34][Emerging Markets][35][India][36][Specialty and Innovation][37][Biosimilars][38][Our Adjacencies][39] Investors [Overview][40] Financial Reporting [Financial Information][41][Quarterly Results][42][Integrated Report][43][Financial Statements of Subsidiaries][44] Corporate Governance [Our Leadership][45][Committees of the Board][46][Code of Conduct][47][Policies][48][MOA and AOA][49] Shareholder Information [Stock Exchange Intimations][50][AGM, Postal Ballot, and EGM][51][Shareholding Pattern][52][Share Price][53][Ratings][54][Dividend][55][Unclaimed Dividend and Shares][56][Employee Stock Option Schemes][57][Important Communication for Shareholders][58][Investor FAQs][59][Investor Contacts][60] News and Events [Press Releases][61][Presentations][62] [Disclosure Under Regulation 46 of SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015][63] Media [Overview][64][Press Releases][65][Media Coverage][66][Perspectives][67][Media Kit][68] [Community][69] Sustainability [Overview][70][ESG Framework][71][ESG Goals and Progress][72][Key Highlights][73][ESG Ratings][74][ESG Governance][75] [Careers][76] [Contact][77] [+91 22 6640 2323][78][info@lupin.com][79] [About Us][80][Our Business][81][Investors][82][Media][83][Community][84][Sustainability][85][Careers][86][Contact][87] [Overview][88][The Lupin Story][89][Our Purpose][90][Our Values][91][Our Leadership][92][Compliance, Ethics and Governance][93][Global Presence][94][Our Manufacturing Approach][95][Quality in Action][96][Our Science][97][Awards and Recognitions][98] [+91 22 6640 2323][99][info@lupin.com][100] Advancing Care for All Lupin’s journey is a testament to the potential of human imagination, compassion, and the unwavering pursuit of a better tomorrow. [Know More][101] > \"Some journeys are measured in kilometers. Others are measured in lives changed.\" This is the story of one man and his unique journey This is the Lupin Story [Know More][102] Integrated Report 2025–2026 [Know More][103] With S&P Global ESG Score of 91, we are World No.1 > in sustainability in the pharmaceutical industry [Know More][104] ## The Lupin Story Driven by Science, Inspired by Patients Founded by Dr. Desh Bandhu Gupta in 1968, Lupin aimed to improve access to essential medicines. Today we stand tall as a globally trusted pharmaceutical company guided by science, quality, and a patient-first mindset. [ Know More ][105] ## Our Purpose We Catalyze Treatments That Transform Hope Into Healing Ours is a purpose-driven journey of over 5 decades, where we aim to improve lives, build sustainability and deliver long-term solutions to all. Relief from disease Delivering meaningful treatments for today and tomorrow Innovation to unlock access at scale Making complex, cutting-edge healthcare solutions accessible to all [Know More][106] Solutions for underserved communities Serving markets and patients overlooked by others ## Overview Global Impact Human Touch 0+ Global Facilities [Know More][107] 0+ Countries [Know More][108] 0+ Employees [Know More][109] 0+ Products [Know More][110] ## Our Business Lupin operates a highly diversified pharmaceutical business with a strong presence across key global markets. Our operations span generics, complex formulations, branded products, and other high-burden specialty segments, supported by robust R&D and manufacturing capabilities. Spread across developed and emerging markets, Lupin's business is anchored in patient-centric approach and operational excellence. [ Know More ][111] [Healthcare Professional with Patient] Stock Quotes Last updated on — NSE : — — — — BSE : — — — — Financial Results [ Know More ][112] Exchange Filings [ Know More ][113] [Sustainability] ## Sustainability Caring for People, Planet, Patients Our mission extends beyond medicines. We invest in people, communities, and a greener tomorrow. [ Know More ][114] [CSR Activities] ## Community Beyond Medicines Lupin Foundation works in 5,500+ villages in 8 states of India. At the core of Lupin's community work is a passion to build sustainable models for uplifting lives. [ Know More ][115] [Life at Lupin] ## Life ## at Lupin Our people are the driving force behind our mission to improve patients’ lives and longevity. [ Join Our Team ][116] ## News and Insights [ Know More ][117] 20 August, 2026 Lupin and Tenpoint Therapeutics Announce Strategic Partnership to Commercialize YUVEZZI™ in the European Union, the United Kingdom, Switzerland, Norway, and Iceland [ Know More ][118] 4 September, 2026 Lupin Receives U.S. FDA Approval for Modafinil Tablets, USP [Lupin Logo] [info@lupin.com][119] [+91 22 6640 2323][120] [Contact Us][121] [Consumer Advisory Notification][122] © 2025 Lupin. All rights reserved [Privacy][123] | [Disclaimer][124] | [Sitemap][125] | Cookie settings [About Us][126] * [The Lupin Story][127] * [Our Purpose][128] * [Our Values][129] * [Our Leadership][130] * [Compliance, Ethics and Governance][131] * [Global Presence][132] * [Our Manufacturing Approach][133] * [Quality in Action][134] * [Our Science][135] * [Awards and Recognitions][136] [Our Business][137] * [Global Gene