              "summary": "[[Max Biocare]][1]\n \n[[Max Biocare]][2]\n[Join us now][3]\n* [About][4]\n  * [Max Biocare Group][5]\n  * [Our People][6]\n  * [Where we are][7]\n  * [News][8]\n* [Our Brands][9]\n  * [Max Biocare][10]\n    * [Medicine][11]\n    * [Nutrition][12]\n    * [Cosmetics][13]\n    * [All Products][14]\n  * [Little Étoile][15]\n    * [Baby Food & Nutrition][16]\n    * [Baby Topical Care][17]\n    * [Mother’s Care][18]\n  * [Belmarama][19]\n  * [Salvarity][20]\n  * [Pawlavie][21]\n  * [Garden of Wellness][22]\n  * [MBc SwimVive 360™][23]\n* [Innovation & Science][24]\n  * [Max Biocare Institute][25]\n  * [Scientific Research][26]\n  * [Scientific Partners][27]\n* [Clinical Trials][28]\n* [Research Parks][29]\n* [Our Commitments][30]\n  * [Evidence based – Natural – Trust][31]\n  * [Quality management][32]\n  * [Sustainability][33]\n  * [Code of Conduct][34]\n  * [Education][35]\n\n# Welcome toMax Biocare\n\nMax Biocare is a bioscience and healthcare company that strives to keep families, animals, the land\nand environment healthy, through ethical and sustainable research and innovation.\n\n## Scientific Research\n\nEvidence-based research is the backbone of our operations and is the first place we start from along\nthe innovation and development pathway. As part of this approach, many of our products have been the\nsubject of clinical trials, performed by specialist  health professionals and researchers around the\nworld.\n\n[Learn more][36]\n\n## Max Biocare Research Parks\n\nThe Max Biocare Research Parks are where science and nature coalesce. It is the realization of our\nvision of getting closer to nature, in our development of naturally-inspired, sustainable and\npractical innovations that benefit the  health and nutrition of humans, animals, and the\nsustainability of the environment.\n\n[Learn more][37]\n\n## Max Biocare\n\nMedicinal Products\n\nMax Biocare places a strong emphasis on maintaining pharmaceutical standards at all stages of\nmanufacture, even when they are not required. This illustrates our commitment to safety, efficacy\nand quality in all of our products.\n\n[https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/max-biocare_maxucosa_600x600-1-320x320.png]\n\n### Maxucosa\n\nContains a clinical dose of 500mg of fucoidan to support immune system health, skin health and\nrelieve inflammation.\n\n[More Details][38]\n[https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/max-biocare_LE4_600x600-320x320.png]\n\n### Optimum Growing-Up Formula\n\nWith reinforced levels of essential nutrients to assist in maintaining healthy growth and\ndevelopment and supporting resilience through early childhood’s more challenging periods.\n\n[More Details][39]\n\n## Little Étoile\n\nNutrition Products\n\nOur infant and toddler food and nutrition products use premium ingredients that are sustainably\nsourced, verified to be safe, and manufactured to Max Biocare’s stringent Quality Management System.\n\n## Belmarama\n\nSkin & Personal Care\n\nOur unique range of natural skincare and cosmeceutical products is scientifically formulated, \ndermatologically validated, clinically trialled and manufactured using sustainable materials and\nprocesses.\n\n[https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/max-biocare_belmarama_600x600-320x320.png]\n\n### Advanced Skin Repair Capsules\n\nHydrating Anti-wrinkle Serum A multi-action, complex formulation that penetrates the deeper skin\nlayers to repair, hydrate and protect against age-related changes, including fine lines, roughness,\nthinning and pigmentation irregularities.\n\n[More Details][40]\nMedicinals\n\n## Max Biocare\n\nMax Biocare places a strong emphasis on maintaining pharmaceutical standards at all stages of\nmanufacture, even when they are not required. This illustrates our commitment to safety, efficacy\nand quality in all of our products.\n\n[More Details][41]\n[https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Mbc_HomePage_MedicicalsMBc_655x601-1280x1175-\n1.webp]\n[https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Mbc_HomePage_CosmeticsMBc_655x601-1280x1175-1\n.webp]\nCosmetics\n\n## Max B"
            }
          },
          "page_text": "[[Max Biocare]][1] [[Max Biocare]][2] [Join us now][3] * [About][4] * [Max Biocare Group][5] * [Our People][6] * [Where we are][7] * [News][8] * [Our Brands][9] * [Max Biocare][10] * [Medicine][11] * [Nutrition][12] * [Cosmetics][13] * [All Products][14] * [Little Étoile][15] * [Baby Food & Nutrition][16] * [Baby Topical Care][17] * [Mother’s Care][18] * [Belmarama][19] * [Salvarity][20] * [Pawlavie][21] * [Garden of Wellness][22] * [MBc SwimVive 360™][23] * [Innovation & Science][24] * [Max Biocare Institute][25] * [Scientific Research][26] * [Scientific Partners][27] * [Clinical Trials][28] * [Research Parks][29] * [Our Commitments][30] * [Evidence based – Natural – Trust][31] * [Quality management][32] * [Sustainability][33] * [Code of Conduct][34] * [Education][35] # Welcome toMax Biocare Max Biocare is a bioscience and healthcare company that strives to keep families, animals, the land and environment healthy, through ethical and sustainable research and innovation. ## Scientific Research Evidence-based research is the backbone of our operations and is the first place we start from along the innovation and development pathway. As part of this approach, many of our products have been the subject of clinical trials, performed by specialist health professionals and researchers around the world. [Learn more][36] ## Max Biocare Research Parks The Max Biocare Research Parks are where science and nature coalesce. It is the realization of our vision of getting closer to nature, in our development of naturally-inspired, sustainable and practical innovations that benefit the health and nutrition of humans, animals, and the sustainability of the environment. [Learn more][37] ## Max Biocare Medicinal Products Max Biocare places a strong emphasis on maintaining pharmaceutical standards at all stages of manufacture, even when they are not required. This illustrates our commitment to safety, efficacy and quality in all of our products. [https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/max-biocare_maxucosa_600x600-1-320x320.png] ### Maxucosa Contains a clinical dose of 500mg of fucoidan to support immune system health, skin health and relieve inflammation. [More Details][38] [https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/max-biocare_LE4_600x600-320x320.png] ### Optimum Growing-Up Formula With reinforced levels of essential nutrients to assist in maintaining healthy growth and development and supporting resilience through early childhood’s more challenging periods. [More Details][39] ## Little Étoile Nutrition Products Our infant and toddler food and nutrition products use premium ingredients that are sustainably sourced, verified to be safe, and manufactured to Max Biocare’s stringent Quality Management System. ## Belmarama Skin & Personal Care Our unique range of natural skincare and cosmeceutical products is scientifically formulated, dermatologically validated, clinically trialled and manufactured using sustainable materials and processes. [https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/max-biocare_belmarama_600x600-320x320.png] ### Advanced Skin Repair Capsules Hydrating Anti-wrinkle Serum A multi-action, complex formulation that penetrates the deeper skin layers to repair, hydrate and protect against age-related changes, including fine lines, roughness, thinning and pigmentation irregularities. [More Details][40] Medicinals ## Max Biocare Max Biocare places a strong emphasis on maintaining pharmaceutical standards at all stages of manufacture, even when they are not required. This illustrates our commitment to safety, efficacy and quality in all of our products. [More Details][41] [https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Mbc_HomePage_MedicicalsMBc_655x601-1280x1175- 1.webp] [https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Mbc_HomePage_CosmeticsMBc_655x601-1280x1175-1 .webp] Cosmetics ## Max Biocare Max Biocare Dermal Formulating Lab offers a range of products including serums, creams, peels and liquid products for various needs, with specific focus on babies, growing children, and women who are pregnant or breastfeeding. [More Details][42] Nutritionals ## Little Étoile Our infant and toddler food and nutrition products use premium ingredients that are sustainably sourced, verified to be safe, and manufactured to Max Biocare’s stringent Quality Management System. [More Details][43] [https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/maxbiocare_littetoile_nutrition_970x800.webp] [https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Mbc_HomePage_CosmeticsMBc_655x601-1-1280x1175 -1.webp] Care ## Little Étoile A custom designed range to protect the sensitive skin and special dermatological needs of pregnant and breastfeeding mums, babies and young kids. 100% of our evidence-based, natural, premium range has been safety tested and scientifically validated. [More Details][44] Food & Nutrition for Pet ## Pawlavie We offer premium, great tasting, and healthy products with naturally-derived, quality ingredients, specifically formulated to meet the different needs of our little friends at various stages. From growing kittens and puppies, to adult cats and dogs. [More Details][45] [https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/maxbiocare_pawlavie_nutrition_970x800.webp] [https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/maxbiocare_pet_homepage-1280x1056-1.webp] Topical Care for Pets ## Pawlavie Pawlavie Topical Care & Cosmetics are scientifically formulated to meet the unique requirements for keeping our furry friends clean and happy. Our shampoos, washes, coat-care and skincare products are manufactured using naturally-derived ingredients, according to our strict GMP standards. We practice “Tested on Human First – No Animal Testing”. [More Details][46] ## Garden of Wellness Nestled in the serene landscapes of South-West Gippsland, the Max Biocare Research Parks embody our commitment to naturally crafted products, refined by science. Here, we focus on sustainability, purity, and innovation, though a carefully curated portfolio of wellness and lifestyle solutions, including premium Topical Care formulations. These feature our exclusive ingredients, including MBc Herbal Honey, Grape-derived Uvalife® blend and Aqnadene® Mineral-rich water. Every creation is a celebration of nature’s finest, reimagined for modern wellbeing. [More Details][47] [https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/maxbiocare-gow_971x801.webp] [https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Mbc_HomePage_SkinCareBelmarama1_655x601-1280x 1175-1.webp] Skin & Personal Care ## Belmarama Belmarama delivers premium, dermatologically validated skincare made with quality, naturally derived ingredients and enhanced with innovative delivery systems. Alongside our targeted facial treatments, Belmarama also offers a complete topical care range for women at all life stages, including pregnant and breastfeeding mothers, designed to nurture and protect both facial and body skin during this special stage of life. Gentle, effective, and thoughtfully formulated, Belmarama brings together nature, science, and innovation to support healthier, radiant skin. [More Details][48] Gentle, Effective Care for Teen Skin ## Salvarity Salvarity is dedicated to supporting teenage skin with clean, safe formulations that are free from unnecessary harsh ingredients. Each product is dermatologically developed to respect sensitive young skin, while our environmentally conscious approach ensures we care for the planet as much as we care for your skin. Thoughtfully crafted, the Salvarity range provides targeted solutions designed to meet the unique needs of teens – helping them feel confident in their natural, healthy skin. [More Details][49] [https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Mbc_HomePage_CosmeticsSal_655x601-1280x1175-1 .webp] [https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Mbc_HomePage_SwimCare_655x601-1280x1175-1.web p] Science-Led Swim Care ## MBc SwimVive 360™ **MBc SwimVive 360™** is a science-led swim care platform developed to support swimmers of every age – from first swimming lessons to lifelong participation and performance sport. Powered by proprietary SwimShield™ technology, it brings together complete before swim, cleanse recovery and after care routines for swim schools, aquatic centres, retailers, resorts and travel partners. [More Details][50] ## Our Commitment Max Biocare’s guiding principles of an evidence-based approach, a preference for naturally-derived materials, and an assurance of paramount quality and sustainable practices, have continuously driven us to excel in everything we do. Being diverse is not enough. We also recognize the need to do what we do well, with relentless attention to detail, and focus on every single aspect of the product journey, not just the destination. [Our full commitments][51] [https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/max-biocare_homepage_commitment1_900x550.png] [https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/max-biocare_our-business_900x500-01-scaled.we bp] ## News Load more #### [Meet the Scientists behind our products - **View All**][52] Tom van WunnikND, RT, NU, Fellow of ANTA George A. ThouasBSc, MRepSc, PhD Christopher HalkiasBSc (Hons), PhD Mark T. WaddinghamBBiomedSci, BSc (Hons), PhD Ben H. ParmenterBNut&Diet (Hons) Max Biocare brings over 20 years of experience as an international innovator in bioscience and healthcare. We focus on creating tailored, practical solutions in the areas of: * Mycology * Pharmaceuticals/Supplements * Food & Nutrition * Cosmeceuticals * Veterinary Health ###### OUR BRANDS * [Max Biocare][53] * [Little Étoile][54] * [Belmarama][55] * [Salvarity][56] * [Pawlavie][57] * [Gardern of Wellness][58] * [MBc SwimVive 360™][59] * [View all][60] ###### OUR BUSINESS * [Naturally Derived Ingredients][61] * [Pharmaceuticals & Nutraceuticals][62] * [Food & Nutrition][63] * [Skin & Personal Care][64] ###### CLINICAL TRIALS * [Omega-3][65] * [Joint aches and pains][66] * [Sperm health][67] * [Sexual health][68] * [Menopausal][69] * [View all][70] # OUR NETWORK [[https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/max-biocare_b2b-2026_MBc_790x304-1.png]][71] [[https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/max-biocare_b2b-2026_LENutrition_790x304-1.p ng]][72] [[https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/max-biocare_b2b-2026_LEBabyCare_790x304-1.pn g]][73] [[https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/max-biocare_b2b-2026_LEMC_790x304-1.png]][74 ] [[https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/max-biocare_b2b-2026_Sal_790x304-1.png]][75] [[https://www.maxbiocare.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/max-biocare_b2b-2026_Pal_790x304-1.png]][76] **Max Biocare Group** acknowledges the Wurrunjeri Woi Wurrung and Bunurong peoples of the East Kulin nation, and the Braiakaulung people of the Gunnaikurnai Nation, on whose lands our business is conducted. We respectfully acknowledge their Ancestors and Elders, past, present and emerging. ©2022 MAX BIOCARE PTY LTD. All rights reserved * [T&C][77] * [Privacy Policy][78] * [Contact Us][79] [1]: https://www.maxbiocare.com/ [2]: https://www.maxbiocare.com/ [3]: https://www.facebook.com/australia.maxbiocare [4]: https://www.maxbiocare.com/about-us/ [5]: /about-us/#max-biocare-group [6]: /about-us/#our-people [7]: /about-us/#where-are-we [8]: https://www.maxbiocare.com/category/news/ [9]: https://www.maxbiocare.com/our-brands/ [10]: /our-brands/#max-biocare [11]: https://www.maxbiocare.com/product-category/medicine/ [12]: https://www.maxbiocare.com/product-category/nutrition/ [13]: https://www.maxbiocare.com/product-category/cosmetics/ [14]: https://www.maxbiocare.com/shop/ [15]: /our-brands/#little-etoile [16]: https://littleetoile.com/category/food-nu",
