            "intel": {
              "summary": "# Trusted health and wellness partner\n\n[Vivek Dhawan Ji]\n\n## We care For Your Wellness\n\nOur CEO & Chief Coach Mr. Vivek Dhawan shares why Mega We care is committed to helping people stay\nhealthy for as long as they live.\n\n[Watch Video][1]\n[Elearning Mega Desk 2]\n\n## Your Health, Made Simple\n\nDiscover free online programs that guide you with expert advice, practical tips, and real results.\n\n[Explore Our Programs][2]\n[Online Health Risk Assesment Home Banner Desk]\n\n## Invest in your health today: Try our Online Health Risk Assessment Tool!\n\n[Start Now][3]\n[Good Health By Yourself]\n\n## Good Health By Yourself\n\nEmpowering individuals and communities to take charge of their own health.\n\n[Explore More][4]\n[Women We care]\n\n## Women We care\n\nEmpowering every stage of womanhood, for her to stay healthy & happy\n\n[Explore Now][5]\n30+\n\nCountries Served\n\n60%\n\nFemale Workforce\n\n500+\n\nQuality Products\n\n40 Million\n\nLives Impacted Annually\n\n## We care: Let's Prioritize Your Health Together\n* Good Health by Yourself\n* Health Calculators\n* Health Apps\n* Wellness We care\n* Healthcare Practitioner\n\n## Good Health by Yourself\n\nYour journey to wellness starts here\n\nTaking charge of your health enables you to function at your best, both mentally and physically.\nLearn about the best ways to stay healthy and maintain overall wellbeing.\n\n[Explore More][6]\n[Fitness]\n[Fitness][7]\n[Nutrition V31]\n[Nutrition][8]\n[Wellbeing]\n[Wellbeing][9]\n[Health Conditions]\n[Health Conditions][10]\n[Explore More][11]\n\n## Health Calculators\n\nTake the right measures for good health\n\nTry our user-friendly health calculators and online assessment tools to understand your health\nbetter and empower yourself towards making informed decisions for optimal overall health and\nwellbeing.\n\n[Comprehensive Health Test Icon]\n[Online Health Risk Assessment Tool][12]\n[Bmi Calculator]\n[BMI Calculator][13]\n[Bmr 2D V2]\n[BMR Calculator][14]\n[Body Fat Calculator 2D V2]\n[Body Fat Calculator][15]\n[Explore More][16]\n[Explore More][17]\n\n## Health Apps\n\nA home for innovation in wellness\n\nDigital solutions for personalised healthcare management and improved health outcomes.\n\n[Know More][18]\n[#]\n[Diabetes][19]\n[Mother & Child]\n[Mother & Child][20]\n[Wellness]\n[Wellness][21]\n[Know More][22]\n\n## Wellness We care\n\nYour gateway to holistic wellbeing\n\nThe Wellness We care Center is Thailand's first health training facility dedicated to disease\nprevention, treatment, rehabilitation, and disease transformation through lifestyle modifications.\n\n[Know More][23]\n[Knowledge]\n[Knowledge][24]\n[WeCare Programs]\n[Programs][25]\n[Resources]\n[Resources][26]\n[Know More][27]\n\n## Healthcare Practitioner\n\nEmpowering healthcare practitioners\n\nResource center for healthcare practitioners across the globe to deliver improved patient care.\n\n[Know more][28]\n[Events]\n[Events][29]\n[Prescription Medicines]\n[Prescription Medicines][30]\n[Resources]\n[Resources][31]\n[Know more][32]\n\n## Trending blogs\n\nGet information & inspiration to take charge of your own health.\n\n[Read more blogs][33]\n[ steamed orange for cough — halved orange with salt steaming in a bowl]\n[ steamed orange for cough — halved orange with salt steaming in a bowl][34]\n[Cough and Cold][35]\n\n### [Steamed Orange With Salt For Cough: How It Works And How To Make It][36]\n\n[Benefits Of Washing Your Face At Night And How]\n[Benefits Of Washing Your Face At Night And How][37]\n[Skincare][38]\n\n### [Top 10 Benefits Of Washing Your Face At Night][39]\n\n[Best Herbal teas for bloating and gas relief]\n[Best Herbal teas for bloating and gas relief][40]\n[Digestive Health][41]\n\n### [10 Best Teas for Bloating: Natural Relief for Digestion][42]\n\n[Read more blogs][43]\n\n## Explore our products\n* Wellness & Nutrition\n* Health Concerns\n* Prescription Medicines\n\n[Medical Nutrition]\n\n### Medical Nutrition\n\n[Medical Nutrition][44]\n[Sports Nutrition]\n\n### Sports Nutrition\n\n[Sports Nutrition][45]\n[General Wellbeing]\n\n### General Wellbeing\n\n[General Wellbeing][46]\n[Vitamins]\n\n### Vitamins\n\n[Vitamins][4"
            }
