          "page_text": "# Trusted health and wellness partner [Vivek Dhawan Ji] ## We care For Your Wellness Our CEO & Chief Coach Mr. Vivek Dhawan shares why Mega We care is committed to helping people stay healthy for as long as they live. [Watch Video][1] [Elearning Mega Desk 2] ## Your Health, Made Simple Discover free online programs that guide you with expert advice, practical tips, and real results. [Explore Our Programs][2] [Online Health Risk Assesment Home Banner Desk] ## Invest in your health today: Try our Online Health Risk Assessment Tool! [Start Now][3] [Good Health By Yourself] ## Good Health By Yourself Empowering individuals and communities to take charge of their own health. [Explore More][4] [Women We care] ## Women We care Empowering every stage of womanhood, for her to stay healthy & happy [Explore Now][5] 30+ Countries Served 60% Female Workforce 500+ Quality Products 40 Million Lives Impacted Annually ## We care: Let's Prioritize Your Health Together * Good Health by Yourself * Health Calculators * Health Apps * Wellness We care * Healthcare Practitioner ## Good Health by Yourself Your journey to wellness starts here Taking charge of your health enables you to function at your best, both mentally and physically. Learn about the best ways to stay healthy and maintain overall wellbeing. [Explore More][6] [Fitness] [Fitness][7] [Nutrition V31] [Nutrition][8] [Wellbeing] [Wellbeing][9] [Health Conditions] [Health Conditions][10] [Explore More][11] ## Health Calculators Take the right measures for good health Try our user-friendly health calculators and online assessment tools to understand your health better and empower yourself towards making informed decisions for optimal overall health and wellbeing. [Comprehensive Health Test Icon] [Online Health Risk Assessment Tool][12] [Bmi Calculator] [BMI Calculator][13] [Bmr 2D V2] [BMR Calculator][14] [Body Fat Calculator 2D V2] [Body Fat Calculator][15] [Explore More][16] [Explore More][17] ## Health 