n Care][89] [FERROVIT] ### FERROVIT Stride ahead with strength of iron [FERROVIT][90] [Women's Care][91] [NAT C] ### NAT C Your body gets more “C” with NAT C! [NAT C][92] [General Wellbeing][93] [NORMAGUT] ### NORMAGUT Normalises gut health, safely and naturally [NORMAGUT][94] [Probiotics][95] ## We care for your wellness Helping you make better choices for a healthy and fulfilling life every day! * Probiotics * Cough & Cold * Herbal Meds * Women We care * Medical Nutrition [Probiotics] Probiotics, the friendly microbes when consumed, have a beneficial effect on health and well-being. [Explore Probiotics][96] [Cough And Cold Eugica] Our all-natural range for Cough & Cold uses the power of herbs and soothing botanicals to effectively target symptoms. [Explore Cough & Cold][97] [Herbal Meds] Herbal meds restore the natural balance of your body through herbal remedies that have stood the test of time. [Explore Herbal Meds][98] [Women We care] Empowering every stage of womanhood for her to stay healthy and happy. [Explore Women We care][99] [Medical Nutrition] Discover science-based nutrition for diabetes, immunity, recovery, cancer care and everyday wellness. [Explore Medical Nutrition][100] [ [Learn more] Learn more][101] [we are mega] At MEGA, we care for your wellness. Small steps together can make a big difference when it comes to your health and wellbeing. * ### MEGA Way * ### MEGA Values * ### MEGA Commitment * ### MEGA Objective * ### MEGA Dharma * [More About Us][102] ### MEGA Way The MEGA Way is to build a THINKING organisation which will CHANGE before it is forced to and Live and GROW beyond each of us [Read More][103] ### MEGA Values RESPECT each others differences FREEDOM in your work and personal lives TRUST you as an adult TRUTH in what we do everyday [Read More][104] ### MEGA Commitment MEGA is committed to provide Quality Products and Services to our Customers through Constant Improvement and Innovation [Read More][105] ### MEGA Objective MEGA's objective is to create value by Marketing and Selling Medicines in Developing Countries [Read More][106] ### MEGA Dharma WE CARE For your wellness For your health For you to stay healthy as long as you live… [Read More][107] [More About Us][108] [ ### MEGA receives Best Employer Brand Award at the 18th Employer Branding Awards in Bangkok ][109] [ [MEGA receives Best Employer Brand Award at the 18th Employer Branding Awards in Bangkok] MEGA receives Best Employer Brand Award at the 18th Employer Branding Awards in Bangkok][110] ## Our businesses Helping you stay healthy as long as you live. [Our businesses] Help people stay healthy as long as they live [Know More][111] [Maxxcare logo] Market access solutions in Myanmar, Vietnam & Cambodia [Know More][112] [Nutural We Care 239x184] Inspiring shift to life-changing plant-based way of living [Know More][113] [Wellness We Care 239x184] Prevent and reverse chronic diseases by yourself [Know More][114] [Health Home We Care] Empowering you to take charge of your health digitally [Know More][115] ## More about ## MEGA We care * Sustainability * Investor Relations * Press Release * Our Leadership For us here at MEGA Lifesciences, sustainability isn't just about profitable growth. It's also about building an organisation that's self-sustaining over a long-term existence. [More about sustainability][116] [ [Inside Mega We Care] Inside Mega We Care][117] [ [Inside Mega We Care] Inside Mega We Care][118] [ [Inside Mega We Care] Inside Mega We Care][119] [More about sustainability][120] Delivering value to our shareholders with utmost transparency and timely information. [More about investor relations][121] [ [Inside Mega We Care] Inside Mega We Care][122] [ [Inside Mega We Care] Inside Mega We Care][123] [ [Investor Final 1] Investor Final 1][124] [More about investor relations][125] Read more about Mega Lifesciences as featured in print and digital news articles across the world. [More about press release][126] [More about press release][127] Meet our visionary leaders steering MEGA We care’s journey towards success. [More about leadership][128] [ [Board of Directors] Board of Directors][129] ### [Board of Directors][130] [ [Company Executives] Company Executives][131] ### [Company Executives][132] [ [CEO's message] CEO's message][133] ### [CEO's message][134] [More about leadership][135] ## CEO's message We are doing everything possible to bring the right knowledge to you, so you can make the right choices to manage your health, so you can live life free, independent, and continue walking till you live. Vivek Dhawan CEO & Chief Coach [Read more ][136] [Vivek Dhawan] Copyright © 2026 MEGA Lifesciences Public Company Limited. All Rights Reserved. [1]: /# [2]: https://elearning.megawecare.com/?utm_source=megawecare&utm_medium=banner&utm_campaign=lms_camp aign [3]: /good-health-by-yourself/health-calculators/online-health-risk-assessment-tool [4]: /good-health-by-yourself [5]: /women-we-care [6]: /good-health-by-yourself [7]: /good-health-by-yourself/fitness [8]: /good-health-by-yourself/nutrition [9]: /good-health-by-yourself/wellbeing [10]: /good-health-by-yourself/health-conditions [11]: /good-health-by-yourself [12]: /good-health-by-yourself/health-calculators/online-health-risk-assessment-tool [13]: /good-health-by-yourself/health-calculators/bmi-calculator [14]: /good-health-by-yourself/health-calculators/bmr-calculator [15]: /good-health-by-yourself/health-calculators/body-fat-calculator [16]: /good-health-by-yourself/health-calculators [17]: /good-health-by-yourself/health-calculators [18]: https://joinwecare.com/?utm_source=megawecare&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=parent_site&utm _content=homepage_link [19]: https://joinwecare.com/diabetes [20]: https://joinwecare.com/mother-child [21]:",
