          "page_text": "[skip to content][1] [open menu][[Home]][2] Search Metagenics[Submit search] [Cart][3] Welcome! * [Shop Products][4] * [Gennah AI Product Advisor][5] * Explore by Category Back * [Bundle & Save][6] * [Brain & Cognitive Health][7] * [Digestion & Probiotics][8] * [Heart Health][9] * [Essential Wellness][10] * [Immune Health][11] * [Liver & Detox][12] * [Magnesium][13] * [Omega-3 & Fish Oils][14] * [Pain, Bone & Joint][15] * [Protein & Sports Nutrition][16] * [Sleep][17] * [Stress, Mental Health][18] * [Vitamins & Minerals][19] * [Weight & Management][20] * [Women’s Health][21] * [Men’s Health][22] * [Kid’s Health][23] * [Shop All][24] * [Wellness Blog][25] * About Us Back * [Our Story][26] * [Heritage & History][27] * [Quality][28] * [Sustainability][29] * [HCP Community][30] * [The Science][31] * [Metagenics Partners][32] Sign In New Customer?[Create Account][33] Back to Routine Hero Banner # DOCTOR GRADE VITAMINS & SUPPLEMENTS ## Support your health as seasons change. Explore supplements for focus, sleep, energy, immunity, and gut health to help you stay well as summer winds down and routines return. [ Explore Seasonal Support ][34] [Person holding a bag of Metagenics MagActive® 3-in-1 Magnesium Chews and an individually wrapped chew, highlighting a return to healthy daily routines and wellness habits during seasonal transitions.] [Person holding a bag of Metagenics MagActive® 3-in-1 Magnesium Chews and an individually wrapped chew, highlighting a return to healthy daily routines and wellness habits during seasonal transitions.] [ ### Healthy aging ### starts here Shop Collagen [Hand holding a Metagenics StayStrong+ 4-in-1 Collagen Whole Body Chew against a gold background.] [Hand holding a Metagenics StayStrong+ 4-in-1 Collagen Whole Body Chew against a gold background.] ][35] [ ### Start feeling ### less bloated Explore Probiotics [Gut health vitamins & supplements featuring Metagenics UltraFlora Fiber, Prebiotic & Probiotic powder being poured into a glass of water.] [Gut health vitamins & supplements featuring Metagenics UltraFlora Fiber, Prebiotic & Probiotic powder being poured into a glass of water.] ][36] Trust Bar * [DNA double helix icon, representing purity and potency of Metagenics vitamins and supplements.] Guaranteed purity & potency * [Icon of a healthcare practitioner wearing a stethoscope, representing practitioner trust in Metagenics nutrition supplements.] Trusted by 50K+ doctors * [Laboratory beaker icon representing scientific research that goes into every vitamin and supplement made by Metagenics.] Clinically studied ingredients * [Shield icon with checkmark representing Metagenics' 60-day supplement satisfaction guarantee, providing assurance in every purchase.] 60-day money back guarantee ## Science you can feel™ * ### [StayStrong+ 4-in-1 Collagen Whole Body Chew][37] Four types of collagen in one chew, supporting joints, movement, and skin.* 4.3 [ NEW [StayStrong+ 4-in-1 Collagen Whole Body Chew] ][38]Quick Add * ### [UltraFlora® Fiber, Prebiotic & Probiotic][39] Triple-action, gentle fiber supplement powder with prebiotics and probiotics for digestive regularity without bloating. 4.3 [ [UltraFlora® Fiber, Prebiotic & Probiotic] ][40]Quick Add * ### [PhytoMulti® Multivitamin][41] Science-backed multivitamin for daily cellular health and overall wellness* 4.8 [ Best Seller [PhytoMulti® Multivitamin] ][42]Quick Add * ### [OmegaGenics® 5-in-1 Fish Oil 1000 mg EPA-DHA][43] 5-in-1 omega-3 fish oil supplement for heart, brain, eye, immune and joint health* 4.6 [ [OmegaGenics® 5-in-1 Fish Oil 1000 mg EPA-DHA] ][44]Quick Add Health Needs ## Explore by category * [ Brain & Cognitive Health [Brain outline icon] ][45] * [ Digestion & Probiotics [Stomach outline icon] ][46] * [ Immune Health [Shield with immune cell icon] ][47] * [ Fish Oils & Omega-3s [Fish outline icon] ][48] * [ Stress & Mental Health [Stressed face outline icon] ][49] * [ Vitamins & Minerals [Two supplement tablets outline icon] ][50] * [Banner image] ## Stir, sip, and feel the difference. Stress? Soreness? Sleepless nights? NEW MagActive™ magnesium powders mix easily into your day, supporting your body when modern life pulls you in every direction. [Shop MagActive][51] * [Banner image] ## Your cycle. Your balance. Your power. HerWellness® formulas support hormone health—without drugs so you feel centered and in sync. Stay calm, feel steady, and embrace every phase of your cycle. [Explore HerWellness®][52] * [Smiling man with a beard holding a Metagenics UltraFlora Probiotic + Multivitamin bottle in a warmly lit modern room, reading the label.] ## Tired of guessing which probiotic is right for you? Choosing a probiotic can be overwhelming. Our doctors designed this 5-question quiz to simplify the search and help you find your best-fit formula fast. [Start the Quiz][53] As Seen In — AS SEEN IN — [Vogue logo, showing that Metagenics is featured by top lifestyle and wellness publications.] [iHerb logo, indicating that Metagenics products are available through the iHerb online wellness retailer.] [GoodRx logo, indicating that Metagenics is referenced through the GoodRx healthcare and prescription savings platform.] [Fullscript logo, indicating that Metagenics products are available through the Fullscript practitioner-recommended supplement platform.] [WebMD logo, indicating that Metagenics has been featured by a widely recognized health and medical information platform.] [The New York Times logo, highlighting that Metagenics is recognized by a respected national news organization.] [Healthline logo, showing that Metagenics is featured by a trusted health and wellness publication.] [SuppCo logo, indicating that Metagenics products are available and reviewed through the SuppCo supplement comparison and discovery platform.] [Allure Magazine logo, highlighting that Metagenics is recognized by leading beauty and wellness experts.] [Mayo Clinic logo, highlighting that Metagenics products are trusted by leading health institutions.] [Everyday Health logo, indicating that Metagenics has been featured by a trusted health and wellness media publication.] [Forbes Magazine logo, showing that Metagenics has been featured by trusted media and health experts.] [Harper's Bazaar logo, showing that Metagenics is featured by trusted fashion and wellness publications.] Homepage Hero Banner Introducing PracStacks ## Doctor-curated bundles for your health goals Save time and money with supplement bundles designed by practitioners for specific health outcomes — from stress relief to gut health to hormone balance. [ Browse New PracStacks ][54] * [ [Three Metagenics vitamins and supplements in the Calm Mood & Stress Resilience for Women practitioner stack: OmegaGenics EPA-DHA, SeroSyn, and HerWellness Rapid Stress Relief.] [Dr. Melissa Blake, ND] ##### Dr. Melissa Blake, ND Calm Mood & Stress Resilience for Women [Dr. Melissa Blake, ND] ##### Dr. Melissa Blake, ND Calm Mood & Stress Resilience for Women ][55] * [ [Four Metagenics vitamins and supplements in the Daily Detox Support practitioner stack: Clear Change 10-Day Detox Program, UltraFlora Triplebiotic, Vitamin D3 10,000 + K, and OmegaGenics 5-in-1 Fish Oil.] [Portrait of Dr. Patricia Guevara, MD, practitioner who curated the Total Body Reset for Renewed Vitality supplement stack.] ##### Dr. Patricia Guevara, MD Total Body Reset for Renewed Vitality ##### Dr. Patricia Guevara, MD Total Body Reset for Renewed Vitality ][56] * [ [Two Metagenics vitamins and supplements in the Gut Relief Duo practitioner stack: UltraFlora Acute Care Probiotic and SpectraZyme Pancreatic Enzymes.] [Dr. Jen Stagg, ND] ##### Dr. Jen Stagg, ND Gut Relief Duo for Occasional Bowel Distress [Dr. Jen Stagg, ND] ##### Dr. Jen Stagg, ND Gut Relief Duo for Occasional Bowel Distress ][57] * [ [Three Metagenics vitamins and supplements in the Precision Weight & Hormone Balance for Women practitioner stack: Wellness Essentials Women’s Daily Packs, UltraFlora Healthy Weight, and Berberine GT.] [Dr. Bridget Briggs, MD] ##### Dr. Bridget Briggs, MD Precision Weight & Hormone Balance for Women [Dr. Bridget Briggs, MD] ##### Dr. Bridget Briggs, MD Precision Weight & Hormone Balance for Women ][58] [ Browse New PracStacks ][59] * [Banner image] ## Liz Roman “As a functional gut health practitioner, I rely on Metagenics probiotics for their quality and precision. My clients finally get real relief from bloating and discomfort – without wasting money on the wrong products.” [Explore Gut Health Products][60] * [Banner image] ## Tapp Francke Ingolia \"What I love about prescribing Metagenics products is the trust I have in their consistent quality. Their clinical-grade standards, rigorous testing, and research-driven formulations align with my focus on safe, effective client care.\" [Explore PhytoMulti Benefits][61] * [Banner image] ## Rachel Stephens \"I love that Metagenics has rigorous quality standards and invests heavily in research and development. As a practitioner, it gives me confidence that what I’m giving clients is safe, effective, and delivers real, lasting results.\" [Learn Why Practitioners Trust Us][62] Chatbot Banner — Gennah Not sure which supplement is right for you? Meet Gennah. Your personal AI wellness advisor. Get tailored recommendations in under a minute — no quiz, just a conversation. [Ask Gennah][63] [left buttons] [right button] [Metagenics logo] [star icon] **Gennah** (Beta) [new chat icon] How can I help? → The AI Product Advisor is not a human or medical expert. Recommendations aren't medical advice. ## Stay connected to smarter wellness Join the Metagenics® Wellness Community and enjoy members-only discounts, early access to new products, expert health insights to support your lifestyle, and more. [JOIN THE COMMUNITY][64] Partners — GLOBALLY RECOGNIZED BY — [Certified Gluten-Free Organization logo, showing Metagenics products meet strict gluten-free standards.] [USP Verified dietary supplement logo, indicating Metagenics products meet rigorous quality, purity, and potency standards trusted by healthcare professionals.] [Non-GMO Project Verified logo, showing Metagenics supplements are independently verified to avoid genetically modified ingredients.] [Certified B Corporation logo, recognizing Metagenics for meeting high standards of social, environmental, and ethical responsibility.] [Friend of the Sea certification logo, indicating Metagenics uses sustainably sourced marine ingredients in fish oil products.] [Australian Therapeutic Goods Administration logo, showing Metagenics products meet strict international regulatory standards.] * These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. [[Metagenics - Science You Can Feel]][65][Create Account][66] ## Navigation * [Gennah AI Product Advisor][67] * [Shop All Supplements][68] * [Shop PracStacks][69] * [Shop Digestion & Probiotics][70] * [Shop Pain Relief][71] * [Shop Sleep Supplements][72] * [Metagenics Partners][73] * [Join Our Mailing List][74] * [Wellness Blog][75] ## Company * [About Us][76] * [Heritage & History][77] * [Quality][78] * [Sustainability][79] * [B Corp Sustainability Disclosures][80] * [HCP Community][81] * [The Science][82] * [Careers][83] ## Support * [FAQ][84] * [Satisfaction Guarantee][85] * [HSA/FSA How It Works][86] * [Manage Your Subscription][87] * [Returns & Exchanges][88] * [Join Clinical Studies][89] * [Professional FAQ][90] * [Contact Us][91] ## Legal * [Policies][92] * [Your Privacy Choices][93] * [Consumer Hea",
