ss-driven content and resources, and a trusted voice in wellness to help you rest well and rise well. [ View Details ][77] [NATROL Calm logo with a serene sunset over water background] Play video ## Sleep is where health begins, so that's where Natrol® starts. [About us][78] ##### The Natrol® Promise Quality ingredients. Drug free. Non-habit forming. ##### #1 Drug Free Sleep-Aid Brand^ Every night in America, Natrol® is the #1 drug free sleep-aid brand^. From melatonin to magnesium, gummies to drink mixes, we offer a range of sleep products in delicious formats you’ll enjoy. ##### Sleep Better Starting Tonight Our simple and effective wellness products are made so you can always be your best self. Because a better night’s sleep is the key to a great next day. ### 24-HOUR WELLNESS SUPPORT [ [Ultra Sleep 3-in-1 Gummies, 50ct] ][79] New ##### [ Ultra Sleep 3-in-1 Gummies, 50ct ][80] [ [Ultra Sleep 3-in-1 Fast Dissolve Tablets, 30ct] ][81] New ##### [ Ultra Sleep 3-in-1 Fast Dissolve Tablets, 30ct ][82] [ [Ultra Energy 4-in-1 Gummies, 60ct] ][83] New ##### [ Ultra Energy 4-in-1 Gummies, 60ct ][84] ## Natrol® Ultra Sleep is designed with a 3-in-1 sleep blend for better sleep quality.† [Learn More][85] ##### Dream Sleep™ Botanical Blend 50mg Blend Made with a blend of Tart Cherry, Lemon Balm, and Chamomile. ##### GABA 100mg A neurotransmitter that supports relaxation, supports sleep quality, and supports falling asleep faster after just one week. ##### Melatonin 5mg Naturally produced in our bodies and helps manage sleep and wake cycles while being 100% drug free and non-habit forming. Image not actual size* ##### Premium Botanical Blend Made with a blend of Tart Cherry, Lemon Balm, and Chamomile. ##### GABA A neurotransmitter that supports relaxation, supports sleep quality, and supports falling asleep faster after just one week. ##### Magnesium Glycinate Naturally produced in our bodies and helps manage sleep and wake cycles while being 100% drug free and non-habit form