              "summary": "[\nSkip to main content\n][1]\n\nENJOY **FREE SHIPPING SITEWIDE **FOR A LIMITED TIME ONLY\n\n[\nSign Up / Sign In][2]\n[\n0\n][3]\n[Shop All Products][4]\n[Top Sellers][5]\n[Subscription][6]\n[Gut & Digestion][7]\n[Detox & Cleansing][8]\n[ Women's Health][9]\n|\n[About Us][10]\nShare\n[Help][11]\n\n###### **FREE SHIPPING • EVERY ORDER • LIMITED TIME ONLY**\n\n### The trend is new.\n### The wisdom isn't.\n\n###### Time-tested botanicals, combined by\n###### the herbal experts for healthy lymphatic flow.\n\n[MEET LYMPHATIC DRAINAGE][12]\n[Nature's Sunshine Strava Challenge]\n\n \n\n###### **GET OUTSIDE. GET REWARDED.**\n\nComplete **120 minutes of outdoor activity** to earn a limited-edition Strava digital badge, **30%\noff** your next Nature’s Sunshine order, and an entry into our prize drawing!\n\nGRAND PRIZE: **$1,000**  to spend at Nature’s Sunshine\n\n[JOIN THE CHALLENGE][13]\n\nPage 1 of 3\n\n**SHOP BY**\n\n## Health Topics\n\n[All Topics][14]\n[\n\n### Calming Stress\n\nFind your Zen\n\n][15]\n[\n\n### Detox & Cleansing\n\nFormulas to refresh and renew\n\n][16]\n[\n\n### **Hair, Skin & Nails**\n\nNourish from the inside out\n\n][17]\n[\n\n### **Fitness & Energy**\n\nFuel your daily adventures\n\n][18]\n[\n\n### **Heart Health**\n\nSupport your body's powerhouse\n\n][19]\n[\n\n### **Immune Support**\n\nFortify your body's natural defenses\n\n][20]\n[\n\n### Sleep Support\n\nCatch Z's with more ease\n\n][21]\n[\n\n### Brain & Memory\n\nNow that rings a bell\n\n][22]\n[All Topics][23]\n\n## Where Better\n## Ingredients Begin\n\nWe travel the world to source ingredients where they grow best—then test and craft them with care.\n\nPage 1 of 2\n\n\n## Over 30,000 5-Star Reviews\n\n[A photo of a 90 day supply bottle of Nature's Sunshine AnxiousLess.]\n\n**'100 STARS' FOR ANXIOUSLESS®**\n\n“If I could give this product 100 stars I would! The times it has saved me have been many and I know\nI can always count on it to work!\"\n\n***Nora***\n\n[A photo of Nature's Sunshine Power Beets in a variety of packaging.]\n\n**POWER OF BEETS FOR ME**\n\n\"I have been taking Nature's Sunshine Power of Beets for several months now. I love the energy this\nproduct gives me and I'll always have an extra bag on hand. I don't want to run out.\n\n***La R.***\n\n[A picture of a 16 day supply bottle of Nature's Sunshine HSN-W (Hair, Skin & Nails) Dietary\nSupplement.]\n\n**BOTANICAL BEAUTY BELIEVER**\n\n\"I didn’t think herbs could make that big a difference. But I noticed my hair feels thicker and\nstronger with HSN-W. And my nails too. I’m a believer!”\n\n***Debra H.***\n\n[A 15-Day supply package of Nature's Sunshine Power Meal Plant Protein Powder.]\n\n**TASTY. POWERFUL. POWER MEAL.**\n\n“Its flavor is exquisite. It makes me feel full and my body gets everything I need. I love it”\n\n***Falúa M.***\n\n## [Impact Foundation logo]\n\n \n\nThe Impact Foundation is the heart of Nature's Sunshine. Join us in our mission to tackle global\nmalnutrition and extend the transformative influence of nature's remedies to those who require it\nmost.\n\n[Our Mission][24]\n[nsp logo]\n[[facebook logo]][25]\n\n### POPULAR\n\n### HELP\n\n### Legal\n\n### Company\n\n[Share Feedback][26]\n\n##### POPULAR\n\n[Order Tracking][27][Account Information][28][Subscribe & Thrive][29][Money Back\nGuarantee][30][Store Locator][31]\n\n##### HELP\n\n[Help Center][32][Contact Us][33][Product Updates][34][Sitemap][35]\n\n##### Legal\n\n[Privacy Policy][36][Terms of Use][37][Return Policy][38][Accessibility Statement][39][ADA\nSettlement Details][40][Policies and Procedures][41]\n\n##### Company\n\n[Leadership][42][Investor][43][Careers][44][Cookie Preferences][45][Do not sell my data][46]\n\n\n©2026 Nature's Sunshine Products, Inc. All rights reserved.\nProduct information only applies to the U.S.\n\n[ISO 9001:2015 ISO/IEC 17025:2017 Certified][[USDA]][47][[NSF]][48][cGMP][Kosher][[TGA]][49][Halal]\n\n## Trending Favorites\n\nPage 1 of 3\n\n1/3\n[Shop Favorites][50]\n[\nTop Seller\n[Nature's Sunshine Lymphatic Drainage – herbal lymphatic supplements for traditional lymphatic\nsystem support]\n\n### Lymphatic Drainage™\n\nSupport detox and boost flow in your lymphatic system\n\n$37.95\n][51]\nQuick"
