          "page_text": "[ Skip to main content ][1] ENJOY **FREE SHIPPING SITEWIDE **FOR A LIMITED TIME ONLY [ Sign Up / Sign In][2] [ 0 ][3] [Shop All Products][4] [Top Sellers][5] [Subscription][6] [Gut & Digestion][7] [Detox & Cleansing][8] [ Women's Health][9] | [About Us][10] Share [Help][11] ###### **FREE SHIPPING • EVERY ORDER • LIMITED TIME ONLY** ### The trend is new. ### The wisdom isn't. ###### Time-tested botanicals, combined by ###### the herbal experts for healthy lymphatic flow. [MEET LYMPHATIC DRAINAGE][12] [Nature's Sunshine Strava Challenge] ###### **GET OUTSIDE. GET REWARDED.** Complete **120 minutes of outdoor activity** to earn a limited-edition Strava digital badge, **30% off** your next Nature’s Sunshine order, and an entry into our prize drawing! GRAND PRIZE: **$1,000** to spend at Nature’s Sunshine [JOIN THE CHALLENGE][13] Page 1 of 3 **SHOP BY** ## Health Topics [All Topics][14] [ ### Calming Stress Find your Zen ][15] [ ### Detox & Cleansing Formulas to refresh and renew ][16] [ ### **Hair, Skin & Nails** Nourish from the inside out ][17] [ ### **Fitness & Energy** Fuel your daily adventures ][18] [ ### **Heart Health** Support your body's powerhouse ][19] [ ### **Immune Support** Fortify your body's natural defenses ][20] [ ### Sleep Support Catch Z's with more ease ][21] [ ### Brain & Memory Now that rings a bell ][22] [All Topics][23] ## Where Better ## Ingredients Begin We travel the world to source ingredients where they grow best—then test and craft them with care. Page 1 of 2 ## Over 30,000 5-Star Reviews [A photo of a 90 day supply bottle of Nature's Sunshine AnxiousLess.] **'100 STARS' FOR ANXIOUSLESS®** “If I could give this product 100 stars I would! The times it has saved me have been many and I know I can always count on it to work!\" ***Nora*** [A photo of Nature's Sunshine Power Beets in a variety of packaging.] **POWER OF BEETS FOR ME** \"I have been taking Nature's Sunshine Power of Beets for several months now. I love the energy this product gives me and I'll always have an extra bag on hand. I don't want to run out. ***La R.*** [A picture of a 16 day supply bottle of Nature's Sunshine HSN-W (Hair, Skin & Nails) Dietary Supplement.] **BOTANICAL BEAUTY BELIEVER** \"I didn’t think herbs could make that big a difference. But I noticed my hair feels thicker and stronger with HSN-W. And my nails too. I’m a believer!” ***Debra H.*** [A 15-Day supply package of Nature's Sunshine Power Meal Plant Protein Powder.] **TASTY. POWERFUL. POWER MEAL.** “Its flavor is exquisite. It makes me feel full and my body gets everything I need. I love it” ***Falúa M.*** ## [Impact Foundation logo] The Impact Foundation is the heart of Nature's Sunshine. Join us in our mission to tackle global malnutrition and extend the transformative influence of nature's remedies to those who require it most. [Our Mission][24] [nsp logo] [[facebook logo]][25] ### POPULAR ### HELP ### Legal ### Company [Share Feedback][26] ##### POPULAR [Order Tracking][27][Account Information][28][Subscribe & Thrive][29][Money Back Guarantee][30][Store Locator][31] ##### HELP [Help Center][32][Contact Us][33][Product Updates][34][Sitemap][35] ##### Legal [Privacy Policy][36][Terms of Use][37][Return Policy][38][Accessibility Statement][39][ADA Settlement Details][40][Policies and Procedures][41] ##### Company [Leadership][42][Investor][43][Careers][44][Cookie Preferences][45][Do not sell my data][46] ©2026 Nature's Sunshine Products, Inc. All rights reserved. Product information only applies to the U.S. [ISO 9001:2015 ISO/IEC 17025:2017 Certified][[USDA]][47][[NSF]][48][cGMP][Kosher][[TGA]][49][Halal] ## Trending Favorites Page 1 of 3 1/3 [Shop Favorites][50] [ Top Seller [Nature's Sunshine Lymphatic Drainage – herbal lymphatic supplements for traditional lymphatic system support] ### Lymphatic Drainage™ Support detox and boost flow in your lymphatic system $37.95 ][51] Quick View [ Top Seller [Nature's Sunshine chlorophyll powder detoxifying stick packs lime twist.] ### Chlorophyll Stick Packs Inner detox, outer glow $34.50 ][52] Quick View [ [Nature's Sunshine Marine Glo, 30 Stick Packs] ### Marine Glo Age-Defying Collagen + Blue Light Defense $51.80 ][53] Quick View [ Top Seller [Nature’s Sunshine Turmeric Curcumin Supplement bottle for joint, gut, and immune health.] ### Turmeric Curcumin Potent joint/gut/immune support $59.95 ][54] Quick View SHOW MORE[Shop Favorites][55] [1]: #main-content-area [2]: /sign-in [3]: /shopping-cart [4]: /all-products [5]: /top-sellers [6]: https://www.naturessunshine.com/subscribe-and-thrive [7]: /health-topics/gut-digestion [8]: /health-topics/detox-cleansing [9]: /health-topics/womens-health [10]: /about-us [11]: /help-center [12]: /product/lymphatic-drainage [13]: https://www.strava.com/challenges/Soak-up-the-Sun-with-Natures-Sunshine [14]: /product-categories [15]: /health-topics/stress-relax [16]: /health-topics/detox-cleansing [17]: /health-topics/hair-skin-nails [18]: /health-topics/fitness [19]: /health-topics/heart-health [20]: /health-topics/immune [21]: /health-topics/sleep [22]: /health-topics/memory-brain [23]: /product-categories [24]: https://www.myimpactfoundation.org/ [25]: https://www.facebook.com/naturessunshine/ [26]: # [27]: /account/order-history [28]: /account [29]: /account/subscription [30]: /money-back-guarantee [31]: /store-locator [32]: /help-center [33]: /contact-us [34]: /product-status-updates [35]: /sitemap [36]: /privacy-policy [37]: /terms-of-use [38]: /help-center/returns--refunds [39]: /accessibility-statement [40]: /resolution-details [41]: /policies-and-procedures [42]: /leadership [43]: https://ir.naturessunshine.com/ [44]: /careers [45]: / [46]: / [47]: http://www.usda.gov [48]: https://www.nsf.gov/ [49]: https://www.tga.gov.au/resources/resource/forms/request-certificates-or-notarised-copies-tga-l icences-and-certificates [50]: /health-topics [51]: /product/lymphatic-drainage [52]: /product/chlorophyll-stick-packs [53]: /pr