              "summary": "[[logo] ][1]\n* [ Global ][2]\n  * [UAE][3]\n  * [Japan][4]\n* [About Us][5]\n* [Our Business][6]\n* [Our Process ][7]\n  * [API Manufacturing][8]\n  * [Finished Products][9]\n  * [Quality][10]\n* [Our Science][11]\n* [Therapies][12]\n* [Newsroom][13]\n* [Careers][14]\n* [Contact Us][15]\n* [Neopharma]\n  \n  ### Expanding horizons, Extending care\n  \n  \n  Manufacturing high quality affordable medications for everyone\n  \n  [Learn More][16]\n* [Neopharma]\n  \n  ### Global Manufacturing Expertise\n  \n  \n  Global manufacturing network in over 50 countries\n  \n  [Learn More][17]\n* [Neopharma]\n  \n  ### Innovation Oriented Approach\n  \n  [Learn More][18]\n* [Sauad Farmacêutica Brazil Neopharma]\n  \n  ### Redefining the Global Pharmaceutical Industry\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  [Learn More][19]\n[\n\n##### Research and Development\n\n][20] [\n\n##### API Manufacturing\n\n][21] [\n\n##### Finished Dose Manufacturing\n\n][22] [\n\n##### Marketing and Distribution\n\n][23]\n[\n\n## About Us\n\n][24]\n\n### Redefining the Global\n### Pharmaceutical Industry\n\nSince its founding in 2003, Neopharma has emerged as a global, technologically driven and\ninnovation-oriented company. Neopharma’s global presence is supported by 10 manufacturing facilities\nspread across 3 continents and regional offices in 50+ countries. Delivering branded and generic\nformulations and active pharmaceutical ingredients (API’s). Our vision is to create a comprehensive\n‘integrated healthcare enterprise’ which shall innovate and adapt to deliver the best in healthcare\nby never compromising on our values of commitment, excellence, innovation and integrity.\n\n## Neopharma Worldwide\n\n[ [Los Angeles]][25]\n\n## #Neonews\n\nNeopharma Onam 2025\n\n[Read More][26]\n\nNeopharma Iftar 2025\n\n[Read More][27]\n\n## #Neostories\n\n[Tweets by Neopharmaglobal][28]\n\n###### Useful Links\n* [Home][29]\n* [About Us][30]\n* [Our Business][31]\n* [Our Science][32]\n* [Therapies][33