          "page_text": "[[logo] ][1] * [ Global ][2] * [UAE][3] * [Japan][4] * [About Us][5] * [Our Business][6] * [Our Process ][7] * [API Manufacturing][8] * [Finished Products][9] * [Quality][10] * [Our Science][11] * [Therapies][12] * [Newsroom][13] * [Careers][14] * [Contact Us][15] * [Neopharma] ### Expanding horizons, Extending care Manufacturing high quality affordable medications for everyone [Learn More][16] * [Neopharma] ### Global Manufacturing Expertise Global manufacturing network in over 50 countries [Learn More][17] * [Neopharma] ### Innovation Oriented Approach [Learn More][18] * [Sauad Farmacêutica Brazil Neopharma] ### Redefining the Global Pharmaceutical Industry [Learn More][19] [ ##### Research and Development ][20] [ ##### API Manufacturing ][21] [ ##### Finished Dose Manufacturing ][22] [ ##### Marketing and Distribution ][23] [ ## About Us ][24] ### Redefining the Global ### Pharmaceutical Industry Since its founding in 2003, Neopharma has emerged as a global, technologically driven and innovation-oriented company. Neopharma’s global presence is supported by 10 manufacturing facilities spread across 3 continents and regional offices in 50+ countries. Delivering branded and generic formulations and active pharmaceutical ingredients (API’s). Our vision is to create a comprehensive ‘integrated healthcare enterprise’ which shall innovate and adapt to deliver the best in healthcare by never compromising on our values of commitment, excellence, innovation and integrity. ## Neopharma Worldwide [ [Los Angeles]][25] ## #Neonews Neopharma Onam 2025 [Read More][26] Neopharma Iftar 2025 [Read More][27] ## #Neostories [Tweets by Neopharmaglobal][28] ###### Useful Links * [Home][29] * [About Us][30] * [Our Business][31] * [Our Science][32] * [Therapies][33] * [Newsroom][34] * [Careers][35] * [Contact Us][36] * [Terms & Privacy Policy][37] ###### Follow us © Copyright [ Neopharma][38] All Rights Reserved. MOH Approval License no: WQ23097-0015662608151147-1