tained improvement for patient in hospital and the ICU and allows\n  continuity of care in the home.\n  \n  Discover more\n  \n  PEPTAMEN®\n  ][50]\n  [\n  [VITAFLO®]\n  VITAFLO® is innovation in nutrition. Specialized medical foods for Metabolic Disorders, Pediatric\n  Kidney Disease and other areas of disease specific nutrition.\n  \n  Discover more\n  \n  VITAFLO®\n  ][51]\n  [\n  [ISOSOURCE®]\n  The ISOSOURCE® family is composed of nutritionally complete formulas intended for the dietary\n  management of undernourished patients or those at risk of malnutrition.\n  \n  Discover more\n  \n  ISOSOURCE®\n  ][52]\n  [\n  [ALTHÉRA® HMO]\n  ALTHÉRA® HMO is advancing the management of cow's milk protein allergy (CMPA).\n  \n  Discover more\n  \n  ALTHÉRA® HMO\n  ][53]\n  [\n  [RESOURCE®]\n  RESOURCE® products are oral nutritional solutions for those not getting enough of the right\n  nutrients from their diet.\n  \n  Discover more\n  \n  RESOURCE®\n  ][54]\n  [\n  [COMPLEAT®]\n  COMPLEAT® Introducing real food into tube feeding and oral nutritional supplements.\n  \n  Discover more\n  \n  COMPLEAT®\n  ][55]\n  Consumer care\n  Consumer care\n  [See All >][56]\n  [\n  [NATURE’S BOUNTY®]\n  NATURE’S BOUNTY® provides quality supplements including multivitamins, probiotics, and products to\n  help your hair, skin and nails look their healthiest.\n  \n  Discover more\n  \n  NATURE’S BOUNTY®\n  ][57]\n  [\n  [BOOST®]\n  BOOST® nutritional shakes offer tailored nutrition designed to help you be your best as you age.\n  \n  Discover more\n  \n  BOOST®\n  ][58]\n  [\n  [VITAL PROTEINS®]\n  VITAL PROTEINS® is here to help make the most of every moment, every day. Because we know that\n  feeling, looking and performing our best is vital.\n  \n  Discover more\n  \n  VITAL PROTEINS®\n  ][59]\n  [\n  [GARDEN OF LIFE®]\n  GARDEN OF LIFE® products start with real foods, whether we are making a vitamin, a probiotic or a\n  protein powder.\n  \n  Discover more\n  \n  GARDEN OF LIFE®\n  ]