          "page_text": "Sorry, you need to enable JavaScript to visit this website. [ Skip to main content ][1] Search for Apply You are in our Global Site Change location ## You are currently on the Nestlé Health Science global website nestlehealthscience.com ### Africa & Middle East * [Middle East][2] * [South Africa][3] ### Americas * [Brazil][4] * [Canada][5] * [Mexico][6] * [United States][7] ### Asia & Oceania * [Australia][8] * [Hong Kong SAR, Greater China EN][9] * [Hong Kong SAR, Greater China ZH][10] * [India][11] * [Indonesia][12] * [Japan][13] * [Mainland China, Greater China][14] * [Malaysia][15] * [Philippines][16] * [Singapore][17] * [Sri Lanka][18] * [Taiwan, Greater China][19] * [Thailand TH][20] * [Vietnam][21] ### Europe * [Austria][22] * [Czech Republic][23] * [Denmark][24] * [Finland][25] * [France][26] * [Germany][27] * [Italy][28] * [Netherlands][29] * [Norway][30] * [Poland][31] * [Portugal][32] * [Romania][33] * [Spain][34] * [Sweden][35] * [Switzerland][36] * [Turkey][37] * [United Kingdom][38] Contact * [Contact Us][39] Social * [ [LinkedIn] ][40] * [ [Youtube] ][41] Switch Theme Menu [ [Nestlé Health Science] ][42] * [ Our expertise ][43] We see opportunities to improve health through nutrition everywhere. Our expertise areas are rooted in science and cover every facet of health: prevention, maintenance, and treatment. [Learn more][44] Quick Links [ [Consumer care ] Consumer care ][45] [ [Nav_MedicalNutrition] Medical nutrition ][46] * [ Our brands ][47] We have a wide range of brands that use the power of nutrition to help people live their healthiest lives, supporting every life stage from pediatrics to healthy aging. [Learn more][48] Categories Medical Nutrition Medical Nutrition [See All >][49] [ [PEPTAMEN®] PEPTAMEN® delivers rapid and sustained improvement for patient in hospital and the ICU and allows continuity of care in the home. Discover more PEPTAMEN® ][50] [ [VITAFLO®] VITAFLO® is innovation in nutrition. Specialized medical foods for Metabolic Disorders, Pediatric Kidney Disease and other areas of disease specific nutrition. Discover more VITAFLO® ][51] [ [ISOSOURCE®] The ISOSOURCE® family is composed of nutritionally complete formulas intended for the dietary management of undernourished patients or those at risk of malnutrition. Discover more ISOSOURCE® ][52] [ [ALTHÉRA® HMO] ALTHÉRA® HMO is advancing the management of cow's milk protein allergy (CMPA). Discover more ALTHÉRA® HMO ][53] [ [RESOURCE®] RESOURCE® products are oral nutritional solutions for those not getting enough of the right nutrients from their diet. Discover more RESOURCE® ][54] [ [COMPLEAT®] COMPLEAT® Introducing real food into tube feeding and oral nutritional supplements. Discover more COMPLEAT® ][55] Consumer care Consumer care [See All >][56] [ [NATURE’S BOUNTY®] NATURE’S BOUNTY® provides quality supplements including multivitamins, probiotics, and products to help your hair, skin and nails look their healthiest. Discover more NATURE’S BOUNTY® ][57] [ [BOOST®] BOOST® nutritional shakes offer tailored nutrition designed to help you be your best as you age. Discover more BOOST® ][58] [ [VITAL PROTEINS®] VITAL PROTEINS® is here to help make the most of every moment, every day. Because we know that feeling, looking and performing our best is vital. Discover more VITAL PROTEINS® ][59] [ [GARDEN OF LIFE®] GARDEN OF LIFE® products start with real foods, whether we are making a vitamin, a probiotic or a protein powder. Discover more GARDEN OF LIFE® ][60] [ [SOLGAR®] SOLGAR® is the result of more than 70 years' commitment to supporting health and wellbeing. We create the finest small-batch nutritional supplements. Discover more SOLGAR® ][61] [ [PURE ENCAPSULATIONS®] PURE ENCAPSULATIONS® supplements are made with only premium ingredients. Free from unnecessary additives and many common allergens. Discover more PURE ENCAPSULATIONS® ][62] * [ About us ][63] Built on decades of innovation and dedication, Nestlé Health Science was founded by people passionate about the power of nutrition. From newborn babies to the most senior citizens, we provide nutrition and nourishment where it's needed most. [Learn more][64] Quick Links [ [Nav_Nestle HealthScience(1).jpg] Our story ][65] [ [Team-of-Experts_Retouch_553x328] A team of experts ][66] * [ Our Impact ][67] [Learn more][68] Quick Links [ [My Cancer Nutrition - World Cancer Day] My Cancer, \"My Cancer, My Nutrition Provides Support Through Credible Informati… ][69] [ [Improving Nutrition Outcomes in Patients through Digital Solutions] Improving Nutrition Outcomes in Patients through Digital Solutions ][70] [ [farm] Behind the scenes at a farm in the U.S. that’s using climate smart farming prac… ][71] * [ Global HCP Portal ][72] Explore comprehensive medical and scientific educational tools for nutrition and lifestyle management, tailored for all stages of life and diverse patient care settings. [Learn more][73] Quick Links [ [doctors walking in the building] Discover our Global HCP Portal ][74] [ [women writing notes with laptop] Knowledge & Resources ][75] [ [healthcare professional adding notes] Grants ][76] * [ Your Career ][77] We are a global group of people who share a passion for empowering healthier lives through nutrition. The difference that we make for consumers, patients, and caregivers is what motivates us. [Learn more][78] Quick Links [ [Nav_Our Purpose] Our purpose ][79] [ [Nav_WaysofWorking(1)] Our ways of working ][80] [ [your opportunity] Opportunities ][81] * [ Acquisitions & Investments ][82] We forge new partnerships, invest in companies with similar goals to us, and acquire companies that complement our global portfolio. [Learn more][83] Categories Acquisitions Acquisitions [See All >][84] [ [Vital Proteins] Read More Vital Proteins ][85] [ [The Bountiful Company] Read More The Bountiful Company ][86] [ [Nuun] Read More Nuun ][87] [ [Puravida] Read More Puravida ][88] [ [Orgain] Read More Orgain ][89] Investments Investments [See All >][90] [ [Amazentis] Read More Amazentis ][91] [ [Flagship Pioneering] Read More Flagship Pioneering ][92] [ [Phagenesis] Read More Phagenesis ][93] [ [Dikey Vitamin Group] Read More Dikey Vitamin Group ][94] * [ News ][95] The latest news and events from Nestlé Health Science. [Learn more][96] Quick Links [ [the happy couple walking] Nestlé-led clinical study finds that NAD+ boosters could promote health in unex… ][97] [ [Two women sitting at the desk] Nestlé Health Science becomes global partner to Special Olympics ][98] [ [A pair of elderly people stretching] Nestlé Health Science to collaborate with universities in the U.S. and Australi… ][99] [ [Join us at the Nestlé Health Science booth at ECCO 2025 in Berlin, February 19th-22nd] Join us at the Nestlé Health Science booth at ECCO 2025 in Berlin, February 19t… ][100] [ [Seven-country mild cognitive impairment trial underway] Seven-country mild cognitive impairment trial underway ][101] [ [NHSc UC Davis Partnership Banner] NHSc and UCDavis Announce Strategic Partnership to Accelerate Innovation in Nut… ][102] You are in our Global Site Change location ## You are currently on the Nestlé Health Science global website nestlehealthscience.com ### Africa & Middle East * [Middle East][103] * [South Africa][104] ### Americas * [Brazil][105] * [Canada][106] * [Mexico][107] * [United States][108] ### Asia & Oceania * [Australia][109] * [Hong Kong SAR, Greater China EN][110] * [Hong Kong SAR, Greater China ZH][111] * [India][112] * [Indonesia][113] * [Japan][114] * [Mainland China, Greater China][115] * [Malaysia][116] * [Philippines][117] * [Singapore][118] * [Sri Lanka][119] * [Taiwan, Greater China][120] * [Thailand TH][121] * [Vietnam][122] ### Europe * [Austria][123] * [Czech Republic][124] * [Denmark][125] * [Finland][126] * [France][127] * [Germany][128] * [Italy][129] * [Netherlands][130] * [Norway][131] * [Poland][132] * [Portugal][133] * [Romania][134] * [Spain][135] * [Sweden][136] * [Switzerland][137] * [Turkey][138] * [United Kingdom][139] Contact * [Contact Us][140] Social * [ [LinkedIn] ][141] * [ [Youtube] ][142] Switch Theme [michroscope scientist on the left and girl and orange juice on the right] [michroscope scientist on the left and girl and orange juice on the right] # Nestlé Health Science empowers healthier lives through nutrition As a global leader in the science of nutrition, we nourish those who need extra care, fill nutrition gaps and provide innovative products for a healthier future, enabling customers and patients to live their healthiest lives. #### News We’re a team of more than 12,000 people around the world dedicated to the science of nutrition. Find out about our latest innovations, research, events and more. [Find out more][143] * [ [mother and daughter] Nestlé introduces an innovative complete nutritional solution for children with special medical nutrition needs March 2026 ][144] * [ [the happy couple walking] Nestlé-led clinical study finds that NAD+ boosters could promote health in unexpected ways February 2026 ][145] * [ [Two women sitting at the desk] Nestlé Health Science becomes global partner to Special Olympics November 2025 ][146] PreviousNext #### Our Areas of Focus * [ ][147] * [ ][148] [NHSc_552x368_HomePage_ActiveLifestyle] [NHSc_552x368_HomePage_ActiveLifestyle] #### Consumer care Whether you’re looking to maintain or enhance your health through vitamins, minerals, supplements or other active lifestyle nutrition solutions, our consumer care portfolio has answers. [Learn more][149] [NHSc_449x442_HomePage_MedicalNutrition(1)] [NHSc_449x442_HomePage_MedicalNutrition(1)] #### Medical nutrition The right nutrition can be life-changing - we've developed our medical nutrition portfolio around this belief. [Learn more][150] ### Our brands We have a wide range of brands that use the power of nutrition to help people live their healthiest lives, supporting every life stage from pediatrics to healthy aging. [Find out more ][151] ## Come work with us #### Find your next role with #### Nestlé Health Science [See our latest jobs][152] [Logo header] #### Are you a Healthcare Professional? If you'd like to see tools and resources designed for your discipline, choose an option below. YES PLEASE NO THANKS [Nestle Health Sciences] Nestlé Health Science Global headquarters Avenue Nestlé 55, 1800 Vevey, Switzerland Terms & Condition footer * [Terms and Conditions][153] * [Privacy notice][154] * [Cookies settings][155] * [Accessibility][156] Nestlé Health Science Global headquarters Avenue Nestlé 55, 1800 Vevey, Switzerland Legal * [Careers][157] * [Contact Us][158] Legal * [Careers][159] * [Contact Us][160] Terms & Condition footer * [Terms and Conditions][161] * [Privacy notice][162] * [Cookies settings][163] * [Accessibility][164] [Linkedin][165] [Twitter][166] [YouTube][167] © Nestlé Health Science 2025 - All rights reserved [1]: #main-content [2]: https://www.nestlehealthscience-me.com/ [3]: https://www.nestlehealthscience.co.za/ [4]: https://www.nestlehealthscience.com.br/ [5]: https://www.nestlehealthscience.ca/en [6]: https://www.nest",
