            "intel": {
              "summary": "New Roots Herbal is a 41-year-old, 100% family-owned Canadian manufacturer of natural health products ('New Roots Herbal'). It formulates, tests, and manufactures its own supplements in Canada under certified cGMP conditions, and backs this with an on-site 8,000 sq. ft. (745 m²) ISO 17025–accredited laboratory staffed by 22 MSc/BSc-credentialed scientists. Distribution is retail-led, with products carried in 1,865 stores, and the company cites 205 employees. Its portfolio spans vitamins and minerals, herbs and herbal extracts, probiotics, essential fatty acids and fish oils, medicinal mushrooms, essential oils, beauty/collagen, sport nutrition, and life-stage formulas (children's, men's, women's, 50+).",
              "key_insights": [
                "Vertical integration is a core differentiator: in-house formulation, testing (ISO 17025–accredited lab), and cGMP manufacturing in Canada — a 'Made in Canada' positioning reinforced by the '40 Years, Here at Home' campaign.",
                "Family ownership (100%) and 41-year operating history suggest an independent, privately held business with no disclosed external investors.",
                "Retail footprint of 1,865 stores with only 205 employees indicates a wholesale/distributor-led model rather than company-owned retail.",
                "Active new-product pipeline shown on the homepage: Wormwood Tincture, 100% Pure Organic Castor Seed Oil, Chanca Piedra 10:1 extract, Taurine 1,000 mg, Zinc ʟ-Carnosine, Magnesium⁸, Milk Thistle Seed Extract 250 mg, Astaxanthin.",
                "Prostate Perform is a flagship men's health SKU with an explicit clinical-style claim (BPH symptom relief in as little as 12 days) — a signal of evidence-based marketing.",
                "Owned media and education assets (Naturopathic Currents magazine/blog, podcasts, webinars, Healthy Recipes) plus a charity initiative ('Choose to Care') drive brand engagement and retention.",
                "Bilingual English/Français site indicates a Canada-wide, including Quebec, go-to-market."
              ],
              "risk_flags": [],
              "opportunities": [
                "Leverage the ISO 17025–accredited lab and cGMP certification as a trust/quality narrative for retailer and practitioner partnerships.",
                "Expand the new-arrival pipeline (taurine, castor oil, chanca piedra, wormwood) into categories such as sport nutrition and beauty where demand is growing.",
                "Scale education-led content (magazine, podcasts, webinars) into a customer acquisition and practitioner-education channel."
              ]
            },
