          "page_text": "* [CONTACT OUR NATUROPATHS][1] * [JOIN THE COMMUNITY][2] * [CONTACT US][3] * [简体中文][4] [[Nutralife_Logo_ffl][Nutralife_Logo_ffl][Nutralife_Logo_ffl][Nutralife_Logo_ffl]][5] * [PRODUCTS][6] * * [LIPOSOMAL-C 1200mg ## IMMUNITY [NL Ester-C + Probiotics] ][7] * * [GUT HEALTH ## GUT HEALTH ][8] * * [MAGNESIUM SLEEP+ ## INSOMNIA & SLEEP [Sleep+] ][9] * * [MAGNESIUM SLEEP + COLLAGEN RENEW ## INSOMNIA & SLEEP ][10] * * [See our Entire Range ## VIEW ALL PRODUCTS [VIEW ALL PRODUCTS] ][11] * [BLOG][12] * [ABOUT][13] * [Find Your Nearest Stockist][14] * [Our Quality][15] * [ Facebook][16] * [ You-Tube][17] * [ Instagram][18] [Slide] # Specialist supplements to help support the # foundation of a healthy, vibrant body and mind. [[Soothe and Support your gut health]][19] DIGESTIVE HEALTH JOINTS [[Support your immune system]][20] IMMUNITY [[supports falling asleep]][21] RELAXATION [[Kyolic Aged Garlic Extract]][22] HEART ## **Immune System ## ** #### Find the right product to support #### your immune system. [Ester-C 1000mg + Bio] Your immune system is a complex network of organs, cells and processes that keeps you healthy by fighting off the microbes that cause illness. It provides a barrier to keep microbes from entering your body, and then identifies and neutralises any that make it through. Vitamin C, aged garlic extract, probiotics, zinc, and olive leaf extract can all help to keep your immunity in top condition. [READ MORE][23] ## **VITAMIN C YEAR ROUND SUPPORT** #### WHY YOU NEED VITAMIN C ALL YEAR Good old vitamin C. There when you need it during the colder months when the sniffles start to make an appearance. But if you thought it was only good for supporting your winter immunity, then we have great news for you! Vitamin C is a must-have nutrient for when the weather is warmer too. We talked to Kelly McGillivray, in-house Naturopath and nutrition expert, about its role in supporting skin health & immunity, and what other benefits this humble nutrient can bring you year-round. [READ MORE][24] ##### [HEALTH][25] ## **Immune System** #### Find the right product to support #### your immune system. Your immune system is a complex network of organs, cells and processes that keeps you healthy by fighting off the microbes that cause illness. It provides a barrier to keep microbes from entering your body, and then identifies and neutralises any that make it through. Vitamin C, aged garlic extract, probiotics, zinc, and olive leaf extract can all help to keep your immunity in top condition. [Ester-C 1000mg + Bio] [MORE][26] Good old vitamin C. There when you need it during the colder months when the sniffles start to make an appearance. But if you thought it was only good for supporting your winter immunity, then we have great news for you! Vitamin C is a must-have nutrient for when the weather is warmer too. We talked to Kelly McGillivray, in-house Naturopath and nutrition expert, about its role in supporting skin health & immunity, and what other benefits this humble nutrient can bring you year-round. [READ MORE][27] **[WHAT’S NEW][28]** ## **VITAMIN C ## ****YEAR ROUND ## ****SUPPORT** #### WHY YOU NEED VITAMIN C ALL YEAR ### Kyolic® Aged Garlic ## **EVIDENCE-BASED CARDIOVASCULAR SUPPORT** #### & SUPPORT FOR YOUR IMMUNE SYSTEM [MORE][29] ### Kyolic® Aged Garlic ## **EVIDENCE-BASED CARDIOVASCULAR SUPPORT** #### & SUPPORT FOR YOUR IMMUNE SYSTEM [MORE][30] ## Join the Nutra-Life Community Sign up to our Newsletter #### About Nutra-Life * [Health Conditions][31] * [Ingredients][32] * [What's New][33] #### Privacy Policy * [Privacy Policy][34] #### Products * [Turmeric][35] * [Kyolic® Aged Garlic][36] * [Ester-C®][37] * [Probiotica 50 Billion ][38] * [View All Products][39] #### Nutra-Life * [Find Your Nearest Stockist][40] * [Our Quality][41] * [Talk to our Naturopath][42] * [Contact Us][43] * [Retailer Training][44] © 2018 Nutra-Life New Zealand. All Rights Reserved. [1]: https://www.nutralife.co.nz/talk-to-our-naturopa