ood pouches, and Shroom Tech Sport tablets on a black background.] Shop All Fuel total human optimization. ][16] * [ [Onnit NMN + Creatine cellular performance system with 30 unflavored stick packs and individual stick pack.] New! NMN + Creatine Daily cellular performance system for brain and body. † ][17] * [ [Onnit Alpha Brain daily cognitive support dietary supplement, 90 capsules.] Best Sellers Supplements our customers can’t get enough of, for focus, energy, recovery, and more. ][18] * [ [Shroomtech Sport Supplement bottle with black cap on a white background] Fitness & Performance Optimize both your brain and body, helping you perform at your best. ][19] * [ [Black ONNIT Alpha BRAIN Neuro Gummies pouch with orange gummy candies pictured on the front] Cognition & Focus Think sharper, react faster, and stay in the zone—today and over time.†︎ ][20] * [ [Bottle of Onnit New Mood dietary supplement capsules with black cap on black background] Sleep, Mood & Stress Formulated to help you stay centered, emotionally resilient†︎, and sleep better. ][21] * [ New ][22] * [ Best Sellers ][23] * [ Alpha BRAIN® ][24] * [ Total Human® ][25] * [ Fitness & Performance ][26] * [ Cognition & Focus ][27] * [ Sleep & Mood ][28] * Search Search Close Search * [ Quiz ][29] * [ Learn ][30] * * [ [Black bottle of Onnit Alpha Brain Black Label supplements with four white capsules on a wooden table] Alpha Brain Our flagship daily nootropic, crafted to support focus, memory, and mental processing speed. ][31] * [ [Hand holding assorted capsules and one red gel pill.] Ingredients Rooted in science. Committed to efficacy. ][32] * [ [Blurred man jogging outdoors at dusk against a pink and purple sky] Our Story Aubrey Marcus founded ONNIT with the goal to treat the body as a whole. ][33] * [ [Man doing a one-arm plank exercise in a gym with suspension straps in the background] The Edge Find your edge with articles on fitness, nutrition, supplements, and more. ][34] * [ Account ][35] * [ Contact us ][36] * [ Cart 0 ][37] * [Shop All][38] * [New][39] * [Best Sellers][40] * [Alpha BRAIN®][41] * [Total Human®][42] * [Fitness & Performance][43] * [Cognition & Focus][44] * [Sleep & Mood][45] * [Hand pouring Onnit NMN + Creatine powder from a stick pack into a glass of water.] NMN + CREATINE # ONE STICK. ONCE A DAY. A formula with science-backed ingredients designed to support cellular performance for brain and body.† [Shop NMN + Creatine][46] ## Shop by category [ [Hand picking up an Onnit Alpha Brain bottle from a collection of Onnit supplements.] #### BEST SELLERS Supplements our customers can’t get enough of, for focus, energy, recovery, and more.† ][47] [ [Person practicing boxing with wrapped hands in a gym.] #### FITNESS & PERFORMANCE Optimize both your brain and body, helping you perform at your best.† ][48] [ [Close-up of a person wearing eyeglasses with a digital screen reflected in the lenses.] #### COGNITION & FOCUS Think sharper, react faster, and stay in the zone†︎ ][49] [ [Person wearing headphones while lying down and relaxing in a softly lit room.] #### MOOD & STRESS Formulated to help you stay centered, emotionally resilient, and sleep better.†︎ ][50] [ [Onnit supplement bundle featuring Total Human, Alpha Brain, Creatine, Alpha Brain Neuro Gummies, and Shroom Tech Sport.] #### BUNDLES Curated combinations that work better together to support your health goals.† ][51] ## show up daily. save monthly. Save 15%. Ship free. Stay flexible. [Subscribe and Save][52] ## Obsessed with total human optimization Onnit was built with the athletes who understand the mind and supplements miss. The mind and body are one system, and the strongest version of you trains both. Fuel for the people who take performance personally. [ About us ][53] [Athlete using an air bike during an intense training session.] [Person lifting a kettlebell during a gym workout.] > “ > > Everything that I like to do requires me to be at my best mentally, and Alpha BRAIN® is the very > best supplement that I've ever found that I have 100% confidence in providing me with the nutrient > tools that I need to achieve a great state of mind. > > — Joe Rogan , Co-Founder ## The Science Behind Alpha Brain® **Formulated without caffeine, Alpha BRAIN® promotes alpha brain wave activity and supports acetylcholine levels, helping you tap into flow state and stay productive throughout the day.†** [ shop alpha brain® ][54] **Powerful Ingredients. clinically studied.** #### Phosphatidylserine† A fat naturally found in cell membranes, particularly in the brain. Plays a key role in supporting healthy brain cell function and communication. #### Vitamin B6† A water-soluble vitamin involved in over 100 physiological reactions including the production of neurotransmitters that support brain health and cognitive function. #### Alpha GPC A choline-containing compound that acts as a precursor to the neurotransmitter acetylcholine, which is linked to cognitive function.†︎ #### Huperzia Serrata Extract† A clubmoss that contains Huperzine A, a compound that helps slow the breakdown of acetylcholine, supporting sustained neurotransmitter activity for mental performance. [Abstract gold and gray geometric brand pattern.] DAILY RITUAL. [Onnit Alpha Brain daily cognitive support dietary supplement, 90 capsules.] Promotes Focus & Supports Memory† Aids Mental Processing Speed† Daily Cognitive Support† Caffeine Free† Alpha BRAIN® (60 ct) SELECT PURCHASE OPTION Qty 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 Loading... [ Sold Out ][55] Super charged formula Promotes Focus & Supports Memory† Supports Relaxed Alertness† Supports Productivity while working† Promotes Flow State† (The Feeling of being \"in the zone\") Alpha BRAIN® Black Label (80 ct) SELECT PURCHASE OPTION Qty 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 Loading... [ Sold Out ][56] **REAL PEOPLE. REAL RESULTS.** ## What Customers Say About Our Products 5 out of 5 stars ### Great product > This product is great for focus and brain health. I love this product because of the ability to > help you focus and think clearly. The product helps with memory, focus and reaction time which > helps with daily task. StacyK 5 out of 5 stars ### best decision I've made for my health > I love these supplements. I take them daily. I have lost weight, gained strength, sleep better, > remember better, and I am in a much better mood. I work out everyday now. I haven't done that in > years!! Richard COOP 5 out of 5 stars ### When it hits, you feel New Mood! > Staple in my morning routine. Feeling positive, optimistic, and engergized P L B 5 out of 5 stars ### A quality product > Clean and easy to take, I drink it with a glass of water Ilan ## Total Human. 1 box = a whole protocol The protocol that runs from sunrise to sleep. ## Day Pack * Supports Cognition & Focus† * Supports Cellular Energy Production† ## Night pack * Supports Mood & Relaxation† * Supports Immunity System Support† [ Shop Total Human® ][57] [ ### Onnit x rewards Earn more when you spend. Join Now ][58] [ ### Still not sure? Find the right support for your optimization. Take the onnit quiz ][59] ## Frequently Asked Questions **Didn't find the answer you were looking for?** Explore our Help Center for more articles and FAQs, or contact our team below. [Contact Us][60] [Help Center][61] ### **Which Alpha BRAIN® is right for me?** We offer various versions of Alpha BRAIN® to meet different needs. Check out [this article ][62]to learn more about the Alpha BRAIN® family and find the right option for you! ### **Is Alpha BRAIN® for men, women, and/or children?** Alpha BRAIN® is intended for both men and women over the age of 18. ### **Will this help with ADHD or replace my medication?** We cannot provide medical advice. Please consult your doctor regarding any medical conditions or medication interactions before using Alpha BRAIN®. ### Can I take Alpha BRAIN® with caffeine? Yes! However, we recommend trying Alpha BRAIN® without caffeine first to see how it affects you. ### **Will Alpha BRAIN® give me energy?** Alpha BRAIN® is designed to support memory, focus, and mental processing speed†. Some Alpha BRAIN® products (*like Alpha BRAIN® Black Label and Alpha BRAIN® Focus Shots*) contain caffeine for an added energy boost. ### Can I take Alpha BRAIN® and Total Human®? Yes, but note that the Total Human® Day Pack includes Alpha BRAIN®. Be mindful of the recommended daily dosage of 2 capsules. **† THESE STATEMENTS HAVE NOT BEEN EVALUATED BY THE FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION. THIS PRODUCT IS NOT INTENDED TO DIAGNOSE, TREAT, CURE, OR PREVENT ANY DISEASE.** This website is directed only to U.S. consumers for products and services of Onnit Labs, Inc. This website is not directed to consumers outside of the U.S. ## Sign Up And Lock In Email address Subscribe * [ Facebook ][63] * [ Instagram ][64] * [ X ][65] * [ TikTok ][66] * [ YouTube ][67] ## Company & Info * [ About us ][68] * [ Careers ][69] * [ Sitemap ][70] ## Programs & Partnerships * [ Wholesale ][71] * [ Subscriptions ][72] * [ Military/First Responder ][73] ## Customer Support * [ Contact Us ][74] * [ Order Tracking ][75] * [ Returns & FAQ ][76] * [ Free Shipping ][77] * [ Money Back Guarantee ][78] * [ Pay with HSA/FSA ][79] © 2026 Onnit Labs, Inc. * [ Limit Use of My Sensitive Personal Information ][80] * [ Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information ][81] * [ Privacy Policy ][82] * [ Terms & conditions ][83] * [ Proposition 65 ][84] [ [AdChoices Logo] Adchoices - Do not sell or Share ][85] [1]",
