the prestigious Udyog Patra\nAward, we uphold the highest standards of quality and excellence. Headquartered in Chandigarh, Pax\nHealthcare is a leading pharmaceutical company offering best-in-class PCD Pharma Franchise\nopportunities across Chandigarh and all states of India.\n\n### Get Price List Now\n\n\n\n\n\n\n[cf7sr-recaptcha]\n\nWhat is 8 + 7 ? [[Refresh icon][Refreshing captcha]][28]\nAnswer for 8 + 7\n\n\n\n“Pax Healthcare lies under Top PCD Pharma Companies in Chandigarh”\n\n“Pax Healthcare believes in transparency to make our channel partners satisfied”\n\n“WHO & GMP Certified Products for PCD Pharma Franchise.”\n\n“Free Prodomotions tools and Monopoly Rights”\n\n“Pax Healthcare” Believe in Leadership through focused approach\n\n## Product Categories\n\nPax Healthcare is a leading PCD pharma company committed to offering a wide variety of pharma\nproducts to target various health segments. Our pharma products meet the pharmaceutical standards\nand other quality or packaging standards.\n\n[\n[Home]\n\n#### Tablet Range\n\n][29]\n[\n[Home]\n\n#### Capsule Range\n\n][30]\n[\n[Home]\n\n#### Syrups Range\n\n][31]\n[See All !][32]\n\n## Our Products\n\nOur PCD pharma product list covers multiple dosage forms, including tablets, capsules, syrups, dry\nsyrups, injectable, topical medications, and powders. This gives our franchisee ample choice to\nchoose their preferred products for a PCD pharma franchise in India.\n\n[ [OTIGOOD EAR DROP] ][33]\n[ [POLO 200] ][34]\n[ [PELWASH] ][35]\n[ [NEPA S] ][36]\n[ [VOVILEP GEL] ][37]\n[ [POLP MZ] ][38]\n[ [RELAX-CP TAB] ][39]\n[ [URSOHELP TAB] ][40]\n[ [TOSIGRA-M TAB] ][41]\n[ [WONON (2)] ][42]\n[ [YOCLAV TAB] ][43]\n[ [YOFLIN AX] ][44]\n\n### Latest Products\n* [Aceper-Cold][45]\n  \n  COMPOSITION: Aceclofenac Paracetamol Phenylephrine HCL, Cetirizine HCL & Caffeine Tablets\n* [Clarpax][46]\n  \n  COMPOSITION: Clarithromycin Oral Suspension\n* [Clausigerm][47]\n  \n  COMPOSITION: Bacillus clausii Spores Suspension\n* [Crin