Healthcare is a leading pharmaceutical company offering best-in-class PCD Pharma Franchise opportunities across Chandigarh and all states of India. ### Get Price List Now [cf7sr-recaptcha] What is 8 + 7 ? [[Refresh icon][Refreshing captcha]][28] Answer for 8 + 7 “Pax Healthcare lies under Top PCD Pharma Companies in Chandigarh” “Pax Healthcare believes in transparency to make our channel partners satisfied” “WHO & GMP Certified Products for PCD Pharma Franchise.” “Free Prodomotions tools and Monopoly Rights” “Pax Healthcare” Believe in Leadership through focused approach ## Product Categories Pax Healthcare is a leading PCD pharma company committed to offering a wide variety of pharma products to target various health segments. Our pharma products meet the pharmaceutical standards and other quality or packaging standards. [ [Home] #### Tablet Range ][29] [ [Home] #### Capsule Range ][30] [ [Home] #### Syrups Range ][31] [See All !][32] ## Our Products Our PCD pharma product list covers multiple dosage forms, including tablets, capsules, syrups, dry syrups, injectable, topical medications, and powders. This gives our franchisee ample choice to choose their preferred products for a PCD pharma franchise in India. [ [OTIGOOD EAR DROP] ][33] [ [POLO 200] ][34] [ [PELWASH] ][35] [ [NEPA S] ][36] [ [VOVILEP GEL] ][37] [ [POLP MZ] ][38] [ [RELAX-CP TAB] ][39] [ [URSOHELP TAB] ][40] [ [TOSIGRA-M TAB] ][41] [ [WONON (2)] ][42] [ [YOCLAV TAB] ][43] [ [YOFLIN AX] ][44] ### Latest Products * [Aceper-Cold][45] COMPOSITION: Aceclofenac Paracetamol Phenylephrine HCL, Cetirizine HCL & Caffeine Tablets * [Clarpax][46] COMPOSITION: Clarithromycin Oral Suspension * [Clausigerm][47] COMPOSITION: Bacillus clausii Spores Suspension * [Crinux-O LB][48] COMPOSITION: Cefixime & Ofloxacin & Lactic Acid Bacillus Tablets * [Dermirose][49] COMPOSITION: Evening Primrose Oil Softgel Capsules 1000 mg * [Lezopax][50] COMPOSITION: Linezolid Tablets IP 600 mg * [Ongul-Plus][51] COMPOSITION: Simethicone & Magaldrate Oral Suspension IP * [Pax-Good][52] COMPOSITION: Myo Inositol D-chiro-inositol Berberine Hydrochloride Grape Seed Extract Chromium Picolinate L-Methylfolate & Vitamin D3 Tablets * [Paxnom 9G][53] COMPOSITION: Green Tea Extract Ginseng Extract Ginkgo Biloba Extract Grape Seed Extract Garlic Extract Ginger Extract Guggul Extract Omega-3 Fatty Acid Vitamins Minerals & Antioxidant Softgel Capsules * [Pelcin-DS][54] COMPOSITION: Paracetamol Paediatric Oral Suspension IP * [Perox-CV][55] COMPOSITION: Cefuroxime with Potassium Clavulanate Tablets IP 625 mg * [P-Worm][56] COMPOSITION: Albendazole Oral Suspension IP * [Silopax-8][57] COMPOSITION: Silodosin Capsules 8 mg * [Uti-Not][58] COMPOSITION: D-Mannose & Cranberry Extract Suspension ## Partner With Pax Healthcare to Scale Up Your PCD Pharma Franchise Pax Healthcare has gained the status of a top PCD pharma franchise company with a strong emphasis on mutual benefits. We have built a strong network of PCD franchises across India, allowing our franchisees to leverage the already established brand image. * We have our own 4 manufacturing Units in Baddi and J & K Naming ( DM Pharma Pvt Ltd., Rainbow Humancare Pvt Ltd., Vinca LifeSciences & DM Pharma (Jammu)). * We are doing Export in Nepal, Afghanistan & Australia. * Third Party Manufacturing for big MNC's. * We are managing more then 1500+ Direct and Indirect distribution channel partners/+associate in all divisions. * We have quick delivery to our channel. [award] “Pax Healthcare gives you Monopoly Rights in your Area forgetting best results” “Pax Healthcare carries Best Pharma Franchise in India” “Pax Healthcare provide you full support to our channel partner for his growth in respective area by providing Promotion Material like (Original physician sample, M.R Bags, Visual aids, Order books, General reminder cards, Etc.)” ## Our Divisions [dm] [Edward Young Labs Logo] [Davis Morgan Labs Logo] [Aden Healthcare Logo] [Acinom Healthcare Logo] [John Walter Labs Logo] ## **Our Pharma Ecosystem Ensuring Safety and Quality ** At Pax Healthcare, we have a dedicated ecosystem comprising well-developed infrastructure and machinery to ensure compliance with stringent quality assurance and quality control norms. Our team of quality experts operates according to Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs) to deliver a wide range of pharmaceutical products. The compliance with quality norms also give a competitive edge to our pharma products for PCD pharma franchise in India. Here is a quick list of quality measures followed by our quality experts for more credibility among pharma distributors. * Adhere to strict GMP (Good Manufacturing Practices) guidelines. * Ensure consistent product quality through rigorous testing. * Maintain compliance with regulatory standards (FDA, EMA, etc.). * Implement robust quality control and assurance protocols. * Use high-quality raw materials from approved suppliers. * Conduct regular audits and inspections. * Invest in advanced manufacturing technologies. ## **Why Choose Pax Healthcare for Your PCD Pharma Frachise in India?** When it comes to the PCD Pharma business, Pax Healthcare stands out as a trusted name, thanks to our nationwide network of satisfied associates. We provide exceptional support to our partners, helping them grow alongside us. If you’re a pharma professional looking to start your own business, partnering with an established company like Pax Healthcare is the ideal choice. Benefits of Partnering With Pax Healthcare: * Access to a diverse portfolio of high-quality medicines. * Run your business independently in your region. * Benefit from our established reputation and marketing expertise. * Secure distribution and promotional rights for your territory. [ Read More ! ][59] ### Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) ##### 1. What is a PCD pharma franchise? A PCD pharma franchise is a business model where a pharma company grants monopoly rights to distribute its products in a specific region. It includes marketing support, brand promotion, and profit-sharing. ##### 2. Why choose Pax Healthcare for a pharma franchise? Pax Healthcare offers high-quality medicines, competitive pricing, strong brand recognition, and excellent marketing support. We provide monopoly rights, attractive margins, and a wide product range. ##### 3. What is the investment required to start a PCD franchise with Pax Healthcare? The investment varies based on the product range and territory. We offer flexible investment options with low startup costs and high-profit margins. ##### 4. Do I need a medical background to partner with Pax Healthcare? No, a medical background is not mandatory. However, basic knowledge of the pharma industry and good distribution networks are beneficial. ##### 5. What kind of support does Pax Healthcare provide to franchise partners? We provide marketing materials, MR (Medical Representative) support, product training, legal approvals, and promotional strategies to help you grow your business. ##### 6. Can I operate in an already allotted territory? No, we offer exclusive franchise rights for unoccupied territories to avoid competition and ensure maximum profitability for our partners. ##### 7. How do I apply for a PCD franchise with Pax Healthcare? Fill out the inquiry form on our website or contact us directly. Our team will guide you through the documentation and onboarding process. ##### 8. What are the profit margins in a PCD pharma franchise? Profit margins vary but typically range between 20% - 40%, depending on product demand and order volume. [logo pax] A WHO-GMP certified Company offering laboratory tested pharmaceuticals products. We are ISO 9001:2008 certified Company & received UDYOG PATRA AWARD. * [Quality] * [GMP] * [WHO] ### Get Price List Now [cf7sr-recaptcha] What is 3 x 6 ? [[Refresh icon][Refreshing captcha]][60] Answer for 3 x 6 #### Short links * [Home][61] * [About Company][62] * [Franchise Business][63] * [Products Category][64] * [N