          "page_text": "[ Select your country ][1] [ [To the frontpage] ][2] Log In Rewards Program Webshop Shopping Cart ### Search for ### Search Results Close ## Please Select your Country * [International][3] * [Belgium][4] * [Czech Republic][5] * [China][6] * [Denmark][7] * [Estonia][8] * [France][9] * [Finland][10] * [Germany][11] * [Hungary][12] * [Ireland][13] * [Italy][14] * [Latvia][15] * [Lithuania][16] * [Netherlands][17] * [Norway][18] * [Poland][19] * [Portugal][20] * [Romania][21] * [Spain][22] * [Sweden][23] * [Thailand][24] * [United Kingdom][25] * [United States][26] * [Vietnam][27] Looking for our international site or our international shop? They have moved here: International site: [www pharmanord.eu][28] International shop: [shop.pharmanord.eu][29] Log In Country [Home][30] [Products][31] [News][32] [Rewards Program][33] [Partnerships][34] [About Pharma Nord][35] ## Selected products [More products][36] ## Featured news [More news][37] [[Weight-loss products are popular — but don’t forget your nutrients] ][38][ ## Weight-loss products are popular — but don’t forget your nutrients ][39][ Medications like GLP-1 receptor agonists (including popular weight-loss injections such as Ozempic) have helped millions of people lose weight and improve blood sugar control ][40] [Read more][41] [[This is why the Original CoQ10 is different from the copy products] ][42][ ## This is why the Original CoQ10 is different from the copy products ][43][ The first commercial CoQ10 formulation that was introduced by Pharma Nord in the 1980s is now regarded as the official benchmark of quality worldwide. It was the first CoQ10 supplement with documented absorption and soon became the preferred choice for clinical trials. This is why it is often referred to as the Original CoQ10 formulation. ][44] [Read more][45] [[Not all CoQ10 is Created Equal] ][46][ ## Not all CoQ10 is Created Equal ][47][ If you want to make sure you get all the benefits from a daily supplement of CoQ10 you may want to choose the Original CoQ10 used in the major scientific studies. ][48] [Read more][49] [[The History of CoQ10 Investigation at Pharma Nord - read more]][50] ## The History of CoQ10 Investigation Pharma Nord is inextricably linked to the exploration of coenzyme Q10. Read about our involvement in CoQ10 research over the years. [Read more][51] ## Signup for our Newsletter ## Health News - and receive the latest knowledge about health and preventive medicine. [Card Image] ## Research Pharma Nord's research department is always at the forefront of the latest nutritional knowledge from home and abroad. Scientific studies and articles are carefully registered and cataloged in the industry's largest research database, which to date contains more than 10,000 scientific studies. [READ MORE][52] [Card Image] ## Careers in Pharma Nord With production and administration in Denmark and sales in more than 40 countries, Pharma Nord offers exciting career opportunities in many different areas. See here which vacancies we currently have posted. [READ MORE][53] [Card Image] ## About Pharma Nord Pharma Nord is one of Europe's leading companies within products with essential nutrients. We develop, produce and market nutritional supplements and medicines with an emphasis on high absorbability, safety and documentation. [READ MORE][54] [[The history of Selenium research - get the book here]][55] [1]: https://www.pharmanord.eu/ [2]: https://www.pharmanord.com [3]: http://www.pharmanord.eu [4]: http://www.pharmanord.be [5]: http://www.pharmanord.cz [6]: http://www.pharmanord.cn [7]: https://www.pharmanord.dk [8]: http://www.pharmanord.ee [9]: http://www.pharmanord.fr [10]: http://www.pharmanord.fi [11]: http://www.pharmanord.de [12]: http://www.pharmanord.hu [13]: http://www.pharmanord.ie [14]: http://www.pharmanord.it [15]: http://www.pharmanord.lv [16]: http://www.pharmanord.lt [17]: http://www.pharmanord.nl [18]: http://www.pharmanord.no [19]: http://www.pharmanord.pl [20]: http://www.pharmanord.pt [21]: http://www.pharmanord.ro [22]: http://www.pharmanord.es [23]: http://www.pharmanord.se [24]: http://www.pharmanordsea.co.th [25]: http://www.pharmanord.co.uk [26]: https://www.pharmanord.com [27]: https://www.pharmanord.vn [28]: http://www.pharmanord.eu [29]: http://shop.pharmanord.eu [30]: / [31]: /us-products [32]: /news [33]: /rewards-program [34]: /contentServlet/pid1039336.html [35]: /us-about-pharma-nord [36]: /us-products [37]: /news [38]: /news/glp-1-medications-vitamin-d-why-nutrient-support-matters-pharma-nord [39]: /news/glp-1-medications-vitamin-d-why-nutrient-support-matters-pharma-nord [40]: /news/glp-1-medications-vitamin-d-why-nutrient-support-matters-pharma-nord [41]: /news/glp-1-medications-vitamin-d-why-nutrient-support-matters-pharma-nord [42]: /news/this-is-why-the-original-coq10-is-different-from-the-copy-products [43]: /news/this-is-why-the-original-coq10-is-different-from-the-copy-products [44]: /news/this-is-why-the-original-coq10-is-different-from-the-copy-products [45]: /news/this-is-why-the-original-coq10-is-different-from-the-copy-products [46]: /news/not-all-coq10-is-created-equal [47]: /news/not-all-coq10-is-created-equal [48]: /news/not-all-coq10-is-created-equal [49]: /news/not-all-coq10-is-created-equal [50]: https://www.pharmanord.com/history-coenzyme-Q10-research [51]: https://www.pharmanord.com/history-coenzyme-Q10-research [52]: /us-research [53]: /careers-in-pharma-nord [54]: /us-about-pharma-nord [55]: history-of-selenium-research",
