              "summary": "* [ Skip to Content ][1]\n* [ Accessibility Statement ][2]\n[ [Pharmavite] ][3]\n* [News][4]\n* [Brands][5]\n* [Trust][6]\n* [Company][7]\n* [Career][8]\n* [Contact][9]\nSearch Toggle Search\nToggle Navigation\n[Great Place to Work Certified]\nSearch Search\n* [News][10]\n* [Brands][11]\n* [Trust][12]\n* [Company][13]\n* [Career][14]\n* [Contact][15]\n\n# Bringing the gift of health\n# to life\n\nYour health matters. That's why we're here. For more than 50 years, Pharmavite has been committed to\nwellness. What we do is more than producing vitamins -- it's about making real nutrition and good\nhealth within reach for all.\n\n[Our Promise][16]\n\n## People first, purpose driven\n* [ Wellness you can believe in\n  ][17]\n* [ Tackling menopause & women’s health\n  ][18]\n* [ Purpose-driven work at Pharmavite\n  ][19]\n* [ Facilities in the USA\n  ][20]\n\n## #1 pharmacist- recommended vitamin & supplement brand¹\n\nNature Made / MegaFood / Bonafide / Uqora / Equelle\n\nHere for you at every stage of life\n* 1971\n  \n  founded in San Fernando, CA\n* #1\n  \n  pharmacist-recommended brand in multiple product segments²\n* 200+\n  \n  products with\n  USP verification\n\n[ Support your wellness with Nature Made ][21] [ All Products → ][22]\n\n## Harnessing the power of plants to nurture people and the planet\n\nNature Made / MegaFood / Bonafide / Uqora / Equelle\n\nHigh-quality and passionately produced products for adults and kids\n* 1973\n  \n  MegaFood\n  launched\n* $1.2M\n  \n  given in sponsorships, cash, and in-kind donations\n* $3M\n  \n  spent directly on\n  organic\n  ingredients\n\n[ Uncover the Power of Plants ][23] [ All Products → ][24]\n\n## Advanced solutions that target PMS and menopausal symptoms\n\nNature Made / MegaFood / Bonafide / Uqora / Equelle\n\nExclusively formulated, powerful and hormone-free\n* 2022\n  \n  launched the annual State of Menopause Report\n* 35\n  \n  clinical trials conducted with more than 13,000 women\n* 1000s\n  \n  of doctors have placed their trust in Bonafide.\n\n[ Discover the Bonafide Difference ][25] [ All Products → ][26]\n\n## Urinary tract support is finally within reach\n\nNature Made / MegaFood / Bonafide / Uqora / Equelle\n\nCreated first-hand by people who have experienced UTI discomfort\n* 80-90%³\n  \n  of UTIs are due to E.coli\n* 3-part\n  \n  proactive regimen supports urinary health at all angles\n* 35,000+\n  \n  customer reviews\n\n[ Get Ahead with Uqora ][27] [ All Products → ][28]\n\n## Menopause has\n## met its match\n\nNature Made / MegaFood / Bonafide / Uqora / Equelle\n\nHormone-free² multi-symptom menopause relief supplement\n* 2019\n  \n  Equelle is introduced in the United States\n* 200,000\n  \n  women trust Equelle for menopause relief\n* 20\n  \n  years of\n  extensive\n  research\n\n[ Explore Equelle ][29] [ All Products → ][30]\n\n## The gift of health is worth sharing\n* [ [Nature Made® Tops U.S. News & World Report Best OTC Medicine & Health Products 2026 Rankings\n  with More No. 1 Products Than Any Other Brand]\n  Brand News\n  \n  ### Nature Made® Tops U.S. News & World Report Best OTC…\n  \n  Nature Made was Named the No. 1 Vitamin Brand by U.S. News & World Report and Recognized Across a\n  Total…\n  ][31]\n* [ [Pharmavite Earns 2026 Great Place To Work® Certification™]\n  Talent & Culture\n  \n  ### Pharmavite Earns 2026 Great Place To Work® Certification™\n  \n  77% of employees rank Pharmavite as a great workplace – 20 points higher than the average U.S.\n  company Pharmavite is…\n  ][32]\n* [ [Uqora® Launches Cutting-Edge Urinary Health Products at Target]\n  Brand News\n  \n  ### Uqora® Launches Cutting-Edge Urinary Health Products at Target\n  \n  Retail expansion broadens omnichannel footprint, as Uqora seeks to empower more women with\n  proactive, science-backed solutions for urinary and bladder…\n  ][33]\n* [ [Nature Made® Continues Expansion of its Gut Health Offerings with the Launch of SuperGreens and\n  Digestive Enzymes]\n  Brand News\n  \n  ### Nature Made® Continues Expansion of its Gut Health Offerings with…\n  \n  As consumer interest in greens and digestive support continues to grow, Na"
            }
