          "page_text": "* [ Skip to Content ][1] * [ Accessibility Statement ][2] [ [Pharmavite] ][3] * [News][4] * [Brands][5] * [Trust][6] * [Company][7] * [Career][8] * [Contact][9] Search Toggle Search Toggle Navigation [Great Place to Work Certified] Search Search * [News][10] * [Brands][11] * [Trust][12] * [Company][13] * [Career][14] * [Contact][15] # Bringing the gift of health # to life Your health matters. That's why we're here. For more than 50 years, Pharmavite has been committed to wellness. What we do is more than producing vitamins -- it's about making real nutrition and good health within reach for all. [Our Promise][16] ## People first, purpose driven * [ Wellness you can believe in ][17] * [ Tackling menopause & women’s health ][18] * [ Purpose-driven work at Pharmavite ][19] * [ Facilities in the USA ][20] ## #1 pharmacist- recommended vitamin & supplement brand¹ Nature Made / MegaFood / Bonafide / Uqora / Equelle Here for you at every stage of life * 1971 founded in San Fernando, CA * #1 pharmacist-recommended brand in multiple product segments² * 200+ products with USP verification [ Support your wellness with Nature Made ][21] [ All Products → ][22] ## Harnessing the power of plants to nurture people and the planet Nature Made / MegaFood / Bonafide / Uqora / Equelle High-quality and passionately produced products for adults and kids * 1973 MegaFood launched * $1.2M given in sponsorships, cash, and in-kind donations * $3M spent directly on organic ingredients [ Uncover the Power of Plants ][23] [ All Products → ][24] ## Advanced solutions that target PMS and menopausal symptoms Nature Made / MegaFood / Bonafide / Uqora / Equelle Exclusively formulated, powerful and hormone-free * 2022 launched the annual State of Menopause Report * 35 clinical trials conducted with more than 13,000 women * 1000s of doctors have placed their trust in Bonafide. [ Discover the Bonafide Difference ][25] [ All Products → ][26] ## Urinary tract support is finally within reach Nature Made / MegaFood / Bonafide / Uqora / Equelle Created first-hand by people who have experienced UTI discomfort * 80-90%³ of UTIs are due to E.coli * 3-part proactive regimen supports urinary health at all angles * 35,000+ customer reviews [ Get Ahead with Uqora ][27] [ All Products → ][28] ## Menopause has ## met its match Nature Made / MegaFood / Bonafide / Uqora / Equelle Hormone-free² multi-symptom menopause relief supplement * 2019 Equelle is introduced in the United States * 200,000 women trust Equelle for menopause relief * 20 years of extensive research [ Explore Equelle ][29] [ All Products → ][30] ## The gift of health is worth sharing * [ [Nature Made® Tops U.S. News & World Report Best OTC Medicine & Health Products 2026 Rankings with More No. 1 Products Than Any Other Brand] Brand News ### Nature Made® Tops U.S. News & World Report Best OTC… Nature Made was Named the No. 1 Vitamin Brand by U.S. News & World Report and Recognized Across a Total… ][31] * [ [Pharmavite Earns 2026 Great Place To Work® Certification™] Talent & Culture ### Pharmavite Earns 2026 Great Place To Work® Certification™ 77% of employees rank Pharmavite as a great workplace – 20 points higher than the average U.S. company Pharmavite is… ][32] * [ [Uqora® Launches Cutting-Edge Urinary Health Products at Target] Brand News ### Uqora® Launches Cutting-Edge Urinary Health Products at Target Retail expansion broadens omnichannel footprint, as Uqora seeks to empower more women with proactive, science-backed solutions for urinary and bladder… ][33] * [ [Nature Made® Continues Expansion of its Gut Health Offerings with the Launch of SuperGreens and Digestive Enzymes] Brand News ### Nature Made® Continues Expansion of its Gut Health Offerings with… As consumer interest in greens and digestive support continues to grow, Nature Made is introducing an approachable and accessible line… ][34] * [ [Bonafide® Health Launches Noctera™ – A Novel, Hormone-Free Supplement Designed to Impro