          "page_text": "The store will not work correctly when cookies are disabled. **JavaScript seems to be disabled in your browser.** For the best experience on our site, be sure to turn on Javascript in your browser. ***New PRO Academy: Evidence-driven education in nutritional medicine. ***[***Sign up today!***][1] Toggle Nav [Shop our brands][2] [ Skip to Content][3] * [Sign In][4] * [Create Account][5] [Customer Menu][6] Toggle Nav [Consumer Site][7] [My Cart ][8] [ Open a practitioner account today!][9] * [ Shop Products ][10] * [Health Categories][11] * [Blood Sugar Support][12] * [Bone & Musculoskeletal Health][13] * [Cardiovascular Health][14] * [Cellular Health & Longevity][15] * [Children's Formulas][16] * [Cognitive Health][17] * [Energy & Fatigue][18] * [Fish Oils & Omegas][19] * [Gastrointestinal Health][20] * [Hormone Support][21] * [Immune Support][22] * [Liver & Detoxification][23] * [Men's Formulas][24] * [Mental Health & Stress Support][25] * [Multivitamins][26] * [Sleep Support][27] * [Vision Support][28] * [Vitamins & Minerals][29] * [Weight Management][30] * [Women's Formulas][31] [ Quick Order ][32] [ All Products ][33] [ Products A-Z ][34] [ Bestsellers ][35] [ New ][36] [ Surplus Offers ][37] [ Discontinued Products ][38] * [ Pure Difference ][39] * [What Makes Us Different][40] * [Quality at Our Core][41] * [Process Transparency][42] * [Committed to Science][43] * [Pure Values][44] * [Sustainability][45] * [Partnerships][46] * [ Education ][47] * [Education][48] * [Event Calendar][49] * [On-Demand Learning][50] * [Meet Our Experts][51] * [Pure Exclusives][52] * [Clinical Protocols][53] * [Pharmacy Support][54] * [PRO Academy][55] * [ Practitioner Resources ][56] * [Tools for Your Practice][57] * [Resources for Your Practice][58] * [PureInsight™][59] * [Research Publications][60] * [Drug-Nutrient Interactions][61] * [Virtual Dispensary][62] * [ Virtual Dispensary ][63] * [Pure Patient Direct][64] * [Patients][65] * [Practitioners][66] **Select Store** Atrium Brands [Consumer Site][67] **Search** **Search** Search Press Return to search Search Search [Account][68] # Pure Goodness at Our Core ## The Pure Difference. High-quality supplements backed by science & FREE FROM unnecessary additives and many common allergens. [Shop Now][69] ## What’s New Blog ### Ashwagandha and Women's Libido: Supporting Sexual Wellness Beyond Desire [Read More][70] Protocol ### Women's Libido & Sexual Wellness Protocol^{‡} This protocol includes recommendations to support foundational health and focused interventions to address common clinical objectives related to women's libido and sexual wellness.^{‡} [View Here][71] Webinar ### [The Science of Female Desire][72] * Wednesday, September 16, 2026 @ 4:00pm ET * Presented by: Betsy Greenleaf, DO, FACOOG, FACOG, FPMRS, FAAOPM, MBA^{+} ^{+}Dr. Greenleaf is a paid consultant for Pure Encapsulations. [Register Now][73] Featured Product ### [FemiVive][74] For women seeking support for libido and sexual function^{‡} [Shop Now][75] ## What Makes Us Different ### Pure Difference What makes us different is the promise of goodness that goes into every one of our supplements. Our supplement formulations are developed in collaboration with our nutritional experts and made with only **high-quality ingredients** sourced from **trusted suppliers**. We then carefully manufacture and test them to ensure they are **FREE FROM** unnecessary additives and many common allergens. We take high standards seriously, which is why we’re the **#1 most recommended professional supplement brand by healthcare professionals**.¹ [Learn More][76] ### New PureInsight™ PureInsight™, the next evolution of our PureGenomics® platform, uses powerful, clinical tools to help healthcare providers easily create prioritized and personalized diet, exercise, lifestyle and supplement recommendations. PureInsight™ delivers more flexibility as DNA data is optional. Patients can quickly fill out our new Multi-Symptom Questionnaire and healthcare providers can glean additional insights when their patients fill out validated questionnaires such as the GAD-7, the PHQ-9, and the PSS-4. [Learn More][77] ### Virtual Dispensary Our virtual dispensary, **Pure Patient Direct**, gives you and your patients access to over 400 unique products available only through Pure Encapsulations. The best part – this is a **FREE service** to all Pure account holders, allowing you to reduce in-office inventory, monitor patient orders and simplify sales. [Learn More][78] ### Drug-Nutrient Interaction Checker Unlike other **Drug-Nutrient Interaction** checkers, we provide a unique experience by **reducing noise** and **delivering clinically relevant interactions** that can happen in real life, occur at typical doses and affect the body in a significant way. Instantly receive information on **potential interactions or depletions** between your patients’ medications, vitamins, minerals, herbs and more. [Learn More][79] ### Pure Difference What makes us different is the promise of goodness that goes into every one of our supplements. Our supplement formulations are developed in collaboration with our nutritional experts and made with only **high-quality ingredients** sourced from **trusted suppliers**. We then carefully manufacture and test them to ensure they are **FREE FROM** unnecessary additives and many common allergens. We take high standards seriously, which is why we’re the **#1 most recommended professional supplement brand by healthcare professionals.**.¹ [Learn More][80] ### New PureInsight™ PureInsight™, the next evolution of our PureGenomics® platform, uses powerful, clinical tools to help healthcare providers easily create prioritized and personalized diet, exercise, lifestyle and supplement recommendations. PureInsight™ delivers more flexibility as DNA data is optional. Patients can quickly fill out our new Multi-Symptom Questionnaire and healthcare providers can glean additional insights when their patients fill out validated questionnaires such as the GAD-7, the PHQ-9, and the PSS-4. [Learn More][81] ### Virtual Dispensary Our **new** virtual dispensary, **Pure Patient Direct**, gives you and your patients access to over 400 unique products available only through Pure Encapsulations. The best part – this is a **FREE service** to all Pure account holders, allowing you to reduce in-office inventory, monitor patient orders and simplify sales. [Learn More][82] ### Drug-Nutrient Interaction Checker Unlike other **Drug-Nutrient Interaction** checkers, we provide a unique experience by **reducing noise** and **delivering clinically relevant interactions** that can happen in real life, occur at typical doses and affect the body in a significant way. Instantly receive information on **potential interactions or depletions** between your patients’ medications, vitamins, minerals, herbs and more. [Learn More][83] ## Stay up to date on education, resources and exclusive savings from Pure Encapsulations Back To Top * [Contact Us][84] * [Customer Service][85] * [Return Policy][86] * [FAQs][87] * [Global Partners][88] * [Accessibility][89] * [Legal Disclaimer][90] * [Privacy Policy][91] * [Website Terms of Use][92] * [Pure Encapsulations Terms of Sale][93] * [Health Data Notice][94] * [Minimum Advertised Price Policy][95] * [Authorized Reseller Terms & Conditions][96] * [Sitemap][97] * [Your Privacy Choices][98] **Let’s get connected!** Stay up to date on education, resources and exclusive savings from Pure Encapsulations 1. Among U.S. healthcare professionals surveyed who recommend specific professional supplement brands; Nutrition Business Journal^{®} Practitioner Survey 2016, 2020, 2023 2. Among brands surveyed, Nutrition Business Journal^{®} 2016, 2020; Kaiser Associates 2014 ^{‡}These statements have not been evaluated by the Food & Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease. ^{†}Provides weight management support as part of a healthy lifestyle with a reduced calorie diet and regular exercise. ^{††}Visit PureEncapsulationsPro.com/quality for more information on our GMO policy. The information contained herein is for informational purposes only and does not establish a doctor-patient relationship. ^Authorized Resellers earn profit from reselling Pure Encapsulations products to consumers. [Your Privacy Choices][99] Pure Encapsulations is a registered trademark. [1]: https://www.pureencapsulationspro.com/pro-academy [2]: # [3]: #contentarea [4]: https://www.pureencapsulationspro.com/customer/account/login/referer/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cucHVyZWVuY2 Fwc3VsYXRpb25zcHJvLmNvbS8~/ [5]: https://www.pureencapsulationspro.com/customer/account/create/ [6]: https://www.pureencapsulationspro.com/customer/account/ [7]: https://pureforyou.com/ [8]: https://www.pureencapsulationspro.com/customer/account/login [9]: https://www.pureencapsulationspro.com/practitioner-account/ [10]: /our-products/all-products.html [11]: /our-products/health-categories.html [12]: https://www.pureencapsulationspro.com/our-products/health-categories/blood-sugar-support.html [13]: https://www.pureencapsulationspro.com/our-products/health-categories/bone-and-musculoskeletal- health.html [14]: https://www.pureencapsulationspro.com/our-products/health-categories/heart-metabolism.html [15]: https://www.pureencapsulationspro.com/our-products/health-categories/cellular-health-and-longe vity.html [16]: https://www.pureencapsulationspro.com/our-products/health-categories/childrens-formulas.html [17]: https://www.pureencapsulationspro.com/our-products/health-categories/brain-and-memory.html [18]: https://www.pureencapsulationspro.com/our-products/health-categories/energy-fatigue.html [19]: https://www.pureencapsulationspro.com/our-products/health-categories/fish-oils-omegas.html [20]: https://www.pureencapsulationspro.com/our-products/health-categories/gastrointestinal.html [21]: https://www.pureencapsulationspro.com/our-products/health