enefits diagram on a white background]][96] [[Comparison chart of 'The Purity Super Pill' versus plain multivitamin, popular fish oil brand, and basic krill oil brand on a purple background.]][97] [[The Purity Super Pill supplement facts label with detailed nutritional information on a white background.]][98] + Quick add The Purity Super Pill™ Elite Multi + Krill & Fish Oil + CoQ10 $̶7̶9̶.̶9̶5̶ $53.57 [ MyBiotin® Growth+™ ][99] New Release [[Purity products bottle of My Biotin Growth+ supplement on a white background.]][100] [[Purity Products My Biotin Growth+ Hair supplement capsule with text highlighting its benefits on a white background.]][101] [[MyBiotin® Growth+™]][102] [[Wooden hairbrush with hair strands on a wooden surface, text 'HELPS REDUCE THE APPEARANCE OF SHEDDING'.]][103] [[Woman with glowing hair strands, featuring Serevelle and Lustriva logos. After using the Purity Products My Biotin Growth+ Hair supplements. ]][104] [[MyBiotin® Growth+™]][105] [[Table comparing hair growth products to the Purity products My Biotin Growth+ with capsules on a white background.]][106] [[Graph showing hair density improvement with Purity Products MyBiotin Growth+ compared to a placebo on a yellow background.]][107] + Quick add MyBiotin® Growth+™ Advanced Hair Growth & Thickness Formula $̶4̶9̶.̶0̶0̶ $32.83 [ Focus5D™ Melts ][108] New Release [[Purity Products Focus5D Melts supplement container on a white background.]][109] [[Purity Products Focus5D Melts blue and white pill with motivational text on a textured white background.]][110] [[Purity Products Focus5D Melts supplement container on a desk with glasses and notebook.]][111] [[Brainberry nature's superberry with scenic background.]][112] [[Bar chart comparing focus improvement between placebo and 65 mg BRAINBERRY supplement over 0-6 weeks and 0-12 weeks.]][113] [[Bar chart comparing psychomotor speed between placebo and 65 mg BRAINBERRY supplement over 0-6 weeks and 0-12 weeks.]][114] [[Purity Products Focus5D Melts Supplement label with text and green accents on a white background.]][115] + Quick add Focus5D™ Melts Supports Focus, Memory, & Mental Clarity* $̶3̶9̶.̶9̶5̶ $26.77 [ JointGel® | Mixed Berry ][116] [[Purity Products JointGel Mixed Berry supplement container on a white background.]][117] [[A scoop of Purity Products JointGel Mixed Berry with text highlighting its collagen support on a white background.]][118] [[Hand placing a container of Purity Products JointGel Mixed Berry into a green bag, with text highlighting its clinically studied collagen peptides.]][119] [[Cartilage support over time diagram comparing placebo and the active ingredient in Purity Products JointGel, displayed on a dark green background.]][120] [[Person drinking Purity Products JointGel Mixed berry supplement from a bottle with a green lid against a blurred background.]][121] [[Purity Products JointGel collagen support infographic with collagen powder on a white background, highlighting FORTIGEL bioactive collagen peptides and OptiMSM. On a white background.]][122] [[Supplement facts label for the Purity Products JointGel Mixed berry supplement with nutritional information and usage instructions.]][123] + Quick add JointGel® | Mixed Berry Cartilage Growth Matrix™ Drink $̶5̶9̶.̶9̶5̶ $40.17 [ Flexuron® | Softgels ][124] Bestseller [[Flexuron® | Softgels]][125] [[ Purity Product Flexuron dietary supplement Capsule with text highlighting its benefits on a white background.]][126] [[Bar chart comparing Flexuron, Glucosamine-Chondroitin, and Placebo in achieving optimal joint comfort.]][127] [[Supplement Facts label displaying the detailed ingredient list and usage instructions for the Purity Products Flexuron dietary supplement on a white background.]][128] [[Chart showing differences observed in pill effectiveness over time with Flexuron, Glucosamine & Chondroitin, and Placebo.]][129] + Quick add Flexuron® | Softgels Joint Comfort & Flexibility* $̶3̶9̶.̶9̶5̶ $26.77 [ MagBlue® ][130] Bestseller [[Purity Products MagBlue dietary supplement bottle on a white background.]][131] [[Purity Products MagBlue capsule pill on a white background with text about its benefits.]][132] [[Close-up of a man with a Purity Products MagBlue pill in his mouth.]][133] [[Hand holding blueberries with a bowl in the background, branded with 'PurityBlue Organic Blueberries'.]][134] [[Comparison chart showing Purity Products MagBlue vs. Ordinary Magnesium with a blue background.]][135] [[Supplement Facts label displaying detailed nutritional information for the Purity Products MagBlue dietary supplement on a white background.]][136] [[Purity Products MagBlue capsules with text about magnesium, vitamin D, zinc, and boron on a white background.]][137] + Quick add MagBlue® Daytime Power/Nighttime Recovery $̶3̶9̶.̶9̶5̶ $26.77 Previous Next Introducing MyBiotin® Growth+™ ## More Growth. Less Shedding. Powered by Dual-Pathway Technology™ — Lustriva® & Serevelle™, clinically studied ingredients that work together to support: * **Thicker, denser hair** - Lustriva® delivers 40x more soluble biotin for thicker, denser hair in as little as 3 weeks* * **Hold onto more hair **- Serevelle™, a clinically studied saw palmetto extract, helps reduce shedding and promote DHT metabolism* * **Works both ways at once** - so more of what grows in, stays in [Start Now][138] ## Purely Obsessed ## Target Your Wellness Goals [ Mobility ][139][ Hair & Skin ][140][ Heart & Vessels ][141][ Brain & Focus ][142][ Immunity ][143][ Mood & Sleep ][144][ Gut Health ][145][ Metabolism & Weight ][146][ Energy & Strength ][147] Previous Next ## Available at Trusted Retailers ## The Purity Difference For over 33 years, Purity Products has crafted science-backed formulas to support your body. Every ingredient is tested and every formula refined — so you can trust what’s inside. From energy and immunity to joints and hair, we make it simple to feel your best. [Discover][148] Relentless innovation. Clinically validated research