 leading pharmacies, health stores and\ndoctors. Ascendis Consumer Brands (Pty) Ltd © 2024. All Rights Reserved [Terms & Conditions][24] |\n[Dis-Chem Win A Car – Competition T&C’s ][25] | [Privacy Policy][26]\n\nWe are using cookies to give you the best experience on our website.\n\nYou can find out more about which cookies we are using or switch them off in settings.\n\nAccept\nClose GDPR Cookie Settings\n[SOLAL]\n* Privacy Overview\n* Strictly Necessary Cookies\n[Powered by  GDPR Cookie Compliance][27]\nPrivacy Overview\n\nThis website uses cookies so that we can provide you with the best user experience possible. Cookie\ninformation is stored in your browser and performs functions such as recognising you when you return\nto our website and helping our team to understand which sections of the website you find most\ninteresting and useful.\n\nStrictly Necessary Cookies\n\nStrictly Necessary Cookie should be enabled at all times so that we can save your preferences for\ncookie settings.\n\nEnable or Disable Cookies Enabled Disabled\nEnable All Save Settings\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.facebook.com/solaltech\n[3]: https://instagram.com/solal_sa?igshid=13ufawbiez7yl\n[4]: https://www.solal.co.za/vitamins-minerals/\n[5]: https://www.solal.co.za/skincare/\n[6]: https://www.solal.co.za/features/\n[7]: https://your.solal.co.za/\n[8]: https://www.solal.co.za/about/\n[9]: https://www.solal.co.za/contact/\n[10]: https://www.solal.co.za/vitamins-minerals/\n[11]: https://www.solal.co.za/skincare/\n[12]: https://www.solal.co.za/features/\n[13]: https://your.solal.co.za/\n[14]: https://www.solal.co.za/about/\n[15]: https://www.solal.co.za/contact/\n[16]: https://your.solal.co.za/\n[17]: https://www.solal.co.za/skincare/\n[18]: https://your.solal.co.za/\n[19]: https://www.solal.co.za/features/\n[20]: mailto:healthinfo@ascendishealth.com.\n[21]: https://www.solal.co.za/vitamins-minerals/\n[22]: https://www.facebook.com/solaltech\n[23]: https://instagram.com/solal_sa?igshid=