          "page_text": "Necesitas activar javascript en tu navegador para poder ver esta página [soria@sorianatural.es][1] [ [Logo Soria Natural] ][2] * [Soria Natural][3] * [About us][4] * [Our history][5] * [Research and innovation][6] * [Our seal of quality][7] * [Products][8] * [Find us][9] * [Blog][10] * [Work with us][11] [ Search][12] * [EN][13] * [Español][14] * [English][15] * [Portugês][16] [ [Logo Soria Natural] ][17] [ [Logo Soria Natural] ][18] * [Soria Natural][19] * [About us][20] * [Our history][21] * [Research and innovation][22] * [Our seal of quality][23] * [Products][24] * [Find us][25] * [Blog][26] * [Work with us][27] * [es][28] * [en][29] * [pt][30] * [[Contacto]][31] ## Best-selling products * [CIRCUVEN COMPOSOR SN SP.jpg] ##### Circuven Composor 40 Blood circulation & tired legs support * [fost-print-plus-soria-natural.jpg] ##### Fost Print Plus A shot of instant energy * [MELATONINA GOTAS.jpg] ##### Melatonin drops Helps sleeping naturally * [08422947100612_001.jpg] ##### Tensivel Capsules The heart's ally * [probiast-capsulas-soria-natural.jpg] ##### Probiast Diarrhea * [ASWAGANDHA COMPRIMIDOS SN SP.jpg] ##### Ashwagandha tablets Balance and performance * [rompepiedras_extracto_soria_natural.jpg] ##### Pepperwort Extract Kidney stones support * [drenavit-jarabe-soria-natural-1] * [08422947080594_001.jpg] ##### OREGANO essential oil Origanum vulgare L. * [08422947511203_002.jpg] ##### Hemp seed veggie burger 100 % vegetable and organic * [08422947800741_001.jpg] ##### Potato chips With organic extra virgin olive oil ### Our essence is nature Our identity is rooted in nature. We work our fields to obtain the highest quality medicinal plants. We cultivate more than half a thousand hectares of organic crops according to the guidelines of biodynamic agriculture, achieving the maximum therapeutic benefit from each species. ### Good work, good health We are certified with prestigious seals to guarantee that we are working well in order to achieve good health. Our experience of almost four decades elaborating natural products is complemented by our eagerness to achieve maximum effectiveness and the best quality for well-being. ### The perfect blend of tradition and science A combination of the most ancient wisdom with the latest scientific advances. We enhance the botanical richness that nature bring us to help us take care of our health by adding scientific and technological research and medical knowledge. We are pioneers in the development of natural solutions. [Healing plants][32] [Sustainability][33] [Purity][34] [Commitment and confidence][35] [Natural solutions][36] [Planta Interactiva] [Healing plants][37] [Sustainability][38] [Purity][39] [Commitment and confidence][40] [Natural solutions][41] ## Love for plants Soria natural is the result of passion for Natural Medicine felt by its founder Antonio Esteban since he was a child. From his enthusiasm sprouted a company that today is a reference in health care and wellness. [Read more][42] [PORTADA BLOG QV OTOÑO_INVIERNO 2025-26 (1).jpg] 2025-10-23 [ See all ][43] #### [ Find all the latest news in our magazine Qualitas Vitae][44] Health tips, healthy cooking, healthy lifestyle, trends... Get it for free in your herbal shop, parapharmacy, ecocenter or local store, or download it [here][45]. [Enciclopedia de Plantas] 2026-09/10 [ Encyclopaedia of Plants ][46] #### Find all about medicinal plants Find detailed information in our Encyclopaedia of Plants. More than 200 references of phytotherapy that will bring you to discover their properties, uses and curiosities. [portada_volver a la rutina.jpg] 2026-08-26 [ Well-being ][47] #### [ Recharge your Energy, Nurture your Mitochondria ][48] Do you feel like being at a standstill in your daily life? Focusing has become difficult and apathy is all you feel? Maybe, what your body lacks is “fuel”. The key to a good physical and mental stats, as well as to a good recovery, is how your mitochondria works. [Logo Soria Natural] We are very close to you, in Garray, just a few kilometers from Soria. Find us at: La Sacea, s/n. 42162 GARRAY. [+34 975 25 20 46][49] | [soria@sorianatural.es][50] Copyright. Soria Natural. All rights Reserved. #### About us * [All about us][51] * [Our history][52] * [Research and innovation][53] * [Our seal of quality][54] #### [Find us][55] #### Our products * [Food Supplements and Phytotherapy][56] * [Food][57] * [Pets][58] #### [Blog][59] #### [Encyclopaedia of Plants][60] #### [Qualitas Vitae][61] #### Legal * [Legal notice][62] * [Privacy policy][63] * [Cookies policy][64] * [Whistleblowing channel][65] #### [Training][66] #### [Work with us][67] * [About us][68] * [All about us][69] * [Our history][70] * [Research and innovation][71] * [Our seal of quality][72] * [Find us][73] * [Blog][74] * [Encyclopaedia of Plants][75] * [Qualitas Vitae][76] * [Legal][77] * [Legal notice][78] * [Privacy policy ][79] * [Cookies policy][80] * [Training][81] * [Work with us][82] [Newsletter] **Subscribe to our Newsletter** * [[Contacto]][83] * [][84] * [][85] * [][86] * [][87] * [][88] * [][89] * [[App]][90] [1]: mailto:soria@sorianatural.es [2]: https://www.sorianatural.com/en [3]: https://www.sorianatural.com/en/quienes-somos [4]: https://www.sorianatural.com/en/quienes-somos [5]: https://www.sorianatural.com/en/historia [6]: https://www.sorianatural.com/en/investigacion-e-innovacion [7]: https://www.sorianatural.com/en/sello-de-calidad [8]: https://www.sorianatural.com/en/productos [9]: https://www.sorianatural.com/en/encuentranos [10]: https://www.sorianatural.com/en/blog [11]: https://www.sorianatural.com/en/trabaja-con-nosotros [12]: [13]: [14]: https://www.sorianatural.com [15]: https://www.sorianatural.com/en [16]: https://www.sorianatural.com/pt [17]: https://www.sorianatural.com/en [18]: https://www.sorianatural.com/en [19]: https://www.sorianatural.com/en/quienes-somos [20]: https://www.sorianatural.com/en/quienes-somos [21]: https://www.sorianatural.com/