              "summary": "[Skip to main content][1]\n\n**Thorne now accepts FSA/HSA funds via **[**Truemed**][2]**!**\n\n[[Thorne logo]][3]\n* [Shop ][4]\n* [Get Started ][5]\n* [Take 5 Daily ][6]\n* [Help ][7]\nResults available\n[ Sign In ][8]\n[[Thorne logo]][9]\nResults available\n* [Shop ][10]\n* [Get Started ][11]\n* [Take 5 Daily ][12]\n* [Help ][13]\n[ Sign In ][14]\n\nPerformance,\n\nproven.\n\nElevate your routine with clinically formulated,\n\nNSF Certified for Sport® supplements in precision dosages.\n\n[Shop Sports Performance][15]\n\nScience is personal\n\nYour health journey is as unique as you are. Build a routine that fits your goals.\n\n[[Man drinking water from transparent Thorne bottle]\n\n### Men’s Health\n\n][16]\n\nThe difference is in our details\n\nScience over hype\n\nBuilt on researched ingredients and purposeful formulations – not trends, shortcuts, or empty\nperformance claims.\n\nQuality you can verify\n\nFrom sourcing to finished products, our standards are designed to support purity, potency, and label\naccuracy.\n\nRigor in every step\n\nSetting the standard for proof – with testing that helps ensure what’s on the label is what’s in\nevery serving.\n\nTrusted at every level\n\nChosen by elite athletes, practitioners, trainers, and those who leave guesswork out of their\nsupplement routine.\n\nWhat belongs in my routine?\n\nAsk Taia for supplement recommendations that support how you train, recover, and live.\n\nHi, I'm Taia.\n\nAsk me anything – I’m here to help!\n\n[Start a conversation][17]\n[[Thorne shaker bottle with jar of advanced pre-workout on bench]][18]\n\nTrain on what you trust\n\nExplore NSF Certified for Sport® supplements built to support hydration, recovery, and daily\nperformance – inside and outside the gym.*\n\n[Shop NSF Certified for Sport®][19]\n\n## Trusted by 100+ professional \n## and U.S. National teams\n\nUnrivaled\n\nUFC\nTeam Penske\n[USA Triathlon]\nUSA Triathlon\n\nPreparation:\n\nAdvanced Pre-Workout\n\nNot just a jolt of energy. A clinically informed pre-workout built to support focus, endurance, and\nsustained training output.* NSF Certified for Sport®\n\n[Shop Advanced Pre-Workout][20]\n[[jar of advanced pre-workout on orange background]][21]\n[[Bag of daily electrolytes]][22]\n\nGame Time:\nDaily Electrolytes\n\nHydration powers performance. Replenish five essential electrolytes lost in sweat to support\nhydration, recovery, and endurance.* Zero sugar. NSF Certified for Sport®\n\n[Shop Daily Electrolytes][23]\n\nRecovery:\n\nPlant Protein\n\nRecovery is part of the work. Support muscle repair and daily protein intake with plant-based\nnutrition that fits your routine.* NSF Certified for Sport®\n\n[Shop Plant Protein][24]\n[[bottle of chocolate plant protein]][25]\n\n## FAQ\n\n### What makes Thorne supplements high quality?\n\nThorne is committed to producing high-quality supplements through rigorous testing, selective and\nwell-researched ingredient sourcing, and strict manufacturing standards. We avoid unnecessary\nadditives, binders, and fillers that may interfere with nutrient absorption. To confirm the purity\nof our ingredients, the potency of our formulas, and the absence of all contaminants, we carry out a\nminimum of four rounds of testing on every product we manufacture. What’s more, our manufacturing\nand warehouse facilities are inspected and certified by independent, third-party organizations,\nensuring compliance with current Good Manufacturing Practices (cGMP). You can read more about\nThorne’s unparalleled quality standards here: https://www.thorne.com/quality.\n\n### Are Thorne supplements clinically tested and safe?\n\nThorne partners with clinical researchers and conducts clinical trials to support the efficacy of\nour ingredients and products. Our team of doctors and medical experts substantiate each ingredient\nin every formula we manufacture based on extensive clinical research and medical literature. At any\ngiven time, numerous Thorne products are being tested in clinical trials around the world. Our\ncollaborations with independent researchers help us understand supplement interactions in the bod"
            }
          },
          "page_text": "[Skip to main content][1] **Thorne now accepts FSA/HSA funds via **[**Truemed**][2]**!** [[Thorne logo]][3] * [Shop ][4] * [Get Started ][5] * [Take 5 Daily ][6] * [Help ][7] Results available [ Sign In ][8] [[Thorne logo]][9] Results available * [Shop ][10] * [Get Started ][11] * [Take 5 Daily ][12] * [Help ][13] [ Sign In ][14] Performance, proven. Elevate your routine with clinically formulated, NSF Certified for Sport® supplements in precision dosages. [Shop Sports Performance][15] Science is personal Your health journey is as unique as you are. Build a routine that fits your goals. [[Man drinking water from transparent Thorne bottle] ### Men’s Health ][16] The difference is in our details Science over hype Built on researched ingredients and purposeful formulations – not trends, shortcuts, or empty performance claims. Quality you can verify From sourcing to finished products, our standards are designed to support purity, potency, and label accuracy. Rigor in every step Setting the standard for proof – with testing that helps ensure what’s on the label is what’s in every serving. Trusted at every level Chosen by elite athletes, practitioners, trainers, and those who leave guesswork out of their supplement routine. What belongs in my routine? Ask Taia for supplement recommendations that support how you train, recover, and live. Hi, I'm Taia. Ask me anything – I’m here to help! [Start a conversation][17] [[Thorne shaker bottle with jar of advanced pre-workout on bench]][18] Train on what you trust Explore NSF Certified for Sport® supplements built to support hydration, recovery, and daily performance – inside and outside the gym.* [Shop NSF Certified for Sport®][19] ## Trusted by 100+ professional ## and U.S. National teams Unrivaled UFC Team Penske [USA Triathlon] USA Triathlon Preparation: Advanced Pre-Workout Not just a jolt of energy. A clinically informed pre-workout built to support focus, endurance, and sustained training output.* NSF Certified for Sport® [Shop Advanced Pre-Workout][20] [[jar of advanced pre-workout on orange background]][21] [[Bag of daily electrolytes]][22] Game Time: Daily Electrolytes Hydration powers performance. Replenish five essential electrolytes lost in sweat to support hydration, recovery, and endurance.* Zero sugar. NSF Certified for Sport® [Shop Daily Electrolytes][23] Recovery: Plant Protein Recovery is part of the work. Support muscle repair and daily protein intake with plant-based nutrition that fits your routine.* NSF Certified for Sport® [Shop Plant Protein][24] [[bottle of chocolate plant protein]][25] ## FAQ ### What makes Thorne supplements high quality? Thorne is committed to producing high-quality supplements through rigorous testing, selective and well-researched ingredient sourcing, and strict manufacturing standards. We avoid unnecessary additives, binders, and fillers that may interfere with nutrient absorption. To confirm the purity of our ingredients, the potency of our formulas, and the absence of all contaminants, we carry out a minimum of four rounds of testing on every product we manufacture. What’s more, our manufacturing and warehouse facilities are inspected and certified by independent, third-party organizations, ensuring compliance with current Good Manufacturing Practices (cGMP). You can read more about Thorne’s unparalleled quality standards here: https://www.thorne.com/quality. ### Are Thorne supplements clinically tested and safe? Thorne partners with clinical researchers and conducts clinical trials to support the efficacy of our ingredients and products. Our team of doctors and medical experts substantiate each ingredient in every formula we manufacture based on extensive clinical research and medical literature. At any given time, numerous Thorne products are being tested in clinical trials around the world. Our collaborations with independent researchers help us understand supplement interactions in the body while exploring new potential for our formulas. We invest in clinical research to pursue ever higher standards for supplement safety and efficacy. ### Why are Thorne products more expensive than other supplements? When it comes to the health of our customers, we never settle for “good enough.” Thorne’s products may be priced higher than some other supplements because of our commitment to quality at every step. We don’t simply meet the standard for excellence in dietary supplements – we set the standard. In addition to our ingredient sourcing and strict manufacturing standards, we invest in rigorous testing in our state-of-the-art in-house laboratories and in third-party certifications. Our commitment to quality at every level contributes to the overall value and reliability of our products for your health. ### Where are Thorne supplements made and where are the ingredients sourced from? Located in Summerville, South Carolina, Thorne manufactures supplements in the USA using globally sourced ingredients. When it comes to ingredient sourcing, we seek out only the highest-quality ingredients, selecting each one for its purity and effectiveness. We maintain oversight of each ingredient’s origin, providing us complete supply chain transparency. Some ingredients are derived from natural sources, some are fermented, and others are synthesized to be bio-identical and highly absorbable. Learn more about the ingredients we use here: https://www.thorne.com/ingredients Certified quality Manufacturing excellence Thorne has an exemplary record of compliance with standards set by the FDA. Trusted certification Thorne’s campus is certified by NSF, the “gold standard” for quality in dietary supplements. Global recognition Thorne has an A rating from Australia’s TGA, the toughest regulatory agency in the world. GRMA certified GRMA recognizes companies that go beyond the minimum requirements for good manufacturing practices. [Thorne logo] ### About * [Who We Are][26] * [Our Team][27] * [Newsroom][28] * [Awards][29] * [Collaborations][30] * [Clinical Research][31] * [Careers][32] * [Taia Wellness Advisor][33] ### Learn * [Take 5 Daily][34] * [Health Concerns][35] * [Our Ingredients][36] * [Our Manufacturing Process][37] * [Wellness Guides][38] * [NSF Certified Supplements][39] ### Community * [Professional Tools][40] * [Thorne Partners][41] * [Thorne Ambassadors][42] * [Sports Performance][43] * [Military/First Responder][44] ### Support * [Contact Us][45] * [Order Tracking][46] * [FAQs][47] * [Returns][48] * [Rewards][49] * [Quick Order][50] * [Subscriptions][51] * [Pay with HSA/FSA][52] ### Need help * [Visit Help Center][53] * [support@thorne.com][54] * [1 800 228 1966][55] [ Download our iOS app ][56] ### Wellness delivered to your inbox Sign up for Thorne emails Email Address ### © Thorne. All rights reserved. * [Terms][57] * [Privacy][58] * [Consumer Health Data Privacy][59] * [Proposition 65][60] * [Accessibility][61] * These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. [1]: #main [2]: /partners/truemed [3]: / [4]: /products [5]: /get-started [6]: /take-5-daily [7]: /faqs [8]: /login?returnTo=%2F [9]: / [10]: /products [11]: /get-started [12]: /take-5-daily [13]: /faqs [14]: /login?returnTo=%2F [15]: https://www.thorne.com/products/by-health-need/sports-performance [16]: /products/by-health-need/men's-health [17]: /featured/taia?open_chat=true [18]: /products/set/nsf-certified-for-sport-products [19]: /products/set/nsf-certified-for-sport-products [20]: /products/dp/advanced-pre-workout-rainbow-sherbet-flavor [21]: /products/dp/advanced-pre-workout-rainbow-sherbet-flavor [22]: /products/set/daily-electrolytes [23]: /products/set/daily-electrolytes [24]: /products/dp/plant-protein-chocolate-flavored [25]: /products/dp/plant-protein-chocolate-flavored [26]: /who-we-are [27]: /company/leadership [28]: /company/press [29]: /company/awards [30]: /company/strategic-collaborations [31]: /company/clinical-research [32]: /company/careers [33]: /featured/taia [34]: /take-5-daily [35]: /health-concerns [36]: /ingredients [37]: /quality [38]: /wellness-guides [39]: /nsf-certified-for-sport [40]: /affiliate [41]: /partners [42]: /ambassador [43]: /sports-performance [44]: /govx [45]: /contacts [46]: /orders/tracking [47]: /faqs [48]: /faqs/returns-and-exchanges [49]: /rewards [50]: /quick-order [51]: /login [52]: /partners/truemed [53]: /contacts [54]: mailto:support@thorne.com [55]: tel:18002281966 [56]: https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/thorne-research/id1101310862 [57]: /terms-of-use [58]: https://privacy.thorne.com/privacy-policy [59]: /terms/consumer-health-data-privacy-policy [60]: /prop-65 [61]: /accessibility",
