              "summary": "# It's time to feel great\n\nFeel better than you’ve felt in years—without having to rely on willpower.\n\n[Learn more][1]\n\n## \n\n## Featured products\n\n[\n\nBalance\n\n][2]\n[\n\nUnimate\n\n][3]\n[\n\nFeel Great\n\n][4]\n[Shop All Products][5]\n\n## Bringing you optimal metabolic health\n\nAs The Health Intervention Company, Unicity designs and develops innovative nutritional products\nthat make healthy living doable in an on-the-go world.\n\n[A journey of discovery for Unicity International ]\n\n## A journey of\n\n## discovery\n\nUnicity began as one product, but it has since become a thriving global movement that promotes good\nhealth and wellness for millions. While Unicity has grown, our purpose—Make Life Better—has remained\nthe same.\n\n[\n**See more of our story**\n][6]\n\n## Real solutions\n\n## for your health\n\nWith manufacturing sites and warehouses strategically placed around the world, Unicity is dedicated\nto creating high-quality products that promote optimal health and wellness for everyone.\n\n[****][7]**[Browse all products][8]**\n[Pouring Unicity's Unimate into cup]\n[Supported by science - Unicity International]\n\n## Supported by\n\n## science\n\nUnicity believes in creating innovative products that are based on science. This belief has led to\nvarious clinical studies, reputable certifications, US patents, promotions by scientific journals\nand studies, and more.\n\n[\n\n**Explore Unicity Science**\n\n][9]\n\n## Changing lives worldwide\n\n[Changing lives worldwide main image]\n[quote icon]\n\nFeel Great curbs my evening cravings and I’ve already lost 3 kg in a month. Perfect for my busy\nschedule.\n\n— **Priya Sharma, Mumbai**\n\nAfter Feel Great, my energy levels are up and I feel motivated even after long work hours.\n\n— **Rohit Verma, Bengaluru**\n\nFeel Great keeps me light and active, even after enjoying heavy Indian meals. Love how it fits my\nlifestyle.\n\n— **Ananya Gupta, Delhi**\n\n**Our Customer-Centric Policy**\n\nUnicity is committed to the highest standards of ethics and integrity. We take immense care to\nensure that our customers and associates are not misled by any claims related to our products or\nbusiness opportunity. We take all complaints seriously, and any concerns related to our products or\nbusiness practices are addressed promptly. If you have faced, or know someone who has faced, any\nsuch issues, we encourage you to reach out to us. You may contact our Grievance Cell at 1800 102\n2467. We are deeply focused on customer satisfaction and offer a customer-centric refund policy\ndesigned to ensure a positive experience for every customer.\n\n## #Unicity\n\nUse #Unicity and share your journey to healthy living on your social feed.\n\n[ ][10] [ ][11] [ ][12] [ ][13]\n\n## Join our team\n\nThe joy of success is even sweeter when you're helping people live their healthiest lives. Share\nwhat you love to help us Make Life Better.\n\n[Learn more][14]\n[Unicity Logo]\n[[instagram]][15] [[YouTube]][16]\n**About Unicity**\n[Our company][17][Leadership][18][Our story][19][Opportunity][20][Unicity science][21][Research &\ndevelopment][22]\n**Shop**\n[All products][23][Feel Great][24]\n**Connect**\n[Contact][25][Blog][26]\n\n© 2025 Copyright Unicity International, Inc. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][27]\n\n|\n\n[Terms of Use][28]\n\n[1]: https://ufeelgreat.com\n[2]: https://shop2.unicity.com/ind/en/product/balance?sku=28387\n[3]: https://shop2.unicity.com/ind/en/product/unimate?sku=34415\n[4]: https://ufeelgreat.com/ind/en/product/feel-great?focus=true&sku=34805\n[5]: https://shop2.unicity.com/ind/en/products\n[6]: /ind/en/learn/history\n[7]: https://shop.unicity.com\n[8]: https://shop2.unicity.com/ind/en/products\n[9]: https://www.unicityscience.org/\n[10]: https://www.instagram.com/p/DITlPCrO9kI/?img_index=1\n[11]: https://www.instagram.com/p/DCja0GjOkkW/?img_index=1\n[12]: https://www.instagram.com/p/C-ILM5toepP/\n[13]: https://www.instagram.com/p