tic ][47] [[Safe & Effective Soothing amora to help transition from playtime to bedtime]][48] [ ### Children’s Gentle Bedtime Spray ][49] ## Explore Articles from the Zarbee’s Hive [Learn More[Right > icon]][50] [[Buzzy smilling]][51] [[Buzzy]][52] ## Inspired by Nature. Backed by Science. Father and pediatrician Dr. Zak Zarbock created Zarbee’s with simple, curated ingredients inspired by nature and backed by science. His philosophy and care for people and planet live in every product we make. * Simply Made. Effective & Soothing * No Artificial Flavors or Dyes * Always Free of Drugs and Alcohol [Our Story[Right > icon]][53] [Zarbee's logo] **Adjust Your Cookie Settings** Whoops! This form is unavailable because of your cookie settings. Go to the Cookies Settings and turn on functional cookies to signup. ## Sign Up for Zarbee's^{®} Emails for Coupons & Savings Sign Up and Save Up to $5 When You Get The Hive Delivered Right To Your Inbox. I am a resident of Nevada or Washington state The information you submit will be governed by our [Privacy Notice][54] and you agree to the [Financial Incentive Notice][55]. CLAIM MY COUPON Products * [All Products][56] * [Where to Buy][57] * [Coupons + Savings][58] Company * [About Zarbee's^{®}][59] * [Contact Us][60] * [For Professionals][61] Learn & Recipes * [All Articles][62] * [All Recipes][63] Legal * [Legal Notice][64] * [Privacy Notice][65] * [Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][66] * [Limit the Use of my Sensitive Personal Information][67] * [Consumer Health Data Privacy Notice][68] * [AdChoices][69] * Cookies Settings ^{©} Zarbee’s, Inc. 2026. All rights reserved. This site is published by Zarbee’s, Inc., which is solely responsible for its contents. This website is intended for visitors from the U.S. This site contains links to websites to which our Privacy Notice does not apply. We encourage you to read the Privacy Notice of every website you visit. *** These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and D